<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Bɛkwyel</book>
  <para style="rem">Une partie de ce livre est tirée des livrets SGM fait à Brazzaville en août 2003 et la majeure partie a été ébauchée par le Pasteur GARYZAS Mersone Etienne en 2016 et vérifier à Ouesso en mai 2017, par le conseiller KEITH Beavon ̺de la SIL.</para>
  <para style="rem">Copyright Information: For any non-Paratext use of this text, permission must be obtained from the copyright holder.</para>
  <para style="h">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luk</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Tyɛ wat nɛ Matye, Luk baazodu tɔ Ekwyala bɛ ɛ, ɛzel ɛ wat nɛ Malak:</para>
  <para style="ip">Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛkoobal Yezu ze. Zaŋ eeduu Yezu Zɛɛb (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3.1-20</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Bhii tak, Satan naawa Yezu é mɛbhowal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3.21–4.13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Yezu nadi ɛ́ mot kyee dik Ghalile, pɛ nyɛ nakan ɛlyo nɛ ɛtsik ɛ membel ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4.14–9.50</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Yɛ ɛpekaada dáa Yezu nazɛdus Ghalile tɔ́ pɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:28">9.51–19.28</ref></char>). Tin, Luk naabaakɛl bɛtɛ nɛ etɛp kɔ yɛ Malak nakaada ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ dáa, kana ɛ mot Samaali na mbɛɛ lyem, kana wo mot ekum, kana mɔn nadiib, da nyɛ ɛ́ belaa ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ ɛtɔ́ ɛ Yezu pɛ daa Maat nɛ Maali.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛsa ɛ Yezu pɛ Yeluzalɛm (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:29-21:38">19.29–21.38</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Yɛ ɛpebaakaa mezuk ɛ Yezu nɛ ɛsyee ɛ lɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 22-23">22–23</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mak kɛsi ɛ́ nɛ dwoo ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24">24</ref></char>), pɛ ye di elyaal dáa Yezu nakɛlyaal bot ɛ lwoma bɛ bɛbá nyel pɛ ze Emayus ɛ, ɛsok nɛ nyɛ nɛ byet tɔ pɛ ɛko.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luk nakan ɛkaada ɛ dáa nyɛ nasa zii é ɛsɛɛga, étɛp ɛgu ɛnyɔɛpe etɛp djas Yezu nasa ɛ́ nɛ etɛp ee nyɛ nalii ɛ. Tin, nyɛ naakaada bɛtɛ nɛ etɛp dum nɛ ɛbyel ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot, zɛnɔɔ yɛ Yezu. Nyɛ nakaada ɛ́ dáa fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ nalyaal Zakaali nɛ Maali nyel ɛ, dáa ye nadhaa é sok Elizabhɛt nɛ Maali nabya ɛ, dáa Maali, Zakaali zɛnɔɔ Simeyɔŋ naduwal Zɛɛb nɛ djeeb ɛ, dáa Yezu nalik tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa nyɛ dinaa dhɔma ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1-3">1–3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ye baakaada ɛ́, ɛtɔ́ ɛ Yezu pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Tɔ ɛlaŋel ɛlak, Luk nakaada kana dhiiti mot na mbɛɛ lyem dɛl ɛ Samaali, kana mot ekum, kana mɔn nawo ɔ. Zɛnɔɔ edhiiti etɛp, tyee yɛ Maat nɛ Maali, bot ɛ namyaal náá, Yezu sulal pɛ daa lɔɔ ɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:35-15:32">10.35–15.32</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Tɔ etɛp bak djas, Luk nadi ekwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ ghwyil nɛ mɛbwala ɛ Yezu. Nyɛ baalyaal ɛ náá, Yezu nadus ɛ́ pɛ daa Zɛɛb, nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot mbyak Yisalaɛl, nyɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ étɛp bot ɛ membyak djas. Nyɛ baakwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ, dáa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl bot ɛ di ebeeaa é mis toto ɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ mot dáa Elizabhɛt, mot nadi kwyiid moma ɔ, bɛmbaalel ɛ etaa, nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ lɔɔg tak.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luk nakwyɛl ɛ́ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ daa bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ di náá, tɔ bɛmɛkana mɛná mɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal di kwyala ɛ, yɛ nabɛ ɛ́ etɛp bot ɛ di ààgu etsi e bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl aalaa yɛ ɔ. Nyɛ nakwyal deenek ɛ́, étɛp bɛ neegu ɛsuk ɛ duma ɛ Yezu, bɛ neemyaal náá, nyɛ ɛ́ Mɛtsik-bot étɛp bot ɛ bɔs djas.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mɛ tak kaada ɛ etɛp bak:</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛlaŋel <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1.1-4</ref></char>: Ɛsuk ɛ Ekwyala bak;</para>
  <para style="io1">mɛlaŋel <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1.5–2.52</ref></char>: Ɛbyel ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nɛ yɛ Yezu, zɛnɔɔ edhɔma bɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="io1">ɛlaŋel <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3.1-20</ref></char>: Mɛsa ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot;</para>
  <para style="io1">mɛlaŋel <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3.21–4.13</ref></char>: Ɛduwa Yezu naduwa Zɛɛb ɛ, nɛ mɛbhowal mɛ;</para>
  <para style="io1">mɛlaŋel <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4.14–9.50</ref></char>: Mɛsa ɛ Yezu pɛ Ghalile;</para>
  <para style="io1">mɛlaŋel <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9.51–19.27</ref></char>: Yezu eedus pɛ Ghalile tɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm;</para>
  <para style="io1">mɛlaŋel <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19.28–23.56</ref></char>: Yenga mɛsik ɛ Yezu pɛ Yeluzalɛm, mezuk mɛ nɛ ɛsyee ɛ lɛ;</para>
  <para style="io1">ɛlaŋel <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24.1-53</ref></char>: Yezu eegom, nyɛ eelyaal bot nyel, nyɛ eebyet tɔ gwoo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Luk ɛpelyaal ɛsuk ɛ Ekwyala bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Dhaandiŋaa Teofil, dáa ye nabɛ náá, bot ɛbuɛpe naakwyɛl ɛkaada tɔ mɛkana etɛp ee nadhaa pak'ena ɛ, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />nɛ dáa bot ɛ nabee nɛ mis mɔɔ met tyee etɛp bak djas nadi esael ɛ, nakaadaa bis é mɛkɛn ɛ. Bot ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ moo bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Bhii mɛ nazedu etɛp tak kɛkum pɛ mɛsuk mɛ tak ɛ, mɛ ɛ́ booke náá, ye goka ɛ́ náá, mam pe, mɛ kaada wɔ etɛp bak djas tɔ Ekwyala, wɔy kukuma Teofil. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Mɛ sa deenek ɛ́, étɛp wɔ neegu etsɛɛtsɛ e mɛlyo mɛ wɔ nabela ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fofop ngɔt ɛpelɛɛ bhaadal dum nɛ ɛbyel ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />É ghɛŋ Eelood nadi mɛkoozi mɛ kyee dik Yude ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti ghaa-Zɛɛb, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Zakaali. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ sama ɛdhuu ɛ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nadi tɔ lɔɔg ɛ Abiya ɔ. Myɛl nabɛ ɛ́ dha ɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb Aalɔn. Din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Elizabhɛt. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Bɔɔ djas bɛbá nadi ɛ́ bot ɛ epiki é mis ɛ Zɛɛb. Bɛ nadi eduwal nɛ ɛkɛ tyee etsi nɛ mɛtiŋ ɛ Ghɛŋ di elɛɛ ɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Saabɛgɔs kabɛ ɛ́ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ mɔn. Elizabhɛt nabɛ ɛ́ kwyiid moma, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛbya etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ djas nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ moo bɛtɔa-bot.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Dhiiti dwoo, Zakaali nadi esa mɛsa mɛ yii ghaa-Zɛɛb tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa, etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ yɔbɔ lɔɔg ɛ nadi tɔ mɛsa é dwoo tak. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Bɛ eezɛsa dhiiti ɛgwyeeg tɔ ɛzel ɛ lɔɔ, dáa eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nadi ezezyɛ nɛ ɛsa sok ɛ, étɛp bɛ neesɛ́ɛ mot aani, tɔ́ kɛdik epu e ele na mbɛɛ mɛnuub tɔ Di na Dɛɛ ɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ. Zakaali ɛ́ nasɛ́ɛaa dwoo tak étɛp ɛkɛdik epu ele na mbɛɛ mɛnuub. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Ɛdhuu ɛ bot djas nalelik ɛ́ pɛ kel edjaala é ɛwala ɛ epu ele na mbɛɛ mɛnuub nadi edikaa tɔ Di na Dɛɛ ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Tin, dhiiti fofop ngɔt ɛ Ghɛŋ zokazɛtuula Zakaali zaka. Fofop tak eezɛtyaa tetel pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ mesa-ebuwa di edikaa epu ele na mbɛɛ mɛnuub ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Dáa Zakaali nabee nyɛ ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bwoo nɛ bɛbebwol naamɛt nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />É di'enek, fofop eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Nàdi nɛ bwoo Zakaali, etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb eegwak mendjaala mɔ! Elizabhɛt mwalɔ ɛ́ waabela ɛbum. Nyɛ waabya wɔ mɔn mɔɔ motom. Wɔ aaget mɔn tak ɛ Zaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Wɔ aadi ɛ́ tɔ boo mɛmyaala. Tin, bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ́ waamyaala dum nɛ ɛbyel ɛ lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ aadi ɛ́ boo-mot é mis ɛ Ghɛŋ. Nyɛ aanàdɛ mɛnyok mɛ vin, ààdɛ dɔɔ nɛ kwaambi edhiiti mɛnyok mɛ di edjɛ elangi ɛ. Sisim na Dɛɛ ɛ́ waalwood tɔ lɛ nyɛ dinaa tɔ mɔ nyɛɛg. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Nyɛ waasa náá, bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl ɛbuɛpe bula zɛdum koŋ nɛ Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb'ɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Tin, nyɛ waakɛ sok bhwoob ɛ Ghɛŋ nɛ sisim nɛ eghɛŋ ɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Eli, étɛp nyɛ neebulal ɛgwakel pak bɛsɛɛg nɛ bɔn bɔɔ. Nɛ ɛbaasa náá, bot ɛ di elyel elo ɔ swoola mɛfulu étɛp bɛ needi bot ɛ etsoŋ nɛ epiki.»<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Tin, Zakaali eezɛke nɛ fofop náá: «Mam aagu náá, etɛp ee wɔ di elɛɛ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ dáa? Etɛɛ náá, mɛ moo ɛ́ tɔa-mot. Mwalam pe moo ɛ́ yɛ sil-moma.»<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />É di'enek, fofop ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Din ɛ lam ɛ́ Ghabhiliyɛl. Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ dyeebadi sok bhwoob ɛ Zɛɛb étɛp ɛsa mɛsa mɛ. Nyɛ lwom mɛ ɛ́, mɛ zɛlii nɛ nɔ, mɛ zɛlɛɛ wɔ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal'enek. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Deenek, wɔ ààpamyaal etɛp ee mɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ, sonok bɛ náá, etɛp tak ɛ́ waasɛ́ɛ é ɛwala ɛ Zɛɛb zekoobal ɛ. Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, wɔ aadi ɛ́ bubu. Wɔ aanàkwaabaalii, kana dwoo mos kɛkum dwoo esesɛ́ɛ binek djas aasael ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />É di'enek, bot ɛ nazyɛ mendjaala ɔ nadi ebwood Zakaali, bɛ nadi edjoka dáa nyɛ nadi ebɔya tɔ sum Di na Dɛɛ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Tin, dáa nyɛ nakawyis ɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ moo ààkabɛ nɛ tyee nyɛ kalii nɛ nɔɔ. Deenek, bot eezɛgek náá, nyɛ eebee dhiiti djema mɛbwala penek tɔ sum Di na Dɛɛ ɛ Zɛɛb. É di'enek, nyɛ nakalii-lii nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ nɛ egeka dáa bubu, étɛp nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ moo bubu.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Tin, dáa Zakaali nasilal bim mɛlu mɛ nyɛ nagoka nɛ ɛsa mɛsa mɛ tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa Zɛɛb ɛ, nyɛ eezɛsik pɛ dɛl ɛ lɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ba mɛlu bhii tak, Elizabhɛt myɛl eezɛbela ɛbum. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokazɛsɔwa nɛ ɛbum ɛ tak tyee bɛngɔn ɛtɛn tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ. Nyɛ nadi ekeke ɛ́ náá: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Beea sa Ghɛŋ sa dum nɛ nam ɛ, nyɛ eemyaal ɛdis ɛ mɛ tɔ esa ee nadi edjɛ mɛ sen é mis mɛ bot ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fofop ngɔt ɛpelɛɛ bhaadal dum nɛ ɛbyel ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Bhii bɛngɔn ɛtɛn nɛ wat yii ɛbum ɛ Elizabhɛt, Zɛɛb eebaazɛdhis fofop Ghabhiliyɛl pɛ dɛl ɛ Nazalɛt, pɛ kyee dik Ghalile. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Nyɛ nadhis fofop tak ɛ́ pɛ daa mɔɔ moma ngɔt di ààgu botom ɔ, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Maali. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, ghɔɔd motom ngɔt nɛ din ɛ Zozɛf. Zozɛf nabɛ ɛ́ dha ɛ Mɛkoozi Dhavid. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Fofop eezɛtuula nyɛ, swos nyɛ, nyɛy náá: «Dia tɔ mɛmyaala, wɔ eeboma nɛ mbɛɛ bhwoob ɛ Zɛɛb. Ghɛŋ ɛ́ nɛ nɔ lɔɔg.» <figure style="fig" alt="Un ange apparu à Marie" file="WA03801b.tif" size="col" loc="1.28" copy="Graham Wade" ref="1.28">Fofop ngɔt eetuula Maali</figure><verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Maali moo tinaak yooo, edjoka nɛ mbi yenek mɛkpa. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji ɛsuk ɛ yenek mɛswosel. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Fofop ɛ́ bookake nɛ nɛ náá: «Maali, nàbem ba, etɛɛ náá, wɔ eeboma nɛ mbɛɛ bhwoob ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Wɔ waabela ɛbum. Wɔ waabya mɔn mɔɔ motom. Din ɛ wɔ aaget nyɛ ɛ, yɛ aadi ɛ́ Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Nyɛ aaboodi ɛ́ boo-mot, bɛ aadjóo nyɛ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake. Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb ɛ́ waanɛɛg nyɛ mɛkoozi dáa Dhavid bhaab'ɛ nadi ɛ́. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Deenek, nyɛ aadi ɛ́ mɛkoozi kɔ mbyak ɛ Zakɔɔb kɔm-kɔm. Ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ aadi ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ɛsik.» <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maali eezɛke nɛ fofop náá: «Yiizaag aasael dáa? Mam ɛ́ di ààgu botom'aak?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Fofop eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Sisim na Dɛɛ ɛ́ waazyɛ kɔ lɔ. Ghwyil ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake ɛ́ waabutal wɔ. Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, mɔn na dɛɛ wɔ waabya ɔ, nyɛ aadjóoaa ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Dɔɔ nɛ Elizabhɛt mɔn-nyoog ɛ́ waabya ngbɛ mɔn mɔɔ motom, ye nakoozobɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ sil-moma. Nyɛy mot bɛ nadi ekeke náá, nyɛ ɛ́ kwyiid ɔ, ɛbum ɛ lɛ moo mos ɛ́ nɛ bɛngɔn ɛtɛn nɛ wat. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Etɛɛ náá, ye tok nɛ sa Zɛɛb aadi ààkwak.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Tin, Maali zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mam ɛ́ mot-mɛsa ɛ Ghɛŋ. Ye sael nɛ nam dáa mɛkpa mɔ di eke náá, ye sael ɛ.» Bhii tak, fofop eezɛtɔ́ yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maali eetɔ́ kɛbee Elizabhɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Ààbɔya tɔ mɛlu menek deenek, Maali eezɛghɛɛ, tɔ́ kaab pɛ dɛl ɛ mɛtsok nadi pɛ kyee dik Yude ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Nyɛ eezɛni tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ Zakaali, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛswos Elizabhɛt. <figure style="fig" alt="Marie chez Elizabeth" file="CN01609c.tif" size="col" loc="1.40" copy="David C. Cook" ref="1.40">Maali pɛ daa Elizabhɛt</figure><verse eid="LUK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Dáa Elizabhɛt nazogwak-gwakak mɛswosel ɛ Maali ɛ, é di tak wat, wɔ gwaa, mɔn zɛkuu nyɛ tɔ mɔ. É di'enek, Sisim na Dɛɛ eezɛlwood tɔ lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Nyɛ eezɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Zɛɛb eesɛɛ wɔ mɛtel dhaa boa djas kɔ bɔs'ak! Deenek, esɛɛa mɛtel menek ɛ́ dɔɔ nɛ kɔ mɔn wɔ aabya ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Mam ɛ́ yam nwyaa dhiiti vaŋ moma, etɛɛ náá, nyɛɛg ɛ Ghɛŋ'am zyɛ pɛ daa lam? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Etɛɛ náá, ye bɛ ɛ́, wɔ eebee náá, é sok mɛ gwak mɛswosel mɔ ɛ, ye bɛ ɛ́, mɔn eekuu mɛ tɔ mɔ nɛ mɛmyaala. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ nɔ, etɛɛ náá, wɔ eemyaal náá, Ghɛŋ ɛ́ waasa sa nyɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ ɛnyɔɛpe!»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Djeeb ɛ Maali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />É di'enek, Maali eezɛke náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Mɛ ɛpeduwal Ghɛŋ nɛ lyem'am djas.<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Sisim'am ɛ́ pɛ tɔ boo mɛmyaala kɔ ɛsu ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛtsik-bot mam.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ eeliig mis mɛ, gwyák mot-mɛsa mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">mam ààkobɛ yam mot ɛtela ɛ nyel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, kana dwoo lak mos, membu nɛ mesee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">bot aakadjóo mɛ ɛ́ “moma Zɛɛb nazesɛɛ mɛtel ɔ”.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb Mɛkaake eesa eboo esonok tɔ lam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Nyɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb na Dɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Nyɛ nɛ bu enɛm esa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">mɛlu nɛ mɛwala djas dum nɛ bot ɛ di eduwal mɛtiŋ mɛ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Nyɛ eesa mɛsa mɛ mɛbwala nɛ eghɛŋ bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">Nyɛ eetwak bot ɛ di nɛ mɛbet tɔ elyem ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Nyɛ eedis bɛmɛkoozi kɔ mɛbhóó mɛ mɛkoozi mɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">Bhii tak, nyɛ eedjɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ nɛ ɛbet ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">mɛbhóó mɛ mɛkoozi.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Nyɛ eedjɛ bot ɛ nadi nɛ za ɔ ekum.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">Nyɛ eeswaal bɛkum ɛ bot mɛmbɔ mɛ toto.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Nyɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛkwyee Yisalaɛl, mot-mɛsa mɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">Nyɛ ààdjisa ɛlyaal enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />nɛ Abalaam bɛ nɛ bɛdha bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">dáa nyɛ nakɛk bɛbhaab binaka ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Tin, Maali eezɛdi pɛ daa Elizabhɛt tyee bɛngɔn ɛlɛl, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛsik pɛ dɛl ɛ lɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛbyel ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ɛwala nabɛ náá, Elizabhɛt ɛ́ waabya ɔ, yɛ eezɛkum. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛbya mɔn mɔɔ motom. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Bɛsɔ bot ɛ nadi nɛ mendjaa ɛkunaaɛpe nɛ nɛ ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ zokazɛgwak náá, Ghɛŋ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naagek nyɛ ghoŋ. Bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ moo tin tɔ mɛmyaala bɔɔ djas. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Dáa mɔn nabɛ, nyɛ moo nɛ mɛlu mɛtɛn nɛ elɛl bhis ɛbyel ɛ lɛ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛtɔ́ étɛp ɛkɛniigal nyɛ beka. Bɛ nakwyɛl ɛget nyɛ ɛ din ɛ sɛɛg Zakaali. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Tin, nyɛɛg ɛ́ boopɛɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Ààbɛ! Din ɛ lɛ aadi ɛ́ Zaŋ.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />É di'enek, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Deenek, ye tok nɛ mot ngɔt tɔ bot bɔ nadi nɛ din ɛ Zaŋ!» <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Tin, tɔ ɛgek ɛ dáa ebubu di elii ɛ, bɛ eezɛdji sɛɛg mɔn, din ɛ nyɛ nakwyɛl ɛget mɔn'ɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Wɔ gwaa, Zakaali zokazɛwaab náá, bɛ zyɛ nyɛ nɛ mɔɔ pɛt ɛbaya bɛ di ezezyɛ nɛ ɛkwyal kɔ tak ɛ. É di tak, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokakwyal náá: «Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, din ɛ lɛ ɛ́ Zaŋ.» Tin, bɔɔ djas naazɛdjoka ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />É di tak wat, wɔ gwaa, Zakaali zɛbaakan ɛlii ɛnyɔɛpe. Nyɛ moo tin etsim ɛlyelɛpe eduwal Zɛɛb. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />É di'enek, bot djas nadi bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɔ, bɛ nadi ɛ́ bɛ moo nɛ bwoo, pɛ kɔ mɛl mɛ nadi tɔ mɛtsok mɛ kyee dik Yude ɛ. Tin, bot djas nazokakekaada ɛ́ tɛp'enek. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Bot djas nadi egwak dáa tɛp tak nasael ɛ, bɛ moo tin esiiza tɔ ebhum elyem bɔɔ, edji náá: «Mɔn tak aadi zɛ?» Ye nabɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, ghwyil ɛ Ghɛŋ nadi ɛ́ tɔ lɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Djeeb ɛ Zakaali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zakaali, sɛɛg mɔn nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eelwood nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokani egoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ Sisim. Nyɛ nadi ekeke ɛ́ náá:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Mena goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsɛɛ Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb bot ɛ Yisalaɛl mɛtel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ eezɛkwyee bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ, nyɛ eepɛk bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Nyɛ eewyisal mena ghɛŋ mot, Mɛtsik-bot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">pɛ tɔ bɛdha ɛ mɛkoozi Dhavid mot-mɛsa mɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Yɛ ɛ́ etɛp ee nyɛ naloozelɛɛ tɔ enuub e bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb'ɛ, bɛ na edɛɛ ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Nyɛ naakɛk mena tsik di epɛk mena é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ mɛbhuka mena ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">dɔɔ nɛ si mɛko mɛ bot ɛ di esa mena ɛbiyo ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Nyɛ naagék ghoŋ nɛ bɛbhaab benaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjisa ɛbhɛŋ ɛ lɛ na dɛɛ nyɛ nalik ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ ye nabɛ ɛ́, Zɛɛb eetuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ é mis mɛ bhaab'enaka Abalaam náá,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />nyɛ waazɛpɛk mena é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ mɛbhuka mena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">Étɛp mena neesaka mɛsa mɛ, ààbɛ nɛ bwoo tɔ ebhum e elyem bena.<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />Etɛɛ náá, mena needika dɛɛ nɛ piki</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">é mis mɛ, é mɛlu mɛ tsik'ena djas.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Deenek, wɔy mɔn'am, wɔ aadi ɛ́, ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Etɛɛ náá, wɔy ɛ́ kwaakɛ sok bhwoob ɛ Ghɛŋ étɛp wɔ neekoobal mɛze mɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Etɛp wɔ neelɛɛ bot bɛ náá, nyɛ ɛpezyɛ zɛtsik bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">da pel mesyem mɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Tsɛɛtsɛ, Zɛɛb yenabɛlka nɛ bu enɛm esa, nɛ kwyɛl.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">Dusa tɔ gwoo, nyɛ eewyisal kɔ lena gwyɛ tyee wat nɛ mɛkas mɛ gwyes di edjem tɔ mɛlem ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ neewyisal bot ɛ di tɔ ghooghom, nɛ tɔ piyo ɛsyee ɔ, tɔ gwyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">Nyɛ needjɛɛd mɛko mɛ kyeed mena pɛ ze egwyem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.79 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 9:1">Eza 9.1</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Dáa mɔn nadi ewyee ɛ, sisim yɛ nabaadi ewyee ɛbuɛpe. Nyɛ nadidi ɛ́, tɔ kyee dik bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, kɛkum dwoo nyɛ nazɛlyaal bot ɛ Yisalaɛl nyel ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Ɛbyel ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />É ghɛŋ tak, wɔ gwaa, Sezaad Oghust zokazɛlwom bot, bɛ kwyal min mɛ mɛtaŋ mɛ bot ɛ ɛyoŋ Lɔm djas. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Ɛkɛn ɛ ɛlɛɛga nɛ ɛkwyal ɛ min mɛ bot nasael ɛ́ é ghɛŋ Kilinus nadi kukuma dik Siili ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Bot djas nadi etɔ́ kɛkwye-kwyalaa min ɛ, mot nɛ mot pɛ dɛl ɛ lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Zozɛf zokadus pɛ kyee dik Ghalile, pɛ ghaada Nazalɛt, nyɛ neezɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Yude, pɛ dɛl ɛ Bheteleɛm, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ dha ɛ Dhavid. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Nyɛ ɛ́ bootɔ́ pɛ ɛlɛɛga nɛ ekwyala e min bɛ nɛ ghɔɔd'ɛ Maali. Maali nadi ɛ́ nɛ ɛbum.<verse eid="LUK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Dáa bɛ nakadi tin ɛ, wɔ gwaa, ɛwala ɛ nabɛ náá, Maali ɛ́ waasyas ɛ zokazɛkum. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbya mɔn mɔɔ mɛgwyak mɛ. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbét nyɛ ɛghɔɔd, pil nyɛ tɔ bhelangiti, bhii tak nyɛ eezɛkɛl nyɛ kɔ mɔɔ tɛɛg bɛ nadi ekekɛl edee e ebhata ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbela di tɔ ndjaa bɛdjoŋ.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fofop ngɔt eetuula bɛmbaalel ɛ ebhata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />É kyee dik tak wat, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛmbaalel ɛ ebhata, bɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔ bal ebaal ɛsaŋ ɛ ebhata bɔɔ é pum. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Wɔ gwaa, fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ zɛtuula bɛ. Mɛkas ɛ Ghɛŋ naazɛkaal bɛ bweee. Wɔ gwaa, bwoo zɛsa bɛ ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Tinaak, fofop eezɛlɛɛ bɛ náá: «Nàbemka ba, etɛɛ náá, mɛ zyɛ ɛ́, zɛgoola bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, yii bot djas aamyaala nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />É pum'ak mos, kɔ dɛl ɛ Dhavid, Mɛtsik-bot eezebyel étɛp'en. Yɛ ɛ́ Mɛsia, Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Beeka geka bi aagwyak nyɛ nɛ yɛ ɛ: bi ɛ́ waabela mɔɔ tɔlɔɔ wola tɔ bhelangiti, ndjaasi kɔ mɔɔ tɛɛg bɛ di ekɛl edee e ebhata ɛ.»<figure style="fig" alt="Un ange a apparu aux bergers" file="WA03803b.tif" size="col" loc="2.12" copy="Graham Wade" ref="2.8-12">Fofop ngɔt eetuula bɛmbaalel ɛ ebhata</figure><verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />É di'enek wat, wɔ gwaa, bɛtɛ nɛ efofop zokadus tɔ gwoo, zɛsɛɛga nɛ fofop nadi tinaak sok ɔ, bɛ moo tin eduwal Zɛɛb, bɔɔ náá:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Duu nɛ Zɛɛb pɛ ɛko tɔ gwoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">tin, egwyem kɔ bɔs dum nɛ bot ɛ nyɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ!»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛmbaalel ɛ ebhata eetɔ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ Bheteleɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Dáa efofop nalik bɛ, sik pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ, bɛmbaalel ɛ mɛsaa mɛ ebhata zokazɛke pak'ɔɔ náá: «Djhootɔ́ka pɛ Bheteleɛm. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, mena beeka sa tuula penek ɛ, sa Ghɛŋ lyaal menaka ɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Bɛ eezɛghɛɛ mɛnyel tɔ́, tin, bɛ eezɛbela Maali bɛ nɛ Zozɛf, dɔɔ nɛ mɔɔ tɔlɔɔ ndjaasi kɔ mɔɔ tɛɛg bɛ nadi ekekɛl edee e ebhata ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Dáa bɛ nakabee nyɛ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛlɛɛ etɛp ee fofop'enɔk nalɛɛ bɛ dum nɛ mɔn tak ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />É ghɛŋ bot djas nadi egwak mbi etɛp ee bɛmbaalel ɛ mɛsaa mɛ ebhata binek nadi elɛɛ ɛ, bot djas naadyeebadjoka. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Yɛ kabɛ Maali ɔɔ, nyɛ nazobaal etɛp binek djas ɛ́ tɔ bum lyem'ɛ. Tin, nyɛ moo esiiza ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Bhii tak, bɛmbaalel ɛ mɛsaa mɛ ebhata ɛ́ boozɛsik. Bɛ nadi eduwal Zɛɛb, étɛp endem ee bɛ nazebee ɛ, nɛ yii bɛ nazegwak ɛ, nɛ etɛp ee efofop nalɛɛ, nabatasael ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔn getaa din ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Bhii mɛlu mɛtɛn nɛ elɛl mɔn nabyel ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛtɔ́, kɛniigal nyɛ beka, tin, bɛ eezɛget nyɛ din ɛ Yezu, din ɛ fofop nalɛɛ bɛ, ɛsok nɛ nyɛɛg nɛ bela ɛbum ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zozɛf bɛ nɛ Maali eezyɛ nɛ Yezu pɛ Ndjaa-ebuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Tin, ɛwala ɛ ɛdis edhuud, dáa etsi e Moiiz nadi elɛɛ étɛp ɛbyel ɛ mɔn ɛ, yɛ eezɛdjala, deenek, Zozɛf bɛ nɛ Maali eezɛtɔ́ nɛ mɔn pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛtɔ́ nɛ mɔn pɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa Yeluzalɛm étɛp ɛkɛlyaal Ghɛŋ mɔn. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Etɛɛ náá, tɔ etsi ɛ Ghɛŋ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, yɛ eekwyalaa náá: «Mɔn motom, yii mɛgwyak aabyel ɔ, nyɛ aadi ɛ́ ngbɛ Ghɛŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Ɛwy 13.2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char></char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Bɛ nabaadi ɛ́, edjɛ dɔɔ nɛ dhiiti buwa yii etsi e Ghɛŋ di edji ɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́: «Mɛpepak mɛmbá, nɛghu bɔɔ mɛgum mɛmbá<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.24 <char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 12:8">Msa 12.8</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Pɛ Yeluzalɛm, ye nadi ɛ́, nɛ dhiiti mot, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Simɛyɔŋ. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, mot epiki, eduwal Zɛɛb. Nyɛ nadi ebwood mot aazɛtsik Yisalaɛl ɔ. Sisim na Dɛɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ nɛ lɔɔg. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Sisim na Dɛɛ naaloolɛɛ nyɛ náá, ɛsok nɛ nyɛ nɛ gwyɛ, nyɛ waabee Mɛsia Ghɛŋ aadhis ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Wɔ gwaa, Sisim na Dɛɛ zɛdul Simeyɔŋ, nyɛ tɔ́ pɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Bɛbyael ɛ Yezu naazyɛ nɛ mɔn'ɔɔ étɛp ɛzɛsa nyɛ dáa mɛkpa mɛ etsi di elɛɛ ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeyɔŋ ɛ́ boobɛp mɔn tɔ mɛmbɔ mɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛy náá:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Nenak, Ghɛŋ, beta kwom'ɔ, nyɛ gwyɛ tɔ egwyem, tyee wɔ nalɛɛ nyɛ ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Etɛɛ náá, mis mam eezebee tsik wɔ nadhis bis yɛ ɛ,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />tsik wɔ nazekoobal étɛp membyak djas ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Yɛ ɛ́ ngel aasa náá, membyak mɛ sis gu wɔ ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">Yɛ ɛ́ duu bot ɛ mbyak'ɔ, Yisalaɛl<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.32 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Eza 42.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52.10</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii Simeyɔŋ nalɛɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu nabɛ ɛ́, edjoka dáa Simeyɔŋ nadi elii dum nɛ mɔn'ɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simɛyɔŋ ɛ́ boozɛsɛɛ bɛ mɛtel, nyɛ nɛ Maali nyɛɛg náá: «Zɛɛb dhis mɔn'ak ɛ, étɛp ɛkwyesal bot ɛbuɛpe nɛ ɛwyɛl bot ɛbuɛpe pɛ kɔ Yisalaɛl. Nyɛ aadi ɛ́, ndem ngɔt ɛ Zɛɛb. Bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ́ waasyaala bhyeed kɔ lo'ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Tin, nyɛ waalyaal popoopwon egeka ee di syela tɔ ebhum elyem e bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ wɔy Maali ɔɔ, mezuk ɛ́ waatuu wɔ lyem kɛtuula pɛ yii kyee dáa pɛl.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">An, moma nadi ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Ye nabaabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti moma nadi ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. Din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ An. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ɛsyes ɛ Fanuɛl, mot mbyak ɛ Asɛɛd. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eezedyeebageeb. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naadi membu metɛn nɛ ebá, bɛ nɛ ngom naba nyɛ, nyɛ dinaa ààgu botom ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Bhis ɛsyee ɛ ngom, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabaatɔ́ ɛba, kɛkum membu mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ elɛl nɛ membu mená (84). Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdus tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Nyɛ nadidi ɛ́, esa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb mwos nɛ pum, nɛ ɛtsi ɛ edee tɔ mendjaala. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛtuula dwoo tak wat, nyɛ moo tin eduwal Zɛɛb, bhii tak nyɛ moo lii dum nɛ mɔn tɔlɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ nadi ebwood náá, Yeluzalɛm zɛpɛkel é ban ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛsik ɛ Yezu pɛ dɛl ɛ Nazalɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Dáa sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu nasilal ɛsa esesɛɛ djas etsi ɛ Ghɛŋ nadi elɛɛ ɛ, bɛ eezɛsik nɛ nɛ pɛ kyee dik Ghalile pɛ dɛl ɛ lɔɔ, pɛ Nazalɛt. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́, mɔn ewyee nɛ ɛbɛɛ ɛ mis, Zɛɛb naawa tɔ lɛ etsoŋ nɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, nyɛy nɛ membu kam nɛ ebá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Membu djas bɛbyael ɛ Yezu nabɛ ɛ́, etetɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm étɛp ɛkɛbɔl ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Dáa Yezu nabɛ nyɛ moo nɛ membu kam nɛ ebá ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ, dáa ye boodi ezezyɛ nɛ ɛsesɛɛ tɔ mɛfulu mɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Dáa ɛbyoŋ nasi ɛ, bɛ eezɛsik. Ghuna mɔn'ɔɔ Yezu naalik pɛ Yeluzalɛm, tinaak, bɛbyael ɛ Yezu ààgu. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Bɔɔ nadi egek ɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ bɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot tɔ zukamwaa nɛ mot nadi ekɛ lɔɔg wat bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɔ. Tin, bɔɔ zokakɛ tu dwoo. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛkan ɛsaŋ ɛ nyɛ pak bɔn-nyɛɛg bɔɔ, nɛ bɛsɔ bɔɔ bot ɛ nadi é ɛbyoŋ bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Bɔɔ ààbela nyɛ ɛ yenek. Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛsik pɛ Yeluzalɛm esaa nyɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Tin, kuma ye nakum mɛlu mɛlɛl bɔɔ esaa nyɛ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛbela nyɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, ndiindel, bɛlyoel eewa nyɛ kuku ɛbwak, nyɛy egwak bɛ, nɛ ɛbaadji bɛ ekiya. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Bot djas nadi egwak nyɛ ɔ, bɛ nadi edjoka ɛbuɛpe nɛ kwaambi etsoŋ nyɛ nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ, nɛ dáa nyɛ nadi ebɔɔza ekiya bɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Dáa sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg nabee nyɛ ɛ, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛdjoka ɛbuɛpe. Nyɛɛg ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɔn'am, étɛp yé wɔ sa bis deenek? Bhum elyem e bis nɛ soog di ɛ́ pɛ ɛko. Bis eesaa wɔ, saa saa.» <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi saa mɛ étɛp yé? Bi ààgu náá, mɛ ɛ́ tɔ ndjaa Saagam, étɛp ɛsa mɛsa mɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Kabela náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààmɛt ɛsuk ɛ sa nyɛ nadi elii ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛsik nɛ nɛ pɛ Nazalɛt. Nyɛ nadi elooba nɛ nyɛɛg nɛ sɛɛg. Tin, nyɛɛg zokabaal etɛp binek djas tɔ lyem'ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yezu moo tin ewyee nɛ tyɛ, nɛ etsoŋ, nɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ é mis ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ é mis mɛ bot.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, é sok Sezaad Tibɛɛd nadi, nyɛ moo nɛ membu kam nɛ etɛn kɔ bóó ekukuma dik'ɛ ɛ, Pɔɔs Pilat nadi ɛ́ kukuma kyee dik Yude, Eelood kadi ɛ́ ekɔk kɔ Ghalile. Yɛ kabɛ mɔn-nyɛɛg Filip ɔɔ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ kukuma kyee dik Ituud, nɛ Talakonitid. Lizanyas nakabɛ yɛ ɛ́ kukuma kyee dik Abilɛn. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />É ghɛŋ Han nɛ Kayif nadi eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb naalii nɛ Zaŋ mɔn Zakaali pɛ tɔ bal. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Zaŋ zokazyɛ kɔ mɛl mɛ nadi pɛ kyee dik wat nɛ dii Yuldɛn ɛ. Nyɛ natutuud ɛ́ náá: «Liigka elyem, da bi ɛ́ kɛduwa Zɛɛb. Tin, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waapel mesyem men.»<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />É di'enek, etɛp ee nadi kwyala tɔ Mɛkana mɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi ɛ, ye naabela ɛsuk. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Mot ngɔt ɛpetuud tɔ bal:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">“Koobalka ze ɛ Ghɛŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">da bi ɛ́ tuu nyɛ mɛze mɛ na looba-looba!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Edi ee di na sɛbɛtɛɛ pak mɛtsok</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">djas ɛ, yɛ waabimelaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Mɛtsok nɛ eghooda djas ɛ́ waasilaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Memboŋ djas di é ze ɛ, yɛ waasekaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Mɛze mɛ di, yɛ eezepulel ɛ, yɛ waakoobelaa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Tin, bot djas ɛ́ waabee tsik Zɛɛb aadjɛ ɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.6 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Eza 40.3-5</ref></char></char></note>”»<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Mɛdhuu mɛ bot nadi ezyɛ pɛ daa Zaŋ etɛɛ náá, Zaŋ neezɛduu bɛ Zɛɛb. Zaŋ zokake nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ mbyak mɛgel mak, ɛzɛ lyo bin náá, bi kaab ɛbuk ɛ Zɛɛb di yɛ eezekunaa yenek? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Lyaalka nɛ esesɛɛ bin náá, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bi eezeliig elyem bin, da bi ɛ́ bet ɛke biyɔ nɛ biyɔ náá: “Dhiiti sonok aanàkwaasa mena, etɛɛ náá, Abalaam ɛ́ bhaab'enaka.” Betka mɛ lɛɛ bin náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa náá, mɛkok mak liiza, ye di bɛdha ɛ Abalaam. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Ye goka ɛ́ bi gu náá, zoŋ moo ɛ́ nɛɛga é ɛbok ɛ le, étɛp ye neetsaal ekaŋal e tak. Ele djas aadi ààdjɛ bhum ɛ, goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛtsaalaa. Bhii tak, yɛ kɛdikaa tɔ du.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Wɔ gwaa, bot moo tin edji nyɛ náá: «Bis goka nɛ ɛsa dáa?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mot di nɛ ekuwa ebá ɔ, goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛgwyena wat, djɛ mot di ààbɛ nɛ yɛ ɔ. Bela náá, mot di nɛ edee e dek ɔ, nyɛ kaa nɛ bot ɛ́ di ààbɛ nɛ yɛ ɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo zokabaazyɛ yɔbɔ zɛduwa Zɛɛb. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ dji Zaŋ Nduuel-bot náá: «Lyoel, bis goka nɛ ɛsa dáa?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Nàwaabka bot epata e lapo dhaa yii kukuma di elɛɛ náá, bi goka nɛ ɛwaab ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Esodja zokabaadji yɔbɔ náá: «Yɛ kabɛ bis ɔ, bis goka nɛ ɛsa dáa?» Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sa mot ààbaanɔɔ sa mot nɛ bhel, sa mot ààsu mot tɛp. Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdɛ ɛ efute e mɛsa men.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Bot djas nadi ebwood nɛ ɛbwaalel djas. Bot djas nagek ɛ́ náá, Zaŋ nabɛ ɛ́ Mɛsia. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ bɔɔ djas náá: «Mam duu bin Zɛɛb ɛ́ tɔ mɛdii. Yɛ kabɛ mot di ezyɛ bhis'am ɔɔ, nyɛ eedhaa mɛ nɛ mɛbwala nɛ ghwyil. Mam aanàkwaakobela-belak duu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bhis ɛtii ɛ ekel e ekoko, tin mot-mɛsa mɛ nadi ààduwalaa ɔ, nyɛ moo tin egwyii nyɛ mɛko.</char></note> ɛmalal étɛp ɛkotii-tiiak ekel e ekoko bɛ. Nyɛy aaduu bin Zɛɛb ɛ́ tɔ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ nɛ tɔ du. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Tɔ mɛmbɔ mɛ, nyɛ eemɛt wal étɛp nyɛ neewa mbɛk pak ezeeza nɛ embɛɛ mɛbhek. Tin, da nyɛ ɛ́ kwom mbɛɛ bhum kɔ taa. Yɛ kabɛ ezeeza ɔɔ, nyɛ kakɛmwas yɛ ɛ tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm.» <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Zaŋ naagegoola bot Mbɛɛ Bhaadal nɛ ɛlyo bɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti mɛlyo.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Wɔ gwaa, Zaŋ zokazɛdul mɛkoozi Eelood mɛlɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Eeloodhiaad mwaa mɔn-nyɛɛg nyɛ nadɛk ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ étɛp embee esesɛɛ nyɛ nadi esa ɛ djas. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Tin, Eelood naabaazɛsa dhiiti mbee tɛp: nyɛ naawa Zaŋ é mbok.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛduwa Zɛɛb ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Bhii bot djas nazeduwa Zɛɛb ɛ, Yezu pe naazɛduwa Zɛɛb. Nyɛ nadi edjaala, wɔ gwaa gwoo zɛbɛŋel. <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Bhii tak, Sisim na Dɛɛ eezɛsul kɔ lɛ tyee ɛghum. Wɔ gwaa, dhiiti gwood zokazɛgék tɔ gwoo náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ mɔn'am mɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɔ. Mɛ eedyeebamyaala nɛ nɔ ɛbuɛpe.»<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dhaad mɛbyel ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yezu nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ moo nɛ membu tyee mɛkam-mɛlɛl (30) é sok nyɛ nakan mɛsa mɛ ɛ, nɛ dáa bot nadi eke náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Zozɛf ɛ. Zozɛf nadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Eli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Eli ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Matat, Matat nakadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Levi. Levi nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Mɛlki, Mɛlki nakadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Zanayi, Zanayi nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Zozɛf. <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Zozɛf nakadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Matatyas, Matatyas nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Amɔs. Amɔs ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Nawum. Sɛɛg ɛ Nahum nabɛ ɛ́ Ɛsli, Ɛsli ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Naghayi. <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Naghayi nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Maat. Mot nabya Maat ɔ nabɛ ɛ́ Matatyas. Matatyas nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Semeyi. Mot nabya Semeyi ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́ Yosɛk. Yosɛk nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Zodha. <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Zodha kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Yoanan. Sɛɛg ɛ Yoanan nabɛ ɛ́ Leesa. Leesa nadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Zoolobhabhɛl, Zoolobhabhɛl kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Salatyɛl, Salatyɛl nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Neeli. <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neeli kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Mɛlki, Mɛlki nadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Adhi, Adhi kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Kosam, Kosam nadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Elmadham. Elmadham kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Eed. <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Mot nabya Eed ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́ Zozue, Zosue nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Elieezɛɛd, Elieezɛɛd kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Zoolim, Zoolim nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Matat. Matat kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Levi. <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Levi nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Simeyɔŋ, Simeyɔŋ kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Yuda. Yuda nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Zozɛf, Zozɛf kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Yonam, Yonam nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Eliakim. <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliakim kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Melea, Melea nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Mena, Mena kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Matata. Sɛɛg ɛ Matata nabɛ ɛ́ Natan, Natan kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Dhavid. <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dhavid nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Yese, Yese kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Obɛɛd. Obɛɛd nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Bhooz, Bhooz kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Sala. Sala nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Naasɔn. <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Naasɔn kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Aminadaab, Aminadaab nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Admin, Admin kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Aalni. Aalni nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Ɛslɔm, Ɛslɔm kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Pelɛɛz, Pelɛɛz nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Yuda. <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Zakɔɔb, Zakɔɔb kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Izak. Izak nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Abalaam. Sɛɛg ɛ Abalaam nabɛ ɛ́ Teela, Teela nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Nakɔɔd. <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nakɔɔd nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Seluk, Seluk nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Lewu, Lewu kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Pelɛɛg. Pelɛɛg nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Ebɛɛd, Ebɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Sala. <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sala nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Kenan, Kenan nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Aalpakazaad, Aalpakazaad ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Sɛm, Sɛm ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Noe, Noe ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Lemɛk. <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lemɛk nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Matusalɛm, Matusalɛm nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Enɔk. Enɔk ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Zalɛɛd, Zalɛɛd nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Malaleɛl. Malaleyɛl nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Kenan. <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Tin, Kenan nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Enɔs, Enɔs nakadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Sɛt. Sɛt kadi ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Adam, Adam ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Satan eewa Yezu tɔ mɛbhowal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Dáa Yezu nabula pɛ dii Yuldɛn ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ Sisim na Dɛɛ moo tɔɔɔ tɔ lɛ, Sisim eezɛdul nyɛ tɔ bal, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />é di dim mot mɛkɔŋ nakɛwa nyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal ɔ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naasa mɛlu mɛkam-mɛná ààdɛ edee. Bhii tak za zokazɛsa nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Dim mot mɛkɔŋ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, kea nɛ ɛkok ɛlak náá, ye liiza mapa.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ekwyala ɛ Zɛɛb lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Ye tok mapa nɛ mapa di esa náá, mot di nɛ tsik<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Dɛt 8.3</ref></char></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Bhii tak, dim mot mɛkɔŋ eezɛbyet nɛ nɛ kɔ dwol, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ lyaal nyɛ tɔ ɛwala ɛwat mɛyoŋ mɛ di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs djas. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Dim mot mɛkɔŋ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Gwyáka, mɛ waadjɛ wɔ eghɛŋ nɛ mɛkas mɛ di tɔ mɛyoŋ mak ɛ djas. Etɛɛ náá, ye naazedjɛaa mɛ. Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ nɛ mot mɛ aakwos ɛdjɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ eemyaal ɛkwyit mɛboŋ mɔ si duwal mɛ ɔɔ, mɛ waadjɛ wɔ esa djas.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ, Zɛɛb'ɔ ɛ wɔ di egoka nɛ ɛduwal. Wɔ goka nɛ ɛsa ɛ́ mɛsa mɛ met<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Dɛt 6.13</ref></char></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Bhii tak, dim mot mɛkɔŋ eebaazɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ Yeluzalɛm, nyɛ eezɛgel nyɛ kɔ ngɛs Ndjaa-ebuwa. Nyɛy nɛ Yezu náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, tsela, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛduma pɛ si. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Deenek, etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waalɛɛ nɛ efofop bɛ náá, bɛ baal wɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.10 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Mɛd 91.11-12</ref></char></char></note>.” <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Tin, baabela náá: “Bɛ waabɛp wɔ kɔ mɛmbɔ mɔɔ, ekaab náá, ko'ɔ ɛzɛkɛbema ɛbɛk.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ekwyala baalɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Sa wɔ ààwa Ghɛŋ, Zɛɛb'ɔ tɔ mɛbhowal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Dɛt 6.16</ref></char></char></note>.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Bhii nyɛ nazewa Yezu tɔ mɛbhowal dáa nyɛ nakwyɛl ɛ, dim mot mɛkɔŋ eezɛbet nyɛ, tɔ́ ɛtsetaɛpe, kɛbwood dhiiti kɔkɔ sis.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eekan mɛsa mɛ pɛ Ghalile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yezu eezɛsik pɛ Ghalile, ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ tɔ lɛ tɔɔɔ. Duma yɛ zokakɛ kɔ mɛl mɛ nadi mbaka-mbaka nɛ tin ɛ djas. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Tin, Yezu moo tin elyo bot Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda. Bot ɛ nadi egwak nyɛ ɔ, naadyeebaduduwal nyɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bot ɛ Nazalɛt eeswonal Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Dhiiti dwoo Yezu zɛtɔ́ pɛ Nazalɛt, é di nyɛ nawyelaa ɔ. É dwoo saba, nyɛ eezɛni tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda dáa nyɛ natawa nɛ ɛsesa ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boowyɛl é mis mɛ bot étɛp ɛlaŋ ɛ Ekwyala ɛ Zɛɛb.<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus en train de lire le livre de Dieu" file="lb00279c.tif" size="col" loc="4,16" copy="Louise Bass" ref="4.16">Yezu elaa Mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb</figure><verse eid="LUK 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Bhii tak náá, bɛ eezɛdjɛ nyɛ mbwoob mɛkana mɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi, nyɛ eezɛwyiiz mɛkana mɛ tak. Nyɛ kabela ɛ́, é di nakwyalaa náá:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«Sisim ɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ́ nɛ nam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naadjɛ mɛ ebotan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">étɛp mɛ neezɛtuud bɛdjel ɛ bot Mbɛɛ Bhaadal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Nyɛ nadhis mɛ ɛ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">mɛ zɛlɛɛ bot ɛ membok náá, bɛ moo ɛ́ etiia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Mɛ zɛlɛɛ bɛ na edhim náá, bɛ moo zɛnyaa sok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Mɛ zɛlɛɛ bot ɛ́ di nyalaa ɔ náá, bɛ moo ɛ́ pɛka.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Mɛ zɛtuud náá, mena moo ɛ́, é mɛwala ɛ Ghɛŋ di zɛtsik bot bɛ ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.19 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Eza 61.1-2</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛwol mɛkana, zɛdjɛ nɛ mot-mɛsa nakwokwom mbwoob mɛkana mɛ tak ɔ, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, disi. Bot djas nadi tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɔ, moo tin dhuuu, nɛ mis é nyel'ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />É di'enek, nyɛ boozɛlɛɛ bɛ náá: «Mos Ekwyala ee bi zegwak ɛ, yɛ eedjala.» <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bɔɔ djas nadi etaŋal étɛp'ɛ, bɛ nadi edjoka embɛɛ etɛp ee nyɛ nadi elɛɛ bɛ ɛ. Bɛ moo tin eke náá: «Ye tok mɔn Zozɛf'aak é?» <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bi ɛ́ waadjɛ kana yak: “Ngwomel bot, tsika nyel'ɔ wɔy wɔ ɛ́ ɛmet.” Bi ɛ́ waabaake nɛ nam náá: “Bis eegwak menduk mɛ mɛsa mɛ wɔ nasa pɛ dɛl ɛ Kapɛlnaum ɛ. Baasa esa e tak wak kɔ ghaada yɔ met!”» <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛbaabil náá: «Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, ye tok nɛ dhiiti ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb aamyaalaa kɔ dɛl ɛ lɛ met. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: É ghɛŋ ɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Eli, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bɛkus ɛ boa tɔ Yisalaɛl, é sok ye nasa membu melɛl nɛ pes, bhi àànee ɛ, é sok boo pwom nasa kɔ dɛl djas ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Zɛbela náá, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààkyeed Eli pɛ daa kus moma dik'ena. Nyɛ nazokyeed nyɛ ɛ́ pɛ daa dhiiti kus moma, nadidi pɛ dɛl ɛ Saalɛpta ɔ, pɛ kyee dik Sidɔn. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Ye nabaabɛ pe ɛ́, nɛ bot ɛ nadi nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam ɔ, ɛbuɛpe tɔ Yisalaɛl é ghɛŋ ɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Eliize. Zɛbela náá, ye nabɛ ààbɛ nɛ mot ngɔt tɔ sama yɔɔ natsak, bhis Naaman, mot kyee dik Siili nyɛ ɛmet.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Tin, wɔ gwaa ɛbuk zɛmɛt bɔɔ djas tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda, bhii bɛ nazegwak deenek ɛ́. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛwyɛl, bhii tak bɛ eezɛwyis, tɔ́ nɛ Yezu é di sis ààbɛ kɔ dɛl, pɛ kɔ ngɛs boo ɛtsok ɛ Nazalɛt nasumaa kɔ tak ɛ, étɛp bɛ neekɛzyeegal nyɛ, nyɛ neeges tɔ toŋ. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Tin, Yezu zokazɛsyela tɔ lɔɔ, nɔɔ nyel'ɛ, tɔ́ yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mot mbee sisim nadi edhek ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Dhiiti dwoo, Yezu naatɔ́ pɛ Kapɛlnaum, dɛl ɛ Ghalile. Nyɛy é lelyo bot Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, dwoo saba. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Bot naadyeebadjodjoka dáa nyɛ nadi elelyo ɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nalelyo ɛ́ nɛ eghɛŋ. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda, ye nadi ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot nadi nɛ mbee sisim nadi edhedhek ɔ. Mot'enɔk moo zɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe. <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />Nyɛy náá: «Haaa! Mena ɛ́ nɛ yaa tɛp, Yezu, mot Nazalɛt? Wɔ zyɛ, zɛtwak bis é? Mɛ nɛ gu náá: Wɔy ɛ́ mot na dɛɛ Zɛɛb nadhis ɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yezu eezɛbhɛm nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe. Nyɛy náá: «Dia gwyem, wyisa tɔ nyel mot'ak!» Mbee sisim zɛghɛɛg mot'enɔk si é mis mɛ bot. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛwyis tɔ lɛ, ààzuk nyɛ é dhiiti di. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Bot djas naadjoka ɛlyelɛpe, bɛ moo tin elelii pak'ɔɔ náá: «Yak ɛ́ yaa kɔkɔ lii nɛ nwyak mot? Nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ eghɛŋ nɛ ghwyil ɛbatake nɛ embee esisim náá, bɛ wyis, bɔɔ ɛ́ batawyis.» <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Wɔ gwaa, dék din ɛ lɛ zɛdjala kɔ kyee dik'enek djas.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛpetsik bɛtɛ nɛ membel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yezu eezɛwyis tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda, tɔ́ pɛ daa Simɔŋ. Ghuna tsi ɛ Simɔŋ yii moma nadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛkosa ɛkpaŋɛpe. Bɛ eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá, nyɛ sa sonok étɛp'ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Nyɛ eezɛmalal é ngwoob'ɛ, tinaak nyɛ zɛbhɛm mɛkosa, nyɛ wyis. Wɔ gwaa, mɛkosa zɛwyis tɔ lɛ. E di tak wat, moma yenɔk eezɛwyɛl, nyɛ moo ebe bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />É ɛbil ɛ dwoo, bot ɛ nadi nɛ membel membi-membi ɔ, naazyɛ nɛ nɔɔ pɛ daa Yezu, nyɛ ɛ́ bookɛl mɛmbɔ kɔ lɔɔ. Bhii tak náá, bɛ eezɛtsak. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Embee esisim nadi ewyis tɔ bɛtɛ nɛ membel, bɔɔ é tsitsim náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb!» Yezu ɛ́ boozɛlyak bɛ náá, bɛ diyal enuub, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi egu náá, nyɛy ɛ́ di Mɛsia.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛpelɛɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Dáa mɛlem nalem ɛ, Yezu eezɛdus tɔ ghaada tɔ́ pɛ kyee di ààbɛ nɛ bot ɛ. Tin, zukamwaa nɛ mot moo zɛsaa nyɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazɛbela nyɛ. Ɛkwosak ɛ lɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ di é di wat, nyɛ nàkabaalik bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ye goka ɛ́ náá, mɛ tɔ́, kɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal dum nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb pɛ edhiiti eghaada e sis, etɛɛ náá, mɛ nadhisaa ɛ́, étɛp tak.» <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Tin, nyɛ nadi egoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda kyee dik Yude.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yezu eedjóo bɛdjekel yii mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Dhiiti dwoo Yezu nadi ɛ́, é ngwoob boo soob na djato-djato Ghenezaalɛt. Tin, bot ɛbuɛpe eezɛsaala nyɛ é nyel pɛ kyee nyɛ nadi ɛ́, étɛp bɛ neezɛgwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Nyɛ eezɛbee é ɛboŋ ɛ dii, mɛlɛɛd mɛmbá yɛ eezesel, bɛlael ɛ mɛwyet naasɛɛ, étɛp ɛgwyii mɛwyet mɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Nyɛ eezɛni tɔ elɛɛd wat. Yiizaag nabɛ ɛ́ yɛ Simɔŋ. Nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá, bɛ pookotiila batsa nɛ ɛboŋ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, disi. Tin, nyɛ moo zɛlyo bot Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Dáa Yezu nasilal ɛlii ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ Simɔŋ náá: «Tiila kuku dii, bhii tak, da bi ɛ́ la mɛwyet men.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simɔŋ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, bis eegɔɔl tu pum'ak djas mos, ààbela sonok. Tin, dum nɛ mɛkpa mɔ, mɛ ɛpela mɛwyet.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Dáa bɛ kala mɛwyet ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛmɛt bɛsu ɛbuɛpe, mɛwyet mɔɔ moo sa ye neekɛk. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdjóo bɛsɔ bɔɔ nadi tɔ dhiiti elɛɛd ɔ, bɛ zɛkwyee bɛ. Bɛ ɛ́ boozyɛ. Bɔɔ bela bɛsu, bhii tak, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazɛlwoodal mɛlɛɛd mɛmbá mɔɔ, mɛlɛɛd ɛkɛɛ saa diida-diidak. <figure style="fig" alt="Pierre et ses frères ont capturé beaucoup de poissons" file="WA03818b.tif" size="span" loc="5.7" copy="Graham Wade" ref="5.7">Pyɛɛd nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg naagó bɛsu ɛbuɛpe</figure><verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Dáa Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd nabee deenek ɛ́, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛkwyit mɛboŋ si mɛko ɛ Yezu. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, tɔ́a yɔ ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nam, etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛ́ mot mesyem.» <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Etɛɛ náá, ɛkɛɛd naadyeebasa bɛ nɛ bot ɛ nadi tin bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ sama ɔ, dum nɛ yenek mbi bɛtɛ nɛ bɛsu ɛ bɛ nagó ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Ɛkɛɛd ɛ tak baazɛmɛt dɔɔ nɛ Zak nɛ Zaŋ bɔɔ Zɛbɛdɛ bot ɛ bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ nadi ɔ. É di'enek Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ Simɔŋ náá: «Nàbem ba, etɛɛ náá, kana dwoo pan mos'ak, wɔy aakadi ɛ́ lael mɛwyet étɛp ɛmet bot.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Bhii bɛ nasel mɛlɛɛd é ɛboŋ ɛ, bɛ eezɛdhuugal esesɛɛ bɔɔ djas, bɛ eezɛdu Yezu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eetsik dhiiti mot nadi nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yezu nadi ɛ́, kɔ dhiiti dɛl, wɔ gwaa dhiiti mot nadi nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam ɔ, zɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ, kwyit mɛboŋ, bhwoob si, zɛdjaala nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, lyem'ɔ ɛ kwyɛl ɔɔ, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛtsik mɛ, da nyel'am ɛ́ bula dɛɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yezu eezɛsɛɛb mbɔ, mɛt nyɛ. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ eekwyɛl! Tsaka.» É di tak wat, zezam zokasi é nyel mot'enɔk. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdul nyɛ mɛlɔ ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Sa wɔ ààlɛɛ mot sa dhaa wak ɛ. Tɔ́a kɛlyaal nyel pɛ daa ghaa-Zɛɛb, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛsa ɛzel ɛ ɛdis edhuud dáa Moiiz nake ɛ́. Etɛp náá, bɛ neetaŋal é di yen dum nɛ tsik wɔ zetsak ɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Tin, dék'ɛ, nabaazɛkala dhaa tyɛ kɔ mɛl djas, bot ɛbuɛpe nadi ezyɛ, zɛgwak mɛlyo mɛ Zɛɛb nɛ zɛsaa tsik pɛ daa lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ etetɔ́ tɔ bal é edi di ààbɛ nɛ bot ɔ, étɛp nyɛ neekɛdjaala.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eetsik dhiiti mot zesɔɔb nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Dhiiti dwoo Yezu nadi elyo bot Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, eFalizyɛ nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nadus mɛl nɛ mɛl pɛ kyee dik Ghalile, nɛ kyee dik Yude, zɛnɔɔ ghaada Yeluzalɛm ɔ nadi ɛ́ tin, mendiindil é gwoob ɛ Yezu. Tin, ghwyil ɛ Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb nadi ɛ́ tɔ Yezu étɛp nyɛ neetsik bot ɛ mɛbɛ́. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛdhiiti bot zokazyɛ nɛ mot zesɔɔb nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɔ, byaala kɔ mwaala. Bɛ nadi esaa dáa bɛ aaniigal nyɛ tɔ ndjaa étɛp ɛkɛnɛɛg nyɛ si mɛko ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Dáa bɛ nadi ààbɛ nɛ dáa bɛ sa ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bot binɔk zokazɛbyet kɔ mii ndjaa, tuu ɛlen tɔ ɛbo, bɛ eezɛsil mbel'enɔk kɔ mwaala yɛ, kuku ɛbwak, zeza nɛ di Yezu nadi ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Dáa Yezu nabee ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ bot ɛ nazyɛ nɛ mbel tak ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ mbel náá: «Mɔɔ sɔ'am, mesyem mɔ eepelel.» <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ moo tin nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ esiiza tɔ elyem. Bɔɔ náá: «Yenɔk ɛzɛ di ebyasal Zɛɛb deenek? Nwyak mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛpel mesyem mɛ sɔ mot, bhis Zɛɛb nyɛ ɛmet?» <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Dáa Yezu nagu esiiza bɔɔ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ booke náá: «Étɛp ye bi di nɛ mbi yenek egeka? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Ɛyé di ààdyeebalyel nɛ nen, ɛke ɛ́ náá: “Mesyem mɔ eepelel” ohoo, nɛghu ɛke ɛ́ náá: “Wyɛla, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛ”? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Ye goka ɛ́, bi gu náá: Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛpel mesyem mɛ bot kɔ bɔs.» Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ sɔɔbela mot'enɔk náá: «Mɛ ke ɛ́ náá, wyɛla, nɔŋa mwaala yɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ sik pɛ ndjaŋ'ɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />É di'enek wat, bot djas dhuuu, nɛ mis é nyel mbel, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛwyɛl, ghɛɛ mwaala nyɛ nagheghɛɛaa nɛ yɛ ɛ, zɛnɔɔ nyel, tɔ́ pɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ, nyɛy é duwal Zɛɛb. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Bot djas naadyeebadjoka, bhii tak bɛ moo eduwal Zɛɛb é ɛkeke náá: «Bis dinaa ààpabee kɔkɔ yak sok!»<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eedjóo Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Bhii tak Yezu zokazɛwyis, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ bee dhiiti nɔŋel epata e lapo, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Levi, ndiindel é di mɛsa mɛ. Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ ɛ náá: «Dua mɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Ngbat, Levi eezɛwyɛl, nyɛ eezɛlik esesɛɛ bɛ djas, du nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Bhii tak, Levi eezɛsa ɛbyoŋ tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ. Bɛtɛ nɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo, nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛbuɛpe nadi ɛ́, lɔɔg wat bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ kɔ mesa. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />EFalizyɛ nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nadi bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɛ nadi elii ɛbiyoɛpe nɛ sa tak ɛlyelɛpe. Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Étɛp ye bi di edɛ é di wat bi nɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo nɛ bot ɛ di nɛ mbee dék ɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bot ɛ di mɛnyel ɛnyɔɛpe ɔ, tok nɛ gwyes ngwomel bot étɛp nyɛ neegwom bɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ membel ɛ di nɛ gwyes mɛgwoma mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ, zɛsaa bot ɛ epiki. Mɛ nazyɛ ɛ́, zɛsaa bot ɛ di gu náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ mesyem ɔ, étɛp bɛ neeswoola mɛfulu mɔɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo ɛ Yezu dum nɛ tɛp ɛtsi ɛ edee étɛp mendjaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />EFalizyɛ zokazɛdji Yezu náá: «Bɛdjekel ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nɛ bɛdjekel bis nɛ tsi edee étɛp mendjaala esok nɛ esok. Étɛp yé bɔ bɛdjekel di ààtsi edee étɛp mendjaala?» <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zokabɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi nakobee sok paa náá, bɛsɔ ɛ mwaaz tsi edee dwoo ɛba, dhi bɛ di lɔɔg wat nɛ mwaaz, mot paazyɛ zɛba moma ɔ? Mɛ ààbee deenek. <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Tin, ɛwala ɛ tak ɛ́ waakum, sɔ'ɔɔ mot zyɛ zɛsa ɛba ɔ, nyɛ waadisaa tɔ lɔɔ. É di tak ɛ́ bɛ aatsi edee.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yezu eebaazɛbɔɔza bɛ tɔ kana náá: «Ye tok nɛ mot aanyaa kaad na bes étɛp ɛkoobal bet kaad nɛ yɛ. Yɛ sael deenek ɔɔ, pes bes kaad ɛ́ waanyaa bet kaad, tin, pes bes kaad tok nɛ ghwyil ɛlataa é bet kaad. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Ye tok nɛ mot aawa bes mɛnyok tɔ ebhɛɛb na mwa etɛɛ náá, yɛ wyil ɔ, mɛnyok ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbo bhɛɛb. Mɛnyok ɛ́ waasee é bɔs tin, bhɛɛb waapulel. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Ɛnyɔ náá, mɛnyok mɛ bes waaa tɔ ebhɛɛb na bes! <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Ye tok nɛ mot aakwyɛl ɛdɛ mɛnyok mɛ bes, bhis nyɛ eezedɛ mɛnyok mɛ na mwa ɛ. Ye dyeebakeaa ɛ náá: “Mɛnyok mɛ na mwa nɛ nyɔ.”»<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛ́ kukuma dwoo saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Dhiiti dwoo saba, Yezu nadi edhaa tɔ pyeeb mɛbhek mɛ di edjóoaa ble ɛ. Bɛdjekel bɛ nadi ebɔ́k mɛbhek nɛ ɛdjas yɛ tɔ mɛmbɔ mɔɔ, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛdɛ bhum tak. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Bɛdhiiti eFalizyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Étɛp yé bi di esa sa etsi di elyak dwoo saba ɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi dinaa ààpalaa dáa Dhavid nasa é sok za nasa bɛ nɛ bot bɛ ɛ? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Bɛ naani tɔ pɛt ɛbhɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛy zokanɔɔ emapa ee nakaŋaa Zɛɛb ɛ, dɛ, nɔɔ yak pak, djɛ bot ɛ nadi egyee bɛ nɛ nɛ ɔ. Dhi bɔɔ eezogu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, etsi lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, bot di egoka nɛ ɛdɛ emapa binek ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ bɔɔ bɛmet bɛghaa-Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yezu zokabaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ di kukuma dwoo saba.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eetsik mot na sɔɔbela mbɔ dwoo saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Dhiiti dwoo saba, Yezu eezɛni tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda, nyɛ moo tin elyo bot Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. Tɔ tak nadi ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot ngɔt nɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ sɔɔbela. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />EFalizyɛ nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi moo tinaak dhuuu nɛ mis é nyel ɛ Yezu é gwyák nɛghu nyɛ waatsik nyɛ dwoo saba, étɛp ɛbela lo mɛsɔ mɛ bɛ aapit nyɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Tin, Yezu nadi egu egeka e ebhum e elyem bɔɔ. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ mot na sɔɔbela mbɔ náá: «Wyɛla! Tyaŋa tetel tin kuku ɛbwak.» Wɔ gwaa, mot'enɔk eezɛwyɛl, nyɛ eezɛtyaa tetel. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Nyɛ eezɛdji ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ́ nadi tin ɔ náá: «Tɔ etsi, ɛyé di egoka nɛ ɛsael dwoo saba, enɛm esa ohoo, embee esesɛɛ? Ɛtsik ɛ mot ohoo, nɛghu ɛbet náá, nyɛ gwyɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yezu eebulal mis gwyák bɛ, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ mot tak náá: «Sɛɛba mbɔ'ɔ.» Nyɛ eezɛsɛɛb mbɔ'ɛ, yɛ eezɛsekel, bula ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ zokazɛkpaa lyem ɛlyelɛpe, bɛ moo tinaak esɔs pak'ɔɔ, edjek tyee bɛ aasa kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eesɛ́ɛ bot ɛ lwoma yɛ kam nɛ bɛbá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />É ghɛŋ tak, Yezu naazɛbyet kɔ ɛtsok étɛp ɛkɛdjaala Zɛɛb. Nyɛ naadjaala Zɛɛb tu pum tak djas. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Dáa mɛlem nakalem ɛ, nyɛ eezɛdjóo bɛdjekel bɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛsɛ́ɛ tɔ sama yɔɔ bot kam nɛ bɛbá, nyɛ nadjɛ bɛ din ɛ «bot ɛ lwoma» ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Min mɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́: Simɔŋ Yezu naget Pyɛɛd ɔ, nɛ dhyeeb Andele, Zak nɛ Zaŋ, Filip, Bhaatelemi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matye, Toma, Zak mɔɔ Alfe, zɛnɔɔ Simɔŋ, mot di tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi djóoaa eZɛlɔt ɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Simɔŋ nabɛ ɛ́ mot di tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi djóoaa eZɛlɔt ɔ. Bɛ nasesa mɛsa mɔɔ ɛ́ tɔ syaab étɛp ɛbyen náá, ekwyil e bot ɛzɛkɛwa bɛ é bhel. </char></note>, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />zɛnɔɔ Zuud mɔn ɛ Zak, bɛ nɛ Yudas Iskaliɔt, mot aaka nyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛpelyo nɛ ɛtsik bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yezu eezɛwyeed ɛtsok bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ. Nyɛ eezɛtyaa é di na sɛbɛtɛɛ, é di bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel ɛbuɛpe nadi ɔ. É di tak, ye nabaabɛ ɛ́ nɛ zukamwaa nɛ mot. Bot ɛ tak naadudus ɛ́ pɛ kyee dik Yude nɛ Yeluzalɛm, kɔ eghaada di é ngwoob boo dii mɛsɔn ɛ, pɛ Tiid nɛ Sidɔn. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Bɛ nazyɛzɛgwak embɛɛ mɛlyo mɛ Zɛɛb, dɔɔ nɛ ɛzɛsaa tsik. Bot ɛ embee esisim nadi edhedhek ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naabela yɔbɔ tsik. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Bot nadi esuu ɛ́, bɛ mɛt nyɛ bɔɔ bɛmet, etɛɛ náá, dhiiti kwaambi mɛbwala nadi ewyis tɔ lɛ, é tsetsik bɔɔ djas.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛmyaala nɛ ghoŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yezu eezɛgwyák bɛdjekel bɛ, nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Mɛnyɔ nɛ biyɔ bɛdjel ɛ bot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">etɛɛ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ yebɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ biyɔ bot ɛ di nɛ za nenak ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ waadɛ, djil.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Mɛnyɔ nɛ biyɔ bot ɛ di edje nenak ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ waagɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ biyɔ, bot ɛ di ebhina bin ɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">bɛ sɔ bin ɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">bɛ lee bin ɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">nɛ saab ɛ dék ɛ len kɔ ɛsu ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />É dwoo tak, myaalka, da bi ɛ́ bɔl zɛŋ, etɛɛ náá, boo etuud bin ɛ́ nɛɛga pɛ tɔ gwoo. Bɛbhaab bɔɔ nasesa ɛ́ deenek nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ biyɔ, bɛkum ɛ bot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">etɛɛ náá, bi nazebela yebɔ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ biyɔ, bot ɛ zedɛ, djil nenak ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">etɛɛ náá, bi aadi ɛ́ nɛ za.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ biyɔ, bot ɛ di egɔ nenak ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">etɛɛ náá, bi aadi ɛ́ dje.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ biyɔ, yɛ bɛ náá, bot djas ɛpeduwal bin ɔɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bɛbhaab bɔɔ nadi eduwal bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛkwyɛl ɛ bot ɛ di ebhina bin ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />«Yɛ bɛ biyɔ, bot ɛ di egwak mɛ ɔɔ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, kwyɛlka bot ɛ mɛbhuka men. Saka enɛm esa nɛ bot ɛ́ di ebhina bin ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Sɛɛka bot ɛ di ekal bin ɔ, mɛtel. Da bi ɛ́ baadjaala Zɛɛb étɛp bot ɛ́ di esa bin ɛbiyo ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Yɛ bɛ náá, mot eenyuu wɔ bɛɛz é ɛmuk ɔɔ, baadjɛ yak kyee ɛmuk. Mot ɛ nɔɔ wɔ ndjookuwa ɔɔ, beta nyɛ baanɔɔ dɔɔ nɛ kuwa yɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Gwyena nɛ mot nɛ mot di ewaab wɔ sonok ɔ. Yɛ bɛ náá, mot eenɔɔ sa yɔ ɔɔ, sa wɔ ààkabaakɛdu. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Saka nɛ bot tyee bi di ekwyɛl náá, bɛ sa nɛ nen ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Yɛ bɛ náá, biyɔ zokwyɛl ɛ́ bot ɛ di ekwyɛl bin ɔɔ, étɛp yé bi di ebun náá, bi djɛaa bhɔɔ? Dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ mesyem zobaakwyɛl ɛ́, bot ɛ di ekwyɛl bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Yɛ bɛ náá, biyɔ zosa enɛm esa ɛ, nɛ bot ɛ di esa bin enɛm esa ɔɔ, étɛp yé bi di ebun náá, bi djɛaa bhɔɔ? Dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ mesyem baasaa deenek. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bi zokola esonok ɛ nɛ bot ɛ bi di ebwaal náá, bɛ waabulal bin yɛ ɔɔ, étɛp yé bi di ebun náá, bi djɛaa bhɔɔ? Dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ mesyem baadjɛel pak'ɔɔ ɛ fulu ɛkola, etɛɛ náá, bɛ neebulela yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Yɛ bɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́, bi kwyɛl bot ɛ mɛbhuka men. Saka bɛ enɛm esa. Gwyenaka nɛ bot esa bin, ààbwaal náá, bɛ waabaabulal bin yɛ ɛ. Deenek Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadjɛ bin boo etuud. Bhii tak, bi ɛ́ waadjóoaa bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ lwalɛŋ, zɛɛga nɛ bɛmbee ɛ bot. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Gekeka bot ghoŋ, dáa Sɛɛg'en di egék bin ghoŋ ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nàpɛ́ɛka bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />«Sa bi ààdidi epɛ́ɛ bot, deenek Zɛɛb aanàkwaapɛ́ɛ bin. Sa bi ààdidi ekwyesal bot ndjɛ sɔs, deenek Zɛɛb aanàkwaakwyesal bin ndjɛ sɔs. Pelka bot ɛbiyo ɛ bɛ di esa bin ɛ, deenek Zɛɛb ɛ́ waapel bin. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Gwyenaka nɛ bot. Deenek Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadjɛ bin ɛbuɛpe, lwoodal. Zɛɛb ɛ́ waaso tɔ boo bhwaŋ'en bɛtɛ nɛ bhum, nyɔmelaa, dital-dital, tɔɔɔ see. Hɛɛɛ! Zɛɛb bee ɛ́ dáa bi di elwoodal bhwaa bɛsɔ bin ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ nyɛ aalwoodal yebɔ bhwaa.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Tin, Yezu eebaazɛlii nɛ nɔɔ pɛ tɔ kana náá: «Mot edhim tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdul sɔ mot edhim étɛp ɛlyaal ɛ́ nyɛ ze, ààbɛ deenek é? Bɛ ɛ sa deenek ɔɔ, bɔɔ djas bɛbá ɛ́ waakɛdjoola tɔ guk. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Ye tok nɛ djekel ngɔt di edhaa mot di elyo nyɛ ɔ. Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, djekel di edjek mɛsa ɔɔ, nyɛ eezedjek ɛnyɔɛpe ɔ, nyɛ aakaswaala ɛ́, nyɛ moo dáa sɛɛg mɛsa mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Étɛp yé wɔ gwyák kwyɛɛzyoŋ di tɔ dis ɛ mɔn-nyoog, wɔ kadi ɛ́, ààbee pɛk le di tɔ dis ɛ lɔ ɛ? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Wɔ aanàkwaake nɛ sɔ'ɔ mot náá: “Mɔn-nyaagam, beta, mɛ dis mɔɔ kwyɛɛzyoŋ tɔ dis ɛ lɔ,” dhi wɔy di ààbee pɛk le di tɔ yɔ dis ɛ! Wɔy mot mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si, pookodis sok pɛk le tɔ dis ɛ lɔ! Bhii tak ɛ́ wɔ aanyaa sok, étɛp wɔ needis kwyɛɛzyoŋ di tɔ dis ɛ mɔn-nyoog ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Le nɛ ebhum bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />«Mbɛɛ le ààbya mbee bhum. Tyee wat nɛ mbee le, yɛ aanàkwaabya mbɛɛ bhum. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Le djas gwyakaa ɛ́, nɛ ebhum nyɛ di edjɛ ɛ. Bhum efiigh ààbɔ́kaa kɔ le mɛgɔk. Baadi náá, bhum di saaa mɛnyok mɛ vin nɛ yɛ ɛ́, yɛ ààbɔ́kaa tɔ engwyinini. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Mbɛɛ mot dyeebawyisal ɛ́ embɛɛ etɛp di edus tɔ di ɛkwom ɛ di tɔ lyem'ɛ ɛ, kadi ɛ́ náá, mbee mot dyeebawyisal ɛ́ embee etɛp mɛbiyo mɛ di tɔ mbee lyem'ɛ ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛkpa mɛ mot dyeebawyisal tɔ nuub'ɛ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ mɛkpa mɛ zelwood tɔ lyem'ɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana mendjaa membá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />«Étɛp yé bi di edjóo mɛ “Ghɛŋ, Ghɛŋ”, da bi kadi ɛ́, ààsa dáa mɛ ke ɛ? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Mɛ pookolyaal bin mbi mot zyɛ pɛ daa lam é gwak mɛkpa mam, da nyɛ ɛ́ kɛ tyee tak ɔ, di egoka nɛ ɛdi ɛ: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />nyɛ ɛ́ dáa mot nadi eesum ndjaa, nyɛ ɛ́ zɛben epap e tak, zɛpu bɔs ɛdimɛpe, tuula kɔ bat ɛkok ɔ. Nyɛ nakawyɛl epap ɛ́ kɔ tak, tyee bhyoŋ nakatuula ɛ, ɛbhyeeb ɛ mɛdii mɛ tak naanyuŋa é ndjaŋ'enek, ààbik, etɛɛ náá, ndjaa naasumel ɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Deenek, mot maa-ɛlɔ di egwak mɛkpa mam, nyɛ kadi ɛ́, ààkɛ tyee tak ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ dáa mot nasum ndjaŋ'ɛ kɔ bɔs, ààpu ɛdimɛpe, ààbɛ nɛ ghus epap. Tyee bhyoŋ nakatuula ɛ, ndjaŋ'enek eezɛbik é di tak wat syɛɛɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yezu eetsik mot-mɛsa mɛ boo kukuma esodja eLɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Bhii Yezu nasilal ɛlii nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nazemaala tin ɔ, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ Kapɛlnaum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Tin, dhiiti boo kukuma tɔ lɔɔg esodja Lɔm nadi ɛ́, nɛ dhiiti mot-mɛsa mɛ ngɔt nyɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛbuɛpe ɔ. Mot-mɛsa mɛ tak nadi ebɛ́ ɛkpaŋɛpe, é siila nɛ ɛsyee. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Dáa boo kukuma esodja tak nagwak menduk ɛ Yezu ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boolwom bɛdhiiti bɛpaa ɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, bɛ zɛdjóo Yezu étɛp nyɛ neezɛtsik nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Bɛ eezɛkum pɛ daa Yezu. Bɛ moo tin edjaala nɛ nɛ ɛlyelɛpe. Bɔɔ náá: «Mot tak goka ɛ́ náá, wɔ kwyee nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Nyɛ nɛ kwyɛl bot ɛ mbyak'enaka. Yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ nasum ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda yenaka.»<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Tin, Yezu eezɛghɛɛ nyel, tɔ́ bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ. Bɛ dinaa ààpakotseta nɛ ndjaa deenek e, kukuma esodja eezɛlwom bɛsɔ bɛ, bɛ lɛɛ nyɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, nàdhek nyel'ɔ gwyes. Mam tok mbɛɛ mot étɛp wɔ neeni tɔ ndjaŋ'am. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mam nakuma nyel, di ààzyɛ zɛlii nɛ nɔ. Deenek, iyeee! Lóoa ɛkpa wat, etɛɛ náá, mot-mɛsa mam neetsak. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Di mɛ di'aak, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ekukuma bam mɛ di egwak esesɛɛ mɛ aasa ɛ́ nɛ nɔ ɔ. Pɛ si mɛko mam, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ esodja. Mɛ ke nɛ ngɔt náá: “Tɔ́ak” ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛpetɔ́. Mɛ ke nɛ nwyak náá: “Bulak” ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛpebula. Tin, mɛ ke nɛ mot-mɛsa mam: “Sa dáak” ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛpesa.» <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Dáa Yezu nagwak eyala e kukuma yenɔk ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naadyeebamyaala. Nyɛ ɛ́ boo liig mis, nyɛy nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi egyee nɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, mɛ dinaa ààpabee kwaambi yak ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb sok, kɔ Yisalaɛl dáa yii mot'ak.» <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Bot ɛ nalwomaa ɔ, eezɛsik yɔbɔ pɛ daa kukuma esodja, bɛ kakɛbela mot-mɛsa nadi bɛ́ ɔ, nyɛ eezetsak.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eezɛgomal muu mɔn ɛ kus moma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛtɔ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ di djóoa Nayin ɛ, lɔɔg wat nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi egyee nɛ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Dáa nyɛ nadi, nyɛ moo é ngwoob ɛniel ɛ dɛl ɛ tak ɛ, bot ɛ dɛl nadi ezyɛ nɛ muu mot pɛ mɛvit étɛp ɛkɛdel nyɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ ɛtsak ɛ mɔn dhiiti kus moma. Bot ɛ dɛl ɛ tak ɛbuɛpe nadi ɛ́, é ngwoob'ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Dáa Ghɛŋ nabee kus moma yenɔk ɛ, ghoŋ naasa nyɛ ɛbuɛpe étɛp'ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ booke náá: «Nàdje!» <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Nyɛ eezɛtiila, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ mɛt kɛs<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ye nabɛ ɛ́ elyaal náá, Yezu nadi ɛ́ kɔ etsi, etɛɛ náá, tɔ etsi eYuda, ghaa-Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààtitila nɛ muu mot, ààkomɛt-mɛtak nyɛ.</char></note>, bot ɛ nadi ebɛp kɛs ɔ, eezɛtyaa. Yezu zɛke náá: «Mɔɔ ngbaaz, mɛ lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: Wyɛla!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Mot nagwyɛ ɔ eezɛgom, di ndiindel, nyɛ moo tinaak elii. Yezu eezɛbulal nyɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ nyɛɛg. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, naadjoka ɛbuɛpe. Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛduwal Zɛɛb é ke náá: «Boo ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb eetuula pak'enaka. Deenek, Zɛɛb eezɛkwyee bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Bot ɛ kyee dik Yude nɛ mɛl mɛ mengwoob nɛ mengwoob nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naagwak menduk mɛ sa Yezu nasa ɛ.<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus a ressuscité l’enfant d’une veuve" file="WA03823b.tif" size="col" loc="7.17" copy="Graham Wade" ref="7.11-17">Yezu eezɛgomal muu mɔn ɛ kus moma</figure><verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Engoola-ngoola ee Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nalwom ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Bɛdjekel ɛ Zaŋ eezɛkaada Zaŋ etɛp binek djas. Zaŋ eezɛdjóo bɛdjekel ɛbá pak'ɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Nyɛ eezɛlwom bɛ pɛ daa Yezu, étɛp ɛdji Ghɛŋ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɛ di Mɛsia nabɛ náá, nyɛ ɛpezyɛ ɔ ohoo, nɛghu ye baabwoodaa dhiiti baadi ezyɛ ɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Dáa bɛ nakum pɛ Yezu nadi ɛ, bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Zaŋ Nduuel-bot lwom bis ɛ́, bis zɛdji wɔ náá: Yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɛ di Mɛsia nabɛ náá, nyɛ ɛpezyɛ é ohoo, nɛghu ye baabwoodaa dhiiti baadi ezyɛ ɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />É ɛwala ɛ tak wat, Yezu zokazɛtsik bɛtɛ nɛ membel, bot ɛ nadi nɛ edjam ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ embee esisim nadi edhedhek ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ mis mɛ bot ɛ edhim. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ engoola-ngoola ɛ Zaŋ náá: «Kɛlɛɛka Zaŋ sa bi bee ɛ, nɛ yii bi gwak ɛ. Bot ɛ edhim moo nyaasok, bot ɛ di nɛ edjam ɔ moo kɛ ɛnyɔɛpe, bot ɛ nadi nɛ mɛbɛ́ mɛ zezam ɔ, bɛ eezetsak. Bɛ na endiila e mɛlɔ, moo gwak. Bot ɛ zegwyɛ ɔ, bɛ eezegom. Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛpegoolel, kɛkum pɛ daa bɛdjel ɛ bot. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ mot aadi ààdis ɛbwaalel ɛ lɛ kɔ lam ɔ!»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Bhis engoola-ngoola ɛ Zaŋ nasik ɛ, Yezu moo tin elii nɛ zukamwaa nɛ mot nadi tin kɔ ɛsu ɛ Zaŋ. Nyɛ nalɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi nakɛbee yé tɔ bal? Mɔɔ le ghwaazok edheegel nɛ pup é? Ààbɛ! <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Haaa bi nakɛbee yé tɔ bal? Bi nakɛbee ɛ́, mot ngɔt nɛ vaŋ mbi bhet é? Bi nɛ gu náá, bot ɛ dyeebabɔt evaŋ ekaad ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ di edi tɔ ekum ɔ, dyeebadi ɛ́ pɛ tɔ eboo mendjaa mɛ bɛmɛkoozi. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Haaa bi nakɛbee yé? Bi nakɛbee ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb é? Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, yii bi nakɛbee ɛ, nyɛ eedhaa-dhaŋak ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Etɛɛ náá, Zaŋ ɛ́ mot Ekwyala nalɛɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">“Ɛsok nɛ wɔ nɛ tɔ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">mɛ waalwom ngoola-ngoola yam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">étɛp nyɛ neekɛkoobal wɔ mɛze<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.27 <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref></char></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yezu eebaabil náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: pɛ tɔ bot djas Zɛɛb nasa ɔ, ye tok nɛ mot dhaa Zaŋ Nduuel-bot. Saabɛgɔs ɛ́ náá, mot di mɔɔ dhyeeb tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ eedhaa Zaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl djas nɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo naagwak nyɛ, bɔɔ myaal náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ mot epiki. Bhii tak, bɔɔ batazɛduwa Zɛɛb pɛ daa Zaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Tin, eFalizyɛ nɛ bɛlyoel ɛ etsi naabyen ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb étɛp'ɔɔ, bɛ naapɛɛ náá, Zaŋ duu bɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yezu eebaazɛke náá: «Mɛ gek bot ɛ membu mak nɛ bɛzɛ? Bɛ baakɔa nɛ zɛ é? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Bɛ ɛ́ dáa zɛɛga bɔɔ dhyeeb mendiindil kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ bot djas di edi ɛ. Tin, ngɔt katsim ɛ́, lɛɛ nɛ bɔɔ bɛsɔ bɛ náá: “Bis eebwom bin ngɔmbi, bi ààpabɔl. Bis eedjeeb bin mɛdjeeb mɛ ɛsyee, bi ààpadje!” <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Etɛɛ náá, Zaŋ Nduuel-bot eezyɛ. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eetsi edee nɛ mɛnyok, bi kake ɛ́ náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ ɛlyeeb ɛ di esa nyɛ deenek!” <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot eezyɛ. Nyɛ ɛpedɛ yɛ edee, bi kake ɛ́ náá: “Beeka nwyak é, na ghaa-dek nɛ mɛnyok. Nyɛ ɛ́ mɔɔ sɔ ɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo, nɛ bot ɛ di nɛ mbee tsik ɔ!” <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Tin, bot djas di emyaal etsoŋ e Zɛɛb ɔ, bɛ ɛpegu náá, yɛ ɛ́ epiki.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ Simɔŋ, mot Falizyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Dhiiti mot Falizyɛ zokazɛdjóo Yezu, nyɛ zɛdɛ edee bɛ nɛ. Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛtɔ́ pɛ daa lɛ, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ di kɔ mesa. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Pɛ kɔ dɛl ɛ tak ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti moma nadi nɛ mbee dék ɔ. Dáa nyɛ nagwak náá, Yezu nadi ɛ́, kɔ mesa pɛ daa mot Falizyɛ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛzyɛ nɛ bɛɛb nasael nɛ ɛkok ɛ albat ɛ, tɔɔɔ nɛ mɛnanas. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Nyɛ eezɛtyaa bhii koŋ ɛ Yezu, é dje si mɛko mɛ. Nyɛ moo tin ebel mɛko ɛ Yezu nɛ miŋal mɛ. Tin, nyɛ moo esuŋal yɛ nɛ bhoo lo'ɛ, dɔɔ nɛ ɛboma nuub'ɛ é mɛko ɛ Yezu. Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛso mɛnanas kɔ mɛko mɛ tak.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />É ghɛŋ mot Falizyɛ nadjóo Yezu náá, nyɛ zɛdɛ pɛ daa lɛ ɛ, nabee deenek ɛ́, nyɛ moo tin elii tɔ lyem'ɛ náá: «Mot tak ɛpedi ɛ́ di ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, pe nyɛ eegu mbi moma mɛt nyɛ'aak. Pe nyɛ eegu náá, nyɛ ɛ́ moma na mbee dék!» <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ mot Falizyɛ yenɔk náá: «Simɔŋ, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ sa wat mɛ di kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ wɔ.» Simɔŋ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Bela, liia lyoel.» <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mot ngɔt naakola bot ɛbá epata. Ngɔt nakola ɛ́, edhenye bɛdhet-ɛtɛn (500), dhiiti tak epata mɛkam-mɛtɛn (50). <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Dáa bɔɔ djas nadi ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛbulal epata tak ɛ, nakuma epata ɛ́ boopel kola bɔɔ djas bɛbá. Pɛ tɔ bot ɛbá binɔk ɛzɛ aakwyɛl mot'enɔk dhaa tyɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simɔŋ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Yɛ bɛ mam ɔ, mɛ gek ɛ́ náá, yɛ aadi ɛ́, mot nakola epata ɛbuɛpe ɔ.» Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Simɔŋ, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ gham.»<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛliig mis, gwyák moma tak. Nyɛy nɛ Simɔŋ náá: «Wɔ eebee moma yak é? Mɛ eeni tɔ ndjaŋ'ɔ, wɔ ààpadjɛ mɛ mɛdii mɛ ɛgwyii ɛ mɛko. Gwyáka! Nyɛ eegwyii mɛ mɛko nɛ miŋal mɛ, bhii tak, nyɛ eesuŋal yɛ nɛ bhoo'ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Wɔ ààpaboma nuub'ɔ é mɛmuk mam. Yɛ kabɛ nyɛy ɔɔ, dáa mɛ looni wak mos ɛ, nyɛ ààpakat ɛboma nuub'ɛ é mɛko mam. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Wɔ ààpalɔɔb mɛ mul kɔ lo. Yɛ kabɛ nyɛy ɔɔ, nyɛ eelɔɔb mɛ mɛnanas é mɛko! <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ di lɛɛ wɔ náá: Bɛtɛ nɛ mesyem mɛ eepelel! Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ nyɛ lyaal boo kwyɛl deenek. Mot pelaa ba bim ɔ, zobaalyaal ɛ́ ba bim kwyɛl.» <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ moma tak náá: «Mesyem mɔ, eepelel.»<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Bot ɛ bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ nadi kɔ mesa ɔ moo tin elii pak'ɔɔ náá: «Nwyak ɛ́ nwyaa kwaambi mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛpel mesyem mɛ bot'aak?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ moma yenɔk náá: «Ɛmyaal ɛ lɔ eetsik wɔ. Tɔ́a tɔ egwyem.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Boa nadi egyee bɛ nɛ Yezu ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛtɔ́ kɛgoola bot Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb pɛ tɔ eghaada nɛ kɔ bɔɔ mɛl, bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />zɛnɔɔ bɛdhiiti boa nyɛ nawyisal embee esisim tɔ lɔɔ ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ mɛbɛ nyɛ natsik ɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ Maali di djóoaa Maali moma dɛl Makdala ɔ, moma na embee esisim etɛn nɛ ebá nasɔaa tɔ lɛ ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Zan, mwaa Kuuza, ngɔt tɔ lɔɔg ekukuma di sa mɛsa tɔ ndjaa mɛkoozi Eelood ɔ, Suuzan, nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti boa nadi ekwyee Yezu nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ nɛ esa e bɔɔ met ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana sɔsel mɛbhek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Zukamwaa nɛ mot nadus mɛl nɛ mɛl ɔ, naazɛsaala é bhaaz ɛ Yezu. Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛkan kana yak: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Dhiiti mot ngɔt zokazɛtɔ́, kɛmwam mɛbhek tɔ pyeeb'ɛ. Tyee nyɛ nadi emwam ɛ, dhiiti kyee bhek eezɛkwyit é ze. Bhii tak, enen ɛ zɛdɛ yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Dhiiti kyee bhek kakwyit ɛ́, kɔ bɔs di nɛ bat ɛkok ɛ. Tyee bhek'enek nakwyit ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ boozɛsyee, etɛɛ náá, é di tak, bɔs nadi ɛ́ ghas. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Dhiiti yak kyee bhek kazɛkwyit ɛ́ tɔ engwyinini. Bhek tak eezɛkwyil lɔɔg wat nɛ engwyinini. Dikel engwyinini e tak ɛ́ boozɛgó yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Tin, dhiiti kyee bhek naazɛkwyit é mbɛɛ bɔs. Tyee yɛ nawyee ɛ́, bhek nɛ bhek naadjɛ bhum bɛdhet ɛbuɛpe.» Bhii Yezu nasilal kana yenek ɛ, nyɛ eezɛke náá: «Gwakeka ɛnyɔɛpe, bi ɛ di nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Étɛp yé Yezu dyeebalii tɔ ekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu zokazɛdji nyɛ ɛsuk ɛ kana tak. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ, bi eezedjɛaa etsoŋ e ɛgu ɛsuk ɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. Yɛ bɛ bɛsɔ bin ɔɔ, bɛ gwak yɛ ɛ tɔ ekana. Deenek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">“Bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgwyák nɛ mis, ààbee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">Bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgwak nɛ mɛlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">ààpiibal sa di kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ.”»<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛpelyaal ɛsuk ɛ kana sɔsel mɛbhek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />«Gwakeka ɛsuk ɛ kana tak: Bhek ɛ́ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Mɛbhek mɛ nakwyit é ngwoob gba ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ dáa bot ɛ di egwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, da dim mot mɛkɔŋ ɛ́ zɛdis bɛ yɛ tɔ ebhum e elyem ɛ, étɛp ɛkaab náá, bɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, da bɛ ɛ́ tsak. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Mɛbhek nakwyit kɔ bɔs di nɛ bat ɛkok ɛ́ dáa bot ɛ di egwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, da bɛ ɛ́ dja yɛ nɛ mɛmyaala. Ghuna bɛ ààbet náá, ye tyaa “zik”. Bɛ dyeebamyaal yɛ ɛ, é ba mɔɔ ɛwala batsa, kasɛka ɛ́, é di mɛbhowal aakatuula ɔ, bɛ eekat ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Bhek nakwyit tɔ engwyinini ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ dáa mbi bot ɛ di egwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, bhii tak, bɛ kawa lyem ɛ́ tɔ ɛsiiza esa e bɔs'ak, nɛ ekum nɛ mɛnyɔ mɛ tsik bɔs'ak. Bɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ tɛtɛ bhum. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Bhek kwyit kɔ mbɛɛ bɔs ɔ kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ, bot ɛ di egwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, da bɛ ɛ́ wa lyem é ɛbaal ɛ yɛ, bhii tak, bɛ ɛ́ kɛ mbɛɛ kyeed ɔ, tin, bɛ waadjɛ mbɛɛ bhum.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana lama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />«Mot ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛtuub lama, da nyɛ ɛ́ butal yɛ nɛ mɔɔ bhe, nɛghu ɛnɔɔ yɛ, da wa pɛ si goŋ é? Ye nɛɛgaa ɛ́, pɛ kɔ tɛɛg etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ di ni tɔ ndjaŋ ɔ, needi tɔ gwyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Esa ee di tɔ sɔ ɛ djas aadi ɛ́, wyis é gwyɛ é mwos dwoo. Esa e mɛsɔ djas aadi ɛ́, nyen é gwyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Dika nɛ etsoŋ dum nɛ etɛp djas bi di egwak ɛ! Etɛɛ náá, mot aadi nɛ ba bim sonok ɔ, bɛ waabil nyɛ dhiiti. Tin, mot aadi ààbɛ nɛ sonok ɔ, bɛ aadis nyɛ ba bim esa ee nyɛ di nɛ yɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg zokazyɛ, zɛbela Yezu. Bɛ eezɛtyaa pɛ kel etɛɛ náá, ze ɛdhaa étɛp bɛ neekɛboma nɛ Yezu nadi ɛ́, ɛkɔɔlaɛpe étɛp mɛbu mɛ bot. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Deenek, bɛ eezɛlɛɛ Yezu náá: «Nyoog nɛ bɔn-nyoog ɛ́ metetel pɛ kel, bɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛboma nɛ nɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛbɔɔza nɛ bot djas náá: «Nyaagam nɛ mɔn-nyaagam ɛ́ bot ɛ di egwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, da looba nɛ yɛ ɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eelyak boo ghuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Dhiiti dwoo, Yezu eezɛni tɔ boo elɛɛd bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Djhoosɛɛka, tɔ́ pɛ yii kyiid boo soob na djato-djato.» Bhii tak bɛ eezɛtɔ́. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Dáa bɛ nadi ekɛ tɔ elɛɛd ɛ, gɔ́ eezɛbe Yezu. Kasɛka ɛ́, boo ghuu ɛlyelɛpe eezɛkan ɛpupal kɔ dii. Mɛpupal mɛ ghuu tak eeghɛɛ ɛbhyeeb ɛ mɛdii kɛghɛɛg yɛ é elɛɛd, elɛɛd moo tin eni mɛdii. Mɛdii mɛ tak ɛkɛɛ sa aalwoodal-lwoodelak elɛɛd, bɛ moo tin pak tsik nɛ ɛsyee. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu eezɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ, bɛ eezɛdjem nyɛ nɛ etsim: «Ghɛŋ, Ghɛŋ, mena ɛ́ di esik'aak!» Tin, Yezu eezɛdjem. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛbhɛm ghuu nɛ ɛbhyeeb. É di'enek, ghuu eezɛsila, bhwak moo tin kup. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Ɛmyaal ɛ len ɛ́ wo?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Ye nabɛ ɛ́ boo bwoo naamɛt bɛ, bɛ naadyeebadjoka dhaa nyel. Bɛ moo tin edjinel pak'ɔɔ náá: «Nwyak ɛ́ nwyaa kwaambi mot di náá, dɔɔ nɛ ghuu nɛ mɛdii ɛpegwak nyɛ?»<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik dhiiti mot nadi nɛ embee esisim ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yezu nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛkum pɛ kyee dik Gheelaasa di di egwyákel nɛ kyee dik Ghalile ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Dáa Yezu nadi esul tɔ elɛɛd ɛ, dhiiti mot dɛl ɛ tak zokazyɛ, zɛboma nɛ nɛ. Mot tak nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ embee esisim nadi dhedhek nyɛ ɔ. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ekaad é nyel, ààkadidi tɔ ndjaa. Nyɛ nakadidi ɛ́ tɔ mɛvit. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Dáa nyɛ nabee Yezu ɛ, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛbo tsim. Nyɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si mɛko mɛ. Nyɛ eezɛbo tsim, nyɛy nɛ nɛ, náá: «Mena ɛ́ nɛ yaa tɛp, Yezu, Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake? Mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nɔ, nàtwak mɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ mbee sisim náá, nyɛ wyis tɔ lɛ, etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́, mbee sisim tak eezeloobe di tɔ lɛ. Nyɛ nadi ekɔlaa mɛmbɔ nɛ mɛko nɛ eghwooz étɛp nyɛ neemɛtaa é di wat. Mot tak nabebwak yɛ ɛ bwakak. Tin, mbee sisim tak nawoobal nyɛ, kyeed nyɛ tɔ bal. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yezu zokazɛdji nyɛ náá: «Din ɛ lɔ ɛ́ ɛyé?» Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yam din ɛ́ “Mɛkɔm-mɛkɔm”», etɛɛ náá, bɛtɛ nɛ embee esisim naani tɔ lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Tin, embee esisim nadi edjaala nɛ Yezu náá, nyɛ nàkyeed bɛ tɔ guk di ààbɛ nɛ ɛsik ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">guk di ààbɛ nɛ ɛsik ɛ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yɛ ɛ́ boo guk, di edim bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ di ɛ.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />É di tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo ɛsaŋ ɛ bɛghwyee nadi egɔɔ kɔ mɛtsok menek ɔ. Embee esisim eezɛdjaala nɛ Yezu náá, nyɛ kyeed bɛ tɔ mɛnyel mɛ bɛghwyee binɔk. Yezu zokamyaal bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Tin, wɔ gwaa embee esisim zɛwyis tɔ mot'enɔk, ni tɔ ɛsaŋ ɛ bɛghwyee binɔk. Bɔɔ djas eezɛsul nɛ ekaab pɛ bɛ nadi kɔ ɛkalel ɛtsok ɛ. Wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛges, kɛghaaga tɔ dii, diida. Bɔɔ djas si na bhɛɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Dáa bot ɛ nadi ebaal mɛsaa mɛ bɛghwyee binɔk nabee edjema binek djas ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛtsema nɛ ekaab, sik, kɛlɛɛ bot kɔ eghaada nɛ kɔ bɔɔ mɛl. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Bot zokawyis tɔ́ kɛbee sa nasɛ́ɛ ɛ. Bɛ eezɛkum pɛ kyee Yezu nadi ɛ́. Tin, bɛ eezɛbee mot na embee esisim mɛkɔm-mɛkɔm nawyis tɔ lɛ ɔ, ndiindel é ngwoob ɛ Yezu, nyɛy nɛ ekaad é nyel. Nyɛy nyel ɛnyɔɛpe. Wɔ gwaa, bwoo zɛmɛt bɔɔ djas. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Bot ɛ nabee edjema binek djas ɔ, moo tin ebaŋa dáa mot na embee esisim mɛkɔm-mɛkɔm natsak ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Tin, bot ɛ kyee dik'enek djas zokazɛdjaala nɛ Yezu náá, nyɛ dus kɔ kyee dik Gheelaasa, etɛɛ náá, ye naadyeebakpaa bɛ boo ɛkɛɛd.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:37">Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛni tɔ elɛɛd, nɔɔ nyel'ɛ, sik. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Mot embee esisim nawyis tɔ lɛ ɔ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́, mena gyeeka lɔɔg wat.» Yezu ɛ́ boozɛswaal nyɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Sika pɛ ndjaŋ'ɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛlɛɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ ee Zɛɛb sa wɔ ɛ.» Mot'enɔk eezɛtɔ́, nyɛ moo tin ekɛtuud kɔ ghaada djas dáa Yezu natsik nyɛ ɛ́.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsik ɛ mɔn Zayilus nɛ moma nadi nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ zoob ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Dáa Yezu nabula pɛ yak kyiid dii ɛ, wɔ gwaa, zukamwaa nɛ mot baazɛboma nɛ nɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi ebwood nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Dhiiti mot, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Zayilus. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, kukuma ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda. Nyɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si mɛko ɛ Yezu, é djaala nɛ nɛ, nyɛ zyɛ pɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ sim ɛsyes ɛ lɛ ngɔt, mɔn membu kam nɛ ebá nadi ebɛ́ ɛkpaŋɛpe pak tsik nɛ ɛsyee ɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Dáa Yezu nadi etɔ́ ɛ, zukamwaa nɛ mot nadi edu nyɛ, bak eghuŋa nyɛ é nyel, bak tak etiidal nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Ghuna tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti moma, ghiya nadi ekekɛk nyɛ é nyel boa, ààbɛ nɛ ɛtsek ɔ. Ɛbɛ́ ɛ tak naasa nɛ nɛ tyee membu kam nɛ ebá. Nyɛ naasilal epata bɛ djas tɔ mendjaa mɛ mɛgwoma ɛbuɛpe, ɛbɛ́ ààsi. Ye nabɛ ààbɛ nɛ mot nakwak ɛgwom ɛbɛ́ ɛ tak. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Nyɛ eezɛdu Yezu bhii koŋ, zyɛ, zɛmɛt kyee ɛghɔ ɛ kaad'ɛ wat. Mɛta nyɛ nazomɛt ɛ, é di tak wat, ghiya eezɛtsek. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yezu eezɛdji náá: «Ɛzɛ mɛt mɛ?» Wɔ gwaa, bot djas kɛla, Pyɛɛd eezɛke náá: «Ghɛŋ, beea kwaambi zukamwaa nɛ mot di etiidal wɔ ekyee djas'aak.» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Deenek, Yezu eezɛke náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ mot eekwyɛt mɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ eegwyak náá, dhiiti pes mɛbwala eewyis tɔ lam.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Dáa moma tak nagu náá, nyɛ eepanaa ɛ, moma tak eezɛtiila, nyɛ moo pwak nɛ bwoo. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si, si mɛko ɛ Yezu. Nyɛ eezɛmyam é mis mɛ bot djas, tin, nyɛ moo elɛɛ nɛ bot djas étɛp yé nyɛ namɛt kaad ɛ Yezu ɛ, nɛ dáa nyɛ nakatsak é di tak wat ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ɛsyes ɛ lam, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔ nɛ Zɛɛb eetsik wɔ. Tɔ́a tɔ egwyem.»<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Tinaak, Yezu dinaa elii, ngoola-ngoola ngɔt eezɛdus pɛ ndjaŋ ɛ kukuma ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda, zɛlɛɛ nyɛ náá: «Ɛsyes ɛ lɔ eezepɛka. Nàkabaadhek lyoel.» <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yezu nabɛ ààbis sa bɛ nadi elii ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ Zayilus náá: «Nàbem ba. Duma koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛ waatsak!» <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Dáa nyɛ nakum pɛ ndjaŋ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛlu bot djas náá, bɛ nàni tɔ ndjaa. Nyɛ nazomyaal ɛ́, bɛdjekel bɛ, Pyɛɛd, Zaŋ nɛ Zak, zɛnɔɔ sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg mɔn. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Bot djas, metetel nɛ mɛgwyɛ, nɛ etaŋal nɛ etsim. É di'enek Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Nàdjeka. Mɔn ààpagwyɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ é gɔ́.» <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Wɔ gwaa, bot gɔ nyɛ etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi egu náá, mɔn naazegwyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Nyɛ eezɛmɛt mɔn é mbɔ, nyɛ eezɛben gwood. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɔn'am, wyɛla!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />É di tak wat, mɔn'enɔk eezɛgom, nyɛ eezɛwyɛl. Bhii tak, nyɛ ɛ́ boolwom bɛ náá, bɛ djɛ mɔn tak edee e dek. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́, sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg naadyeebadjoka ɛlyelɛpe. Yezu eezɛlyak bɛ náá, bɛ nàlɛɛ bot sa nasael ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Lwomel bɛdjekel kam nɛ bɛbá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yezu eezɛsɛɛg bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá, nyɛ eezɛdjɛ bɛ ghwyil nɛ eghɛŋ e ɛsɔ embee esisim nɛ ɛtsik ɛ bot ɛ mɛbɛ́. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛlwom bɛ, bɛ kɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ ɛtsik ɛ membel. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Nyɛ eezɛdjɛ bɛ etsi náá: «Sa mot àànɔɔ sonok wat, nyɛ neetɔ́ nɛ yɛ mɛdjoŋ. Sa mot àànɔɔ sek, àànɔɔ ɛkoo, àànɔɔ mapa, kɛyaka nɛ epata tɔ mengwyɛ men. Sa mot ààdi nɛ ekuwa ebá. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Tɔ edi djas bot aamyaal náá, bi sulal ɔ, dika tɔ ndjaa tak, kɛkum dwoo bi aadus tin ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Mɛl djas bot aapɛɛ náá, bi nàsulal pɛ daa lɔɔ ɛ, kpaaka yebɔ, da bi ɛ́ kut bɛ piib mɛko men. Yɛ aadi ɛ́, tyee mwana étɛp embee esesɛɛ bɔɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Bɛdjekel eezɛtɔ́ pɛ mɛl djas, kɛlɛɛ bot Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, nɛ ɛtsik ɛ bɛtɛ nɛ membel é edi djas.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kɛŋ ɛ Eelood</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Tin, Eelood mot nadi mɛkoozi kɔ kyee dik Ghalile ɔ, naagwak menduk mɛ etɛp binek djas. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkagu sa nyɛ gek ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛdhiiti bot nadyeebake ɛ́ náá: «Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nagwyɛ ɔ, naazegom.» <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Bak náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, Eli, eebaatuula!» Yak kyee bot náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb na mwa ɛ zegom!» <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Eelood ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Ye nabɛ ɛ́ mam ɛmet naazelwom náá, bɛ tsak Zaŋ Nduuel-bot. Haaa yenɔk ɛ́ nwyaa mot? Mot mɛ di egwak bot elii etɛp bak ko ɛsu ɛ lɛ'aak ɛ́ zɛ?» Nyɛ nadi esaa nyɛ neebee Yezu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eedjɛ edee nɛ botom bɛmil ɛtɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Bot ɛ lwoma zokazɛbula pɛ daa Yezu, bɛ moo tin ebaŋa nyɛ esesɛɛ ee bɛ nasa ɛ. Yezu ɛ́ boozɛdul bɛdjekel bɛ, tɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ é ngwoob dhiiti ghaada di edjóoaa Bhɛtsaida ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Ghuna bot ɛbuɛpe naagu ze bɛ nadi tɔ́ ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdu bɛ. Yezu zokazɛboma nɛ nɔɔ. Bhii tak, nyɛ moo tin elyo bɛ dum nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ ɛtsik ɛ bot ɛ nadi ekwos ɛtsak ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Dáa dwoo nabɛ ye moo esila ɛ, bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá ɛ́ boozɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Swaala bot bak, bɛ tɔ́ pɛ kɔ mɛl nɛ pɛ tɔ epɛt ee di pak nɛ wak ɛ, etɛɛ náá, penek bɛ waakɛbela di ndjɛk nɛ edee e dek, etɛɛ náá, menaka wak ɛ́ tɔ bal.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Djɛka bɛ edee biyɔ bɛmet!» Bɛ eezɛbaake nɛ Yezu náá: «Bis zokalik ɛ́, nɛ emapa etɛn, zɛnɔɔ bɛsu ɛbá. Wɔ kwyɛl bilak ɛ́ náá, bis kɛbɔm edee étɛp bot bak djas é?» <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />É di'enek, mɛtaŋ mɛ bot naakum tyee botom bɛmil ɛtɛn (5 000). Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Dilka bot djas mendiindil, zɛɛga bot mɛkam-mɛtɛn (50) e di wat.» <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Bɛdjekel ɛ́ boozɛsa dáa Yezu nake ɛ. Bɛ eezɛdil bɛ si. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛnɔɔ emapa etɛn nɛ bɛsu ɛbá binek, nyɛ eezɛben mis pɛ ɛko, zɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb étɛp edee binek. Nyɛ eezɛpyak mapa, nɔɔ, djɛ bɛdjekel bɛ, bɛ kaa bot djas. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Mot nɛ mot naadɛ, djil. Bɛdjekel zokabula nɛ mɛbhwaa kam nɛ ebá yii mɛbhubhwak.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pyɛɛd eelɛɛ náá, Yezu ɛ́ Mɛsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Dhiiti dwoo, dáa Yezu nadi é djaala nɛ Zɛɛb é dhiiti sum di ɛ, bɛdjekel nadi ɛ́, bɛ nɛ nɛ. Nyɛ eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Mɛdhuu mɛ bot ke náá, mam ɛ́ zɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bak ke ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot. Bɛdhiiti náá, wɔ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Eli. Bɛdhiiti pe kabaake ɛ́ náá: Wɔ ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb na mwa zegom ɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yezu eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, bi ke náá, mam ɛ́ zɛ?» Pyɛɛd eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ Mɛsia Zɛɛb nadhis ɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yezu eezɛdul bɛ mɛlɔ ɛlyelɛpe, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá, sa bɛ ààlɛɛ bot.<verse eid="LUK 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛkɛn ɛ lɛŋ ɛ Yezu nalɛɛ étɛp ɛsyee nɛ ɛgom ɛ lɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eebaazɛbil náá: «Ye goka ɛ́ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot zukaa ɛbuɛpe. Bɛpaa, nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, zɛnɔɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ́ waabhina nyɛ. Nyɛ waagóaa. Mɛlu mɛlɛl bhis ɛsyee ɛ lɛ, nyɛ waagom.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛlii nɛ bɔɔ djas náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, mot ngɔt ɛpekwyɛl ɛdu ɛ mɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ bet ɛkwyɛɛg ɛ nyel'ɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ bɛp mɛlaaba mɛ mɛlu djas, da nyɛ ɛ́ du mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Etɛɛ náá, mot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛtsik nyel'ɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaabela tsik, mot ɛ myaal ɛsu ɛ tsik nyel'ɛ étɛp'am ɔɔ, nyɛ waabela tsik. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Yɛ ɛ́ tɛtɛ yé, mot bela mɛvu mɛ bɔs'ak djas, da nyɛ ɛ́ gel nyel'ɛ met, nɛghu ɛpul ɛ nyel'ɛ? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Mot aagwak sen étɛp'am nɛ étɛp mɛkpa mam ɔ, mam Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waagwak sen nɛ nɛ dwoo mɛ aazyɛ tɔ duma yam ɛ, nɛ tɔ duma Saagam nɛ efofop na dɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ ɛ́ náá, tɔ sama bot ɛ di wak'aak, bɛdhiiti aanàkwaagwyɛ, bɔɔ ààbee Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhwoob ɛ Yezu eeswoola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Ye naasa tyee yenga wat bhii nyɛ naalii deenek ɛ́, Yezu eezɛnɔɔ Pyɛɛd, nɛ Zaŋ, zɛnɔɔ Zak, nyɛ eezɛbyet kɔ dhiiti ɛtsok étɛp ɛdjaala nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />É sok Yezu nadi edjaala ɛ, bhwoob'ɛ zokaswoola, ekaad bɛ moo puu, ɛkasɛpe dáa ngwyes bhi. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Kasɛka tin ɛ́, bot ɛbá é bhaaz'ɛ, bɔɔ elɛɛ elɛŋ nɛ Yezu. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ Moiiz bɛ nɛ Eli. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Bɛ eezɛtuula kuku mɛkas ɛ Zɛɛb. Bɛ nɛ Yezu nadi elii dum nɛ tyee nyɛ aasilal lwomel'ɛ ɛ, nɛ dáa nyɛ aakɛgwyɛ pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Tinaak, Pyɛɛd nɛ bot ɛ lɔɔg'ɛ eezɛduma é gɔ́, syaaaz. Dáa bɛ nakadjem ɛ, bɛ eezɛbee mɛkas ɛ Yezu nɛ bot ɛbá bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ nadi ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />É di nadi náá, bot binɔk moo elik Yezu ɔ, Pyɛɛd eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, mena di wak. Djhoosumka epɛt elɛl: Wat yɔ, dhiiti yɛ Moiiz, yak wat kadi ɛ́ yɛ Eli.» Tinaak, nyɛ nadi ɛ́, ààgu sa nyɛ nadi eke ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />É di nyɛ nadi elii deenek ɔ, eguud eezɛsul, zɛbutal bɛ. Bɛdjekel ɛ́ boozɛgwak bwoo é ɛbee dáa eguud di ebutal bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Tɔ eguud binek, gwood zokagék náá: «Nwyak ɛ́ Mɔn'am mɛ nazetɔ ɔ. Gwakeka nyɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Bhii gwood nazegék ɛ, ye nakalik ɛ́, Yezu nyɛ ɛmet. Bɛdjekel ɛ́ boozɛsyel tɛp tak, é ghɛŋ tak, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbaŋa bot etɛp ee bɛ nabee ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eetsik dhiiti mɔɔ dhyeeb embee esisim nadi edhek ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />É yak ɛlu Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel ɛlɛl binɔk moo wyeed ɛtsok ɛlenek, wɔ gwaa zukamwaa nɛ mot zɛboma nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk, mot ngɔt moo tin etsim: «Lyoel, mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nɔ, kɛla mis kɔ mɔn'am. Yɛ ɛ́ sim mɔn'am! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />» » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » » Etɛɛ náá, mbee sisim wat nɛ dyeebamɛt nyɛ, é di tak wat nyɛ ɛpekyeeb, bhii tak, ye kadheeg nyɛ ɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe, é di tak wat, mɛwyil moo ewyis é nuub mɔn. Mbee sisim tak ɛpezuk nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe, ɛdus ɛ lɛ tin nɛ lyel. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ye bɛ ɛ́, mɛ eedjala nɛ bɛdjekel bɔ náá, bɛ sɔ mbee sisim tak. Bɛ ààpakwak yɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ bɛmbee ɛ bot, bot ɛ di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ! Mɛlu mɛdhen kalik nɛ nam é ɛdi tɔ len? Baabela náá, mɛlu mɛdhen mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛmaad bin? Dha mɛ nɛ mɔn'ɔ wak.» <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Dáa mɔn tak nazokunaa nɛ Yezu ɛ, wɔ gwaa, mbee sisim zɛghɛɛg nyɛ si. Bhii tak ye moo zɛdheeg mɔn'enɔk ɛlyelɛpe na bhuku-bhuku. Tin, Yezu eezɛbhɛm mbee sisim tak, mɔn eezɛtsak. Bhii tak Yezu eezɛbulal nyɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ sɛɛg. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bot naadyeebadjoka mɛbwala mɛ Zɛɛb tin.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yezu eebaalii dum ɛsyee nɛ ɛgom ɛ lɛ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Dáa ye nabɛ náá, mot nɛ mot nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ dinaa edjoka nɛ ɛsɔs etɛp djas Yezu nadi esa ɛ, Yezu ɛ́ boolɛɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Bɛɛka mɛlɔ men ɛnyɔɛpe étɛp bi neebaal sa mɛ aalɛɛ bin ɛ: Ye kalik ɛ́ batsa Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot neekaaa é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />É di'enek, bɛdjekel nabɛ ɛ́, ààmɛt lo etɛp ee nyɛ nadi elɛɛ bɛ ɛ, etɛɛ náá, ɛsuk ɛ tak nadi bɛ ɛ́ syela étɛp bɛ needi ààmɛt yɛ. Bɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ bwoo ɛ dji ɛ́ Yezu tɛp'enek.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛ ɛ́ ɛzɛ di dhil mot?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Bɛdjekel moo tin ebe mɛso pak'ɔɔ étɛp bɛ neegu tɔ sama yɔɔ, ɛzɛ di dhil mot. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yezu eezɛgu sa nadi edhaa pak'ɔɔ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛnɔɔ mɔɔ dhyeeb, nɛɛg nyɛ é ngwoob'ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mot ɛ́ myaal mɔn'ak kɔ ɛsu ɛ kwyɛl nyɛ di nɛ yɛ nɛ nam ɔɔ, nyɛ myaal ɛ́ mam. Tin bela náá, mot ɛ myaal mɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ myaal ɛ́, mot nadhis mɛ ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, mot di mɔɔ dhyeeb pak biyɔ djas ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ di boo-mot.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mot di ààbhina mena ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot'ena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Zaŋ eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, bis eebee dhiiti mot esɔ embee esisim nɛ din ɛ lɔ. Bis eelyak nyɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ààkɛ lɔɔg wat mena nɛ bɛnɔɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sa mot ààlyak nyɛ, etɛɛ náá, mot di ààbhina bin ɔ, yenɔk ɛ́ mot'en.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bot ɛ Samaali eepɛɛ náá, Yezu sulal kɔ dɛl ɛ lɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Dáa ɛlu ɛ nabɛ náá, nyɛ neebyet tɔ gwoo ɛ, nadi yɛ eezekunaa ɛ, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ lyem'ɛ wat náá: Nyɛ ɛpetɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Nyɛ ɛ́ bookyeed engoola-ngoola mɛbhaadal pɛ sok. Engoola-ngoola eezɛtɔ́, bɛ eezɛni tɔ dhiiti dɛl pɛ kyee dik Samaali étɛp bɛ neekoobal nyɛ di, nɛ esesɛɛ djas. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Tin, bot ɛ dɛl zokabyen náá, nyɛ nàsulal kɔ dɛl ɛ tak, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi etɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Dáa Zak nɛ Zaŋ bɛdjekel bɛ nagwak deenek ɛ́, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Ghɛŋ, wɔ ɛpekwyɛl náá, bis djóo du, dus tɔ gwoo étɛp ye neezɛdik bɛ?»<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yezu eezɛliig mis, bhɛm bɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ moo edul bɛ mɛlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Bɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ dhiiti dɛl.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛdu ɛ Yezu ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Yezu bɛ nɛ bot ɛ nadi egyee nɛ nɛ ɔ gba-gba kuku kyeed, wɔ gwaa, dhiiti mot zokake nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛdu ɛ́ wɔ é mɛze djas wɔ aadi etɔ́ ɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yezu zokazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bɛbhɛk ɛ́ nɛ eku, enen ɛ́ nɛ mɛk. Kabela náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot, nyɛ tok nɛ zeza nɛ di ɛdjaasi nɛ ɛwala.»<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nwyak dhiiti mot náá: «Dua mɛ.» Mot'enɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, pookobet mɛ, mɛ pookokɛdel Saagam.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Beta bot ɛ zegwyɛ ɔ bɛ del myoŋ mɛ bot bɔɔ. Yɛ bɛ wɔy ɔɔ, tɔ́a, kɛlyaal bot Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Nwyak dhiiti mot eebaake yɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, mɛ waadu wɔ. Pookobet náá, mɛ kɛ ɛmwana nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mam.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mot ɛ zemɛt awata, da nyɛ ɛ́ baake náá, nyɛ bulal mis, gwyák pɛ bhis ɔɔ, yenɔk tak ààpakɔa nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Lwomel bɛdjekel mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ ebá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Bhii tak, Ghɛŋ eebaazɛsɛ́ɛ bɛdjekel mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ ebá (72). Nyɛ eezɛlwom bɛ bɛbá-bɛbá pɛ tɔ eghaada nɛ kɔ mɛl mɛ Yezu nabɛ náá, nyɛ aadhaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Pyeeb nɛ bɔk. Bot ɛ mɛsa ààbu. Ye goka ɛ́ bi djaala náá, nakuma pyeeb nyɛ dhis bɛdhiiti bot ɛ mɛsa étɛp bɛ needis edee tɔ pyeeb. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Tɔ́ka! Mɛ kyeed bin tin ɛ́ dáa ebhata kuku eben. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Sa mot àànɔɔ ngwyɛ epata, àànɔɔ ɛkoo, àànɔɔ-nɔŋak dɔɔ nɛ mɛpapa. Sa mot ààbe tyɛ étɛp mɛswosel e ze. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Pɛ tɔ mendjaa mɛ bi aani ɛ, keka sok náá: “Betka náá, egwyem di tɔ ndjaŋ'ak!” <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />É di'enek, mot di nɛ egwyem ɛ di tin ɔɔ, egwyem bin ɛ́ waakala kɔ lɛ. Yɛ kabɛ náá, mot egwyem tok tin ɔɔ, egwyem bin ɛ́ waabula pɛ daa len. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Sulalka tɔ ndjaa mot egwyem é tak. Bi ɛ djɛaa mɛdii nɛ edee ɔɔ, da bi ɛ́ dɛ yɛ, etɛɛ náá, mot-mɛsa goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbela etuud e mɛsa mɛ. Sa mot ààkɛ mendjaa nɛ mendjaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Bi ɛ ni kɔ dɛl, da bɛ ɛ́ myaal bin ɔɔ, dɛka edee bɛ aadjɛ bin ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Tsikeka bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ di kɔ dɛl ɛ tak ɔ, da bi ɛ́ lɛɛ bot ɛ dɛl náá: “Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb eezekunaa nɛ nen.” <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Pɛ kɔ dhiiti mɛl mɛ bi aani, da bot ɛ́ mɛl mɛ tak ɛpɛɛ náá, bi nàsulal pɛ daa lɔɔ ɔ, tɔ́ka kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ dɛl, da bi ɛ́ lɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />“Bis ɛpekut piib mɛko mes. Yɛ ɛ́ piib dɛl ɛ len zenaata bis é mɛko ɛ. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, bi gu náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb moo ɛ́ ɛkunaaɛpe nɛ nen.” <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, bot ɛ dɛl ɛlak ɛ́ waapɛ́ɛaa ɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe dhaa-dhaŋak epɛ́ɛ bot ɛ ghaada Sodɔm.»<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eghaada ee di byen ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />«Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nɔ, dɛl ɛ Koodazin! Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nɔ, dɛl ɛ Bhɛtsaida! Etɛɛ náá, endem e mɛbwala mɛ nasael pɛ yebɔ ɛpedi náá, ye nasael ɛ́ pɛ ghaada Tiid nɛ yii Sidɔn ɔɔ, pe bot ɛ eghaada binɔk eeloobɔt kaad ɛpum, pe bɛ naazelɔɔba mɛsii, pe bɛ naaloozeliig elyem bɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ di elɛɛ bin náá, dwoo bot aadi epɛ́ɛaa ɛ́, yebɔ mɛpɛ́ɛa waadhaa yii Tiid nɛ Sidɔn nɛ mɛlyel. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Kapɛlnaum! Yɛ kabɛ wɔy ɔɔ, egeka bɔ ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbyet, tɔ́ pɛ tɔ gwoo? Wɔ waasila pɛ si, batakɛkum dɛl ɛ edim, yii bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Nyɛ eebaazɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Mot aagwak bin ɔ, nyɛ eegwak mɛ. Mot ɛ byen bin ɔɔ, nyɛ byen ɛ́ mam. Tin, mot ɛ byen mɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ eebyen mot nadhis mɛ ɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛbula ɛ bɛdjekel mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ ebá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Bɛdjekel mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ ebá (72) nalwomaa ɔ, eezɛbula nɛ mɛmyaala djas. Bɔɔ nɛ Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, dɔɔ nɛ embee esisim eelooba nɛ nes é sok bis di elii nɛ nɔɔ nɛ ghwyil din ɛ lɔ ɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ di ebee Satan é dus pɛ ɛko, sul pɛ kɔ bɔs tyee ngwyes bhi. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Gwakeka: Mɛ eedjɛ bin eghɛŋ ɛnyal bɛnyɔ, ebaalɔl, dɔɔ nɛ mɛbwala mɛ mot mɛbhuka djas. Ye tok nɛ sa yɛ aasa bin. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Tin, nàmyaalaka, etɛɛ náá: Embee esisim ɛpegwak bin. Bi goka nɛ ɛmyaala ɛ́, yɛ bɛ náá, min men ɛ́ kwyala tɔ gwoo ɔɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eemyaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />É ghɛŋ tak, Yezu naazɛbela boo mɛmyaala Sisim na Dɛɛ nadjɛ nyɛ ɛ́. Nyɛ eezɛtsim: «Heee Saagam, Ghɛŋ gwoo nɛ bɔs. Mɛ eeghaapɛɛ wɔ, étɛp náá, wɔ eelyaal bɔɔ dhyeeb esesɛɛ ee di syela é mis mɛ bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot nɛ bot ɛ mɛtselal ɛ. Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, Saagam, wɔ nɛ kwyɛl náá, ye sael deenek. <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Saagam naadjɛ mɛ esonok djas. Ye tok nɛ mot di egu Mɔn, yɛ di ààbɛ Sɛɛg ɔɔ. Tin, mot aanàkwaagu náá, Sɛɛg ɛzɛ, yɛ di ààbɛ Mɔn, nɛ mot Mɔn aakwyɛl ɛlyaal nyɛ nwyak ɔɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛliig mis, gwyák bɛdjekel, nyɛy nɛ bɔɔ bɛmet náá: «Mɛnyɔ nɛ biyɔ, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛpebee sa bi di ebee'enek! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Etɛɛ náá, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bɛtɛ nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ bɛmɛkoozi ɛbuɛpe nadi ɛ́, nɛ gwyes ɛbee esa ee bi di ebee'aak. Saabɛgɔs nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbee. Bɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ gwyes ɛgwak sa bi di egwak mos'aak, saabɛgɔs nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ náá, bɛ nabɛ ààgwak.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana mot Samaali na mbɛɛ lyem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Dhiiti lyoel etsi e Zɛɛb naazɛwyɛl, lii, étɛp ɛbowal ɛ Yezu. Nyɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Lyoel, mɛ sa dáa, étɛp mɛ neebela tsik na kɔm-kɔm?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yezu kabɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Haaa, yé nakwyalel tɔ mɛkana mɛ etsi bina? Wɔ gwak dáa tɔ tak?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Mot'enɔk zɛbɔɔza náá: «“Wɔ goka ɛ́ wɔ kwyɛl Ghɛŋ, Zɛɛb'ɔ nɛ lyem'ɔ djas, nɛ sisim'ɔ djas, nɛ ghwyil'ɔ djas, nɛ mɛtselal mɔ djas.” Zɛnɔɔ náá: “Wɔ goka ɛ́ wɔ kwyɛl sɔ'ɔ mot dáa wɔ di ekwyɛl nyel'ɔ met ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.27 <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Dɛt 6.5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Msa 19.18</ref></char></char></note>.”» <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yezu ɛ́ bookake nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ eebɔɔza ɛnyɔɛpe. Sa deenek, wɔ neebela tsik na kɔm-kɔm.»<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ghuna ghaa-mɛkana mɛ etsi nakwyɛl ɛ́, nyɛ neebela gham. Nyɛ ɛ́ boodji Yezu náá: «Sɔ'am mot ɛzɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yezu kadjɛ nyɛ kana ɛ́ náá: «Dhiiti motom nadi edus pɛ Yeluzalɛm, eesul pɛ Yeliko. Wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ djii zɛmɛt nyɛ, duma nyɛ é nyel nɛ mɛbin, bɔɔ zɛdɛk nyɛ esa bɛ djas. Bɛ eezɛkaab, lik nyɛ ekɔɔ nɛ ɛsyee. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Dhiiti ghaa-Zɛɛb nadi edhaa é ze'enek. É ghɛŋ nyɛ nabee mot'enɔk ɛ, nyɛ eezɛgwoob, tɔ́ yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Tyee wat nɛ dhiiti Levit<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Levit </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eLevit ɛ bot ɛ di esa mɛsa tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ.</char></note> eezɛkwyil é di'enek, bee mot mɛpyoŋ, gwoob nyɛ, tɔ́ yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Tin, dhiiti mot kyee dik Samaali nadi etɔ́ yɛ mɛdjoŋ ɔ naazɛkum é ngwoob mot mɛpyoŋ menɔk. Dáa nyɛ nakabee nyɛ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, ghoŋ zɛmɛt nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Nyɛ eezɛtiila é bhaaz'ɛ, zɛso nyɛ mɛnyok nɛ mul tɔ mɛpyoŋ, zɛdjɛl nyɛ yɛ ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛkɛl nyɛ kɔ yaaga yɛ, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ ndjaa bɛdjoŋ. Tin, nyɛ eezɛgwom nyɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Yii myɛn, mot dɛl Samaali yenɔk eezɛwyisal edhenye ebá e epata, zokadjɛ nakuma ndjaa bɛdjoŋ. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: “Gwoma motom'ak. Epata djas ee wɔ aadi ebaawyisal étɛp'ɛ ɛ, mɛ waaboobulal wɔ yɛ ɛ́, dwoo mɛ aabula ɛ.”»<figure style="fig" alt="Un homme de Samarie aide une personne qui a été frappée" file="WA03863b.tif" size="col" loc="10.35" copy="Graham Wade" ref="10.30-35">Mot Samaali ngɔt eekwyee mot na dumaa é nyel nɛ mɛbin ɔ</figure><verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yezu eebaazɛdji náá: «Tɔ bɔɔ bɛlɛl, ɛzɛ kɔa nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ mɔɔ sɔ mot bot ɛ djii namɛt ɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Ghaa etsi zokabɔɔza náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mot nagek nyɛ ghoŋ ɔ.» Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: «Tɔ́a, da wɔ kɛsa deenek.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu pɛ daa Maat nɛ Maali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Dáa Yezu nadi é ze, bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazɛni tɔ dhiiti dɛl. Tɔ dɛl ɛ tak ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti moma din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Maat. Nyɛ eezɛsulal pɛ daa lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhyeeb, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Maali. Maali tak nadi ɛ́ si mɛko ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu é gwak mɛlyo mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ye kabela ɛ́ náá, Maat nadi eghuula étɛp ɛdjaab ɛ edee e bɛdjoŋ. Maat ɛ́ boozyɛ zɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, wɔ ààbee dáa dhyeeb'am dhuugal mɛ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ yak mɛsa mam mɛ ɛmet'aak é? Lɛɛa nyɛ náá, nyɛ kwyee mɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Ghɛŋ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Maat, Maat, wɔ ɛpebem ba é etɛp e gwyes, lyem'ɔ ɛpesɔs etɛp ɛbuɛpe yii toto. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ sonok wat di nɛ boo mɛtaŋ ɛ. Maali eesɛ́ɛ sa di nɛ boo mɛtaŋ ɛ. Yiizaag ɛ́ di náá, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdɛk nyɛ yɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛpelyaal bɛdjekel bɛ, dáa bɛ di egoka nɛ ɛdjaala Zɛɛb ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Dhiiti dwoo, Yezu nadi edjaala é dhiiti di. Dáa nyɛ nasilal ɛ, djekel'ɛ ngɔt eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, lyaala bis ɛdjaala Zɛɛb, dáa Zaŋ nalyaal bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛ́ di edjaala ɔɔ, keka náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'es,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Ye goka ɛ́ náá,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">din ɛ lɔ di Dɛɛ ye guaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Ye goka ɛ, Ɛyoŋ ɛ lɔ zyɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Djɛ bis ɛlu nɛ ɛlu edee di egoka nɛ nes ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Pela mesyem mes etɛɛ náá, bisɔ pe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">bis ɛpepel bot ɛ di esa bis ɛbiyo ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Sa náá, bis nàkwyekwyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal.”»<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yezu eebaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Djhoopookogekeka tyee náá: mot ngɔt pak'en ɛ́ nɛ sɔ, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ daa lɛ kuku pum. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: “Sɔ'am, djema! Kola mɛ emapa elɛl, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />etɛɛ náá, dhiiti sɔ'am ngɔt nadi é mɛndjoŋ ɔ aloo nɛ tuula nenak pɛ daa lam. Mɛ tok nɛ edee mɛ djɛ nyɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Djhoopookogekeka náá, sɔ mot tak yala nyɛ tɔ ndjaa náá: “Beta mɛ gwyem! Ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa moo ɛ́ kɔɔla nɛ ɛngoŋ. Bis nɛ bɔn moo ɛ́ kpop mendjaamesi. Mɛ aanàkwaawyɛl, zɛdjɛ wɔ emapa é tak!” <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, yɛ bɛ náá, nyɛ aanàkwaawyɛl zɛdjɛ nyɛ sa nyɛ waab ɛ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛsɔ ɛ bɛ nɛ nɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ waabatawyɛl, zɛdjɛ nyɛ sa tak, etɛɛ náá, sɔ ɛpenaada ɛwaab, ààbɛ nɛ sen. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Yɛ bɛ mam ɔɔ, mɛ kalɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: Waabka, bi ɛ́ waadjɛaa. Saaka, bi ɛ́ waabela. Diigka é ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa, bɛ waadii bin yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek, mot aawaab ɔ, nyɛ waadjɛaa. Mot aasaŋ ɔ, nyɛ waabela. Bɛ dii ndjaŋ ɛ́, nɛ mot diig ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Yɛ bɛ náá, dhiiti mot pak'en ɛ́ sɛɛg mɔn ɔɔ, mɔn ɛ́ waab su ɔɔ, nyɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ mɔn nyɔ é di tak é? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Yɛ kabɛ náá, mɔn waab ɛ́ ɛke ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ nyɛ baalɔl é di tak é? Yɛ aanàkwaasael. <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Kwyii biyɔ, bɛmbee ɛ bot bi di ɛ, bi nɛ gu ɛdjɛ embɛɛ esonok nɛ bɔn bin, gwyata nɛ Sɛɛg'en di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ, nyɛ waadjɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ nɛ mot aawaab ɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eezɛbɔɔza dum nɛ tɛp nyɛ natilaa gwyes ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Dhiiti dwoo, Yezu nadi esɔ embee esisim nanɛɛg dhiiti mot bubu ɛ. Wɔ gwaa, embee esisim zokawyis tɔ mot'enɔk, bubu mot'enɔk moo tin elii. Tin, ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ moo tin edjoka. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />É di'enek, bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ moo tin eke pak'ɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ Bɛlzebul, kukuma embee esisim ɛ di edjɛ kɔkɔ yak mbi mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ di esɔ embee esisim nɛ yɛ ɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bɛdhiiti nadi ekwyɛl ɛlóo ɛ nyɛ pɛ ɛko, da bwood nyɛ pɛ kyɛ. Bɛ ɛ́ boolɛɛ nɛ nɛ náá: «Sa bis dhiiti tseŋa mɛbwala di elyaal náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ nadhis wɔ ɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Tin, Yezu nabɛ ɛ́, egu egeka e elyem bɔɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ɛyoŋ ɛ di náá, mɛsa mɛ bot ɛ tak ɛ́ ɛwaya pak'ɔɔ ɛ, ɛyoŋ ɛ tak aanàkwaadi. Bɔn bil wat ɛ di egónel pak'ɔɔ, yenek tak aanàkwaadi. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Yɛ bɛ náá, Satan ɛ́ di etwak nyel'ɛ nyɛ ɛmet ɔɔ, ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ aapyet dáa? Etɛɛ náá, bi ke ɛ́ náá, mɛ twak embee esisim ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ Bɛlzebul djɛ mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛ sɔ embee esisim ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ Bɛlzebul ɔɔ, haaa yebɔ bot aasɔ embee esisim nɛ yaa ghwyil? Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, bot bin bɔɔ bɛmet aadi ɛ́ bɛtetɛp bin. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ mɛ di esɔ embee esisim. Ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ náá, ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb moo ɛ́ wak nɛ nena é di wat.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />É ghɛŋ mot ghwyil di nɛ mɛkɔɔ mɛ dɛɛb di ebaal ndjaŋ'ɛ ɔ, esa bɛ djas ɛ́ waabaalaa ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Yɛ bɛ náá, dhiiti mot di edhaa nyɛ nɛ ghwyil eezyɛ, nyɛ kwak ɛbhaad nyɛ si ɔɔ, bhii tak, nyɛ dɛk nyɛ mɛkɔɔ mɛ dɛɛb mɛ nyɛ nadi ebebwaal ɔ, da nɔɔ esa bɛ djas ɛ́ kaa.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Mot di ààdi pɛ yam kyee ɔ, ye lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, mot tak ɛ́ mot di ebhina mɛ ɔ. Zɛnɔɔ náá, mot di ààkwyee mɛ é ɛsɛɛg ɛ bot ɔ, nyɛ waaz ɛ́ waazak.»<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛbula ɛ mbee sisim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />«É sok mbee sisim di ewyis tɔ nyel mot ɛ, ye dyeebawyis ɛ́ tɔ́ pɛ kyee dik bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, étɛp ɛkɛsaa di yɛ aakɛwala ɔ. Yɛ di ààbela di ɔɔ, yɛ kake ɛ́ náá: “Mɛ pookosik pɛ ndjaŋ'am, ndjaa mɛ nawyis tɔ tak ɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Tin, sika yɛ aakasik ɛ, yɛ kabela ndjaa tak, toto, waabela, koobela ɔɔ, <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />É di'enek, nyɛ katɔ́ ɛ́ kɛnɔɔ edhiiti embee esisim bɛ na nyan-nyan bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá di edhaa nyɛ nɛ embee mɛsa ɔ. Tin, bɔɔ djas kazɛni ɛ́ tɔ ndjaa tak, da be di. É di'enek, tsik yenɔk mot eezepulel dhaa-dhaŋak yii nabɛ sok ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɛtɛ ekum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Dáa Yezu nadi elii deenek ɛ́, dhiiti moma zokazɛben gwood tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot, nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛnyɔ nɛ moma nabɛp ɛbum ɛ lɔ ɔ! Mɛnyɔ nɛ mɛbel mɛ wɔ nadɛ ɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛnyɔ nɛ nen, bot ɛ di egwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, da bi ɛ́ kɛ dáa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwyeebel tseŋa mɛbwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Dáa mɛdhuu mɛ bot nadi esaala é ngwoob ɛ Yezu ɛ, nyɛ moo tin eke náá: «Bot ɛ di kɔ bɔs'ak mos'aak, bɛ àànyɔ bot. Bɛ ɛpewaab dhiiti tseŋa mɛbwala mɛ Zɛɛb. Bɛ aanàkwaakobee dhiiti wat, yɛ di ààbɛ yii ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Zonas ɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Deenek, tyee wat Zonas nadi tseŋa é mis mɛ bot ɛ ghaada Niniv ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aadi tseŋa étɛp bot ɛ di kɔ bɔs'ak mos'aak. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, mɛkoozi mɛ moma mɛl mɛ di pɛ kyɛ bɔs ɛ́ waazyɛ, zɛtyaa sok bhwoob bot ɛ kɔkɔ mɛbyel mɛ di kɔ bɔs mos'aak étɛp ɛpit bɛ, deenek, nyɛ neekwyesal bɛ ndjɛ sɔs. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadus ɛ́ pɛ edum e bɔs étɛp ɛzɛgwak mbɛɛ mɛlyo mɛ etsoŋ e mɛkoozi Salomɔŋ. Ye nyɔ ɛ́, bi gu náá, mot di nenak wak'aak, nyɛ eedhaa Salomɔŋ! <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />É dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, bot ɛ ghaada Niniv waazyɛ, zɛtyaa sok bhwoob bot ɛ kɔkɔ mɛbyel mɛ di kɔ bɔs mos'aak étɛp ɛpit bɛ. Tin, nyɛ waazɛkwyesal bɛ ndjɛ sɔs, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ ghaada Niniv naazeliig elyem bɔɔ, bhii bɛ nazegwak mɛlyo ɛ Zonas ɛ. Ghuna yii di wak ɛ, yɛ eedhaa-dhaŋak yɛ Zonas!»<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lama nyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />«Mot aanàkwaatuub lama, da nyɛ ɛ́ butal yɛ si bhwaa, yɛ ààsael deenek. Ye goka nɛ ɛkɛlaa ɛ́, pɛ kɔ tɛɛg, etɛɛ náá, bot djas aadi eni tɔ ndjaŋ ɔ needi tɔ gwyɛ tak. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Mis mɔ ɛ́ dáa lama nyel'ɔ. Mis mɔ ɛ di enyaasok ɛnyɔɛpe ɔɔ, gua náá, nyel'ɔ djas ɛ́ tɔ selele. Yɛ kabɛ náá, mis mɔ àànyaasok ɔɔ, nyel'ɔ djas ɛ́ tɔ ghooghom. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ mɛ di elɛɛ wɔ náá, wɔ di tsoŋ mot étɛp ɛbaal eselele di tɔ lɔ ɛ, ekaab náá, eselele bin ɛzɛkɛliiza ghooghom. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Yɛ bɛ náá, nyel'ɔ djas ɛ́ tɔ selele, ààbɛ nɛ kyee nyel wat di tɔ ghooghom ɔɔ, nyel'ɔ djas aadi ɛ́, tɔ gwyɛ, dáa lama di edjɛ wɔ gwyɛ nɛ mɛkas mɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eetil eFalizyɛ bɛ nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Dáa Yezu nasilal ɛlii ɛ, dhiiti Falizyɛ zokadjóo nyɛ, nyɛ zɛdɛ pɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ. Yezu zokani tɔ ndjaa mot tak, nɔɔ nyel, disi kɔ mesa. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Falizyɛ yenɔk zokadjoka dáa nyɛ nabee náá, Yezu nabɛ ààgwyii mɛmbɔ ɛsok nɛ nyɛ nɛ dɛ edee ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Tin, Ghɛŋ ɛ́ booke nɛ Falizyɛ yenɔk náá: «Beeka dáa biyɔ eFalizyɛ di ɛ. Bi dyeebagwyii ɛ́ ekoŋ e ebɛɛlɛ nɛ ekoŋ e esaan. Yɛ kabɛ tɔ mɔ tak ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ tɔɔɔ nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ djii nɛ mbee lyem dhaa nyel. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Bi ààtselal, Zɛɛb mot nasa koŋ tak ɔ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbaasa mɔ tak é? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Djɛka bɛdjel ɛ bot esa ee di tɔ emɔ ebɛɛlɛ bin ɛ. Deenek ɛ esonok djas aadi, dɛɛ étɛp'en.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ biyɔ eFalizyɛ, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛpetuud Zɛɛb ndyaal wat tɔ endyaal kam e nadjeebe nɛ eka e na mbɛɛ mɛnuub nɛ aghomkɔtɔ, zɛnɔɔ mɛwyee mɛ di ebɛaa tɔ bok ɛ. Da bi kadi ɛ́ ààwa lyem tɔ epiki nɛ kwyɛl ɛ Zɛɛb. Yenek djas ɛ́ sa di egoka náá, bot du mɛlu djas nɛ zii, ààbet dhiiti sonok ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ biyɔ eFalizyɛ, etɛɛ náá, bi kwyɛl ɛ́, mɛbhóó mɛ pɛ sok étɛp ɛtela mɛnyel tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda, bi nɛ kwyɛl ɛswosaa nɛ duu kɔ mɛbɛsɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ biyɔ, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ dáa mɛvit mɛ di àànyɔ ɛnyen ɛ, mɛvit mɛ bot di ekɛ kɔ tak ààgu ɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Mot ngɔt tɔ bɛlyoel ɛ etsi e Zɛɛb zokazɛdji nyɛ náá: «Lyoel, dáa wɔ di elii deenek'enek, wɔ lee tin ɛ́ dɔɔ nɛ bisɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Kpaa-ghoŋ dɔɔ nɛ biyɔ, bɛlyoel ɛ etsi e Zɛɛb! Bi ɛpekɛl kɔ ekoŋ e bot mɛkɔm mɛ na dil-dil, da bi ɛ́ kadi, ààkosɛɛb-sɛɛbak djin wat bi neekogek mɛdil mɛ mɛkɔm mɛ tak. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛpesum mɛvit mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, bot ɛ bɛbhaab bin nagó ɛ! <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />É sok bi di esa deenek ɛ́, bi lyaal ɛ́ náá, bi eemyaal embee esesɛɛ bɛbhaab bin, etɛɛ náá, bɛ naagó bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, yɛ ɛ́ biyɔ ɛ kadi esum mɛvit mɔɔ! <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ etsoŋ bɛ, nake náá: “Mɛ waakyeed bɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ bot ɛ lwoma, bɛ waagó bɛdhiiti, da bɛ ɛ́ wa bɛdhiiti tɔ tsik mezuk.” <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Kana ɛkus ɛ bɔs, bɛtɛ nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb naadyeebagóaa, étɛp tak ɛ di náá, esesɛɛ binek djas kwyɛ kɔ elo e kɔkɔ bot ɛ di kɔ bɔs dwoo mos'ak. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Kana dwoo ɛsyee ɛ Abhɛl, kɛyaka nɛ yɛ Zakaali, mot nagóaa pak mesa-ebuwa, nɛ Di na Dɛɛ ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ. Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, esesɛɛ binek djas kwyɛ kɔ elo e kɔkɔ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ bot ɛ dika mos'aak.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ, bɛlyoel ɛ etsi e Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá, bi eezediyal ze di etɔ́ nɛ bot pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɛ. Biyɔ bɛmet bi ààpakɛ é ze tak. Tin, bi ɛpela bot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛdhaa é ze tak ɔ, ze.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Dáa Yezu nawyis tɔ ndjaŋ'enek ɛ, eFalizyɛ nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi moo tin nɛ mɛbuk tɔ elyem. Bhii tak bɛ moo tin edji nyɛ bɛtɛ nɛ ekiya dum nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ etɛp. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />É di'enek, bɛ nadi elóo nyɛ pɛ ɛko, da bwood nyɛ pɛ kyɛ étɛp bɛ neebela mɛkpa mɛ bɛ aapit nyɛ nɛ yɛ ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛpedul bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si mɛlɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />É ghɛŋ tak, bot eezɛsɛɛga é di tak. Mɛbu mɛ bot bɛdhet nɛ bɛdhet ɛkɛɛ ɛ yɛ aasa náá, bɛdhiiti nyalel pak'ɔɔ. Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Ɛsok nɛ esonok djas, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bi kyee leviid eFalizyɛ. Ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́, mɛfulu mɔɔ yii mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko bhimis pɛ si. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Esesɛɛ djas di syela ɛ, yɛ waawyis é gwyɛ, etɛp ee nadi tɔ sɔ ɛ, yɛ waaguaa nɛ bot djas. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, etɛp djas bi aadi elii tɔ ghooghom ɛ, yɛ aadi egék é gwyɛ mwos dwoo. Sa bi nadi enyiiŋela tɔ ɛlɔ pɛ tɔ dhɛŋ ɛ, yɛ aadi ɛ́ moo tuudaa kɔ emii e mendjaa.»<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sa mot di egoka nɛ ɛkaab ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />«Biyɔ bɛsɔ bam, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, nàkaabka sa di egó epuud, bhii tak, ye kadi ɛ́ ààsa dhiiti sonok. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Mɛ pookolyaal bin sa bot di egoka nɛ ɛkaab dhaa nyel ɛ. Bi goka nɛ kaab ɛ́ Zɛɛb, mot di náá, bhis ɛsyee, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkɛmwas bin tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm ɔ. Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ bi di egoka nɛ ɛkaab! <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Bot djas nɛ gu náá, bɔɔ enen etɛn dyeebabɔmsaa ɛ́ nɛ efalanga ebá. Kabela náá, ye tok nɛ sa Zɛɛb aadjisa é mis mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Deenek, bhoo elo bin ɛ́ elaŋa, sa mot ààdi nɛ bwoo, etɛɛ náá, é mis ɛ Zɛɛb, bi ɛ́ nɛ boo mɛtaŋ, dhaa bɔɔ enen!»<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛmyaal nɛghu ɛswonal Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />«Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, mot aamyam popoopwon é mis mɛ bot djas náá, nyɛ ɛ́ djekel'am ɔ, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot pe ɛ́ waamyam nyɛ é mis mɛ efofop ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Tin, mot ɛ kɛla popoopwon é mis mɛ bot djas náá, nyɛ tok djekel'am ɔɔ, mam pe, mɛ waakɛla nyɛ é mis mɛ efofop ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Yɛ bɛ náá, dhiiti mot eelóo mbee ɛkpa nɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɔɔ, mot tak ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbela ɛpelak. Yɛ kabɛ náá, mot eebyasal Sisim na Dɛɛ ɔɔ, yenɔk aanàkwaabela ɛpelak.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />É sok bɛ aatɔ́ nɛ nen tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda nɛ pɛ daa ekukuma nɛ bɛmɛkoozi ɛ, sa mot ààbem ba dum nɛ dáa bi aataŋal nɛ mɛkpa mɛ bi aalóo ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Etɛɛ náá, é di'enek wat Sisim na Dɛɛ waalyo bin dáa bi di egoka nɛ ɛtaŋal ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana kum mot di ààbɛ nɛ lyem ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Mot ngɔt tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ zokazɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyoel! Lɛɛa nɛ mɔn-nyaagam náá, bis kaa esa ee sɛɛg'es nalik ɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɔɔ sɔ'am, ɛzɛ nɛɛg mɛ tetɛp dum nɛ etɛp bin, dɔɔ nɛ étɛp ɛkaa esa ee sɛɛg'en nalik bin nɛ yɛ ɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛ́ kobaka nɛ dɔɔb mɛvu, etɛɛ náá, tsik mot tok étɛp mɛvu, ye nakoozodi náá, mot tak ɛ́ kum mot.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ bɛ kana yak: «Dhiiti kum mot nadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛdhik mɛ nadi esa náá, nyɛ gó bhek ɛbuɛpe ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Nyɛ moo tin esiiza, nyɛy náá: “Mɛ sa dáa, etɛɛ náá, mɛ tok nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ edi étɛp mɛ neekwom edee mɛ gó tɔ pyeeb'am ɛ?” <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛke náá: “Beea dáa mɛ aasa ɛ: mɛ waawaaz etaa bam, da mɛ ɛ́ lóo etaa na bɔk-bɔk. Tin, da mɛ ɛ́ wa embɛɛ mɛbhek mam nɛ mɛvu mam djas.” <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Bhii tak, mɛ kake nɛ nyel'am ɛ náá: “Mɔɔ sɔ'am, ye di deenek, wɔ moo ɛ́ nɛ mɛvu ɛbuɛpe aadjala étɛp membu ɛbuɛpe ɛ. Wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkawala. Dɛa edee nɛ mɛdii, dia tɔ mɛmyaala.” <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Tin, Zɛɛb zokazɛke nɛ nɛ: “Wɔy mot di ààbɛ nɛ lyem'aak! É pum'ak mos, mɛ ɛpenɔɔ mengwyil mɔ. É di'enek, esesɛɛ ee wɔ kwom ɛ, ɛzɛ aakabe yɛ?”» <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yezu eebaazɛke náá: «Yɛ aadi ɛ́ deenek, dum nɛ bot ɛ di esaa mɛvu mɛ mɛnyel mɔɔ met, ghuna é mis ɛ Zɛɛb, bɛ kadi ɛ́, ààbɛ bɛkum ɛ bot.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Yezu eezɛke bhii tak nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ di elɛɛ nɛ nen náá: Nàbemka ba kɔ ɛsu ɛ tsik'en dum nɛ tɛp edee bi aadɛ ɛ, ààkoobɛ-bɛaak mɛnyel men dum nɛ ekaad bi aabɔt ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Etɛɛ náá, tsik eedhaa edee, nyel eedhaa ekaad nɛ mɛtaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Beeka enen ee di djóoaa kɔlbo ɔ, bɛ ààbɛ epyeeb, ààbɔ́k edee ee di ewum tɔ epyeeb ɛ. Bɛ tok nɛ edi ɛkwom edee tɔ bhwaa nɛ kɔ etaa, dhi Zɛɛb di edjɛ bɛ edee! Biyɔ, bi eedhaa enen nɛ boo mɛtaŋ! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛpebem ba ɔɔ, ɛzɛ pak'en di nɛ ghwyil ɛbil ba ɛlu ɛ wat kɔ mɛlu mɛ tsik'ɛ?<verse eid="LUK 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛkwak ɛsa ba sa dem ɔɔ, haaa étɛp yé bi di ebem ba kɔ ɛsu ɛ yii kalik'enek? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Pookogwyákeka dáa mɛzɛm di ewyee tɔ mɛdhik ɛ. Bɛ ààsa mɛsa, bɛ ààlat ekaad. Tin, ye goka ɛ́, mɛ lɛɛ bin náá, ye nakoozobɛ mɛkoozi Salomɔŋ mot nadi nɛ boo duu ɔ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ mbɛɛ kaad nadi enyɔ dhaa zɛm wat tɔ kɔkɔ mɛzɛm menek. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Kwyii Zɛɛb di ebét eka ee di tɔ dik mos, da djɛmɛn yɛ ɛ́ nɔŋaa, dikaa tɔ du ɛ, tin, haaa gwyata nɛ biyɔ, Zɛɛb tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsa deenek nɛ nen é! Biyɔ, bot ɛ di náá, bi tok nɛ boo ɛmyaal nɛ nɛ ɔ! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Nàdhekeka mɛnyel men étɛp ɛsesaa ngwyis edee nɛ mɛdii mɛ bi aadɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak ɔ, di ebwos esa binek mɛlu djas. Guka náá, Sɛɛg'en nɛ gu egwyes bin. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Pookosaaka sok Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. Bhii tak, nyɛ waadjɛ bin esa djas bi di nɛ gwyes tak ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛkwom ɛ ekum tɔ gwoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />«Wɔy, mɔɔ ɛsaa ɛ Zɛɛb, nàbem ba, etɛɛ náá, Sɛɛg'en kwyɛl ɛ́, nyɛ djɛ bin Ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Bɔmsaka ekum bin. Da bi ɛ́ kaa epata e tak nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot. Saka mengwyɛ mɛ epata ee di ààgwyɛ ɛ. Kwomka ekum bin pɛ daa Zɛɛb pɛ yɛ aadi ààdiib ɛ. Penek, bot ɛ djii aanàkwaani kɛdjii yɛ, bɛsɛs aanàkwaagɔɔ yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Saka deenek, etɛɛ náá, é di mot di ekwom ekum bɛ ɔ, lyem'ɛ di ɛ́ tin.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana bot ɛ mɛsa di ndjem ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />«Dika ghwyɛ nɛ bhɛtɛ é kuu nɛ elama tuuba. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Dika dáa bot ɛ mɛsa di ebwood kukuma yɔbɔ, étɛp náá, é sok nyɛ aabula pɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ ɛba, da nyɛ ɛ́ diig ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaŋ ɛ, bi neeleedii nyɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ mɛsa aadi ndjem é ghɛŋ kukuma yɔbɔ aatuula ɛ. Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, kukuma nyɛ ɛmet ɛ́ waabɔt ekaad e mɛsa mɛ, da bhii tak nyɛ ɛ́ dil bɛ kɔ mesa, da nyɛ ɛ́ djɛ bɛ edee. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Nyɛ bula kuku ɛgha ɛ pum ɔɔ, nɛghu ebhaa mɛlem ɔɔ, da nyɛ ɛ́ bela bɛ ghwyɛ ɔ, mɛnyɔ nɛ nɔɔ ɛbuɛpe!<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Gwakeka sa mɛ di elɛɛ ɛ: Yɛ bɛ náá, nakuma ndjaŋ ɛpedi ɛ́ di egu ɛwala ɛ mot djii aazyɛ zɛdjii tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ ɔɔ, pe nyɛ aanàkwaabet nyɛ náá, nyɛ zɛni tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Biyɔ pe, dika ghwyɛ, etɛɛ náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aatuula ɛ́ é ɛwala bi aadi ààbwood nyɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot-mɛsa di sosoob ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, wɔ lɛɛ kana yak ɛ́, étɛp bisɔ bɛmet ohoo, étɛp bot djas?» <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Wɔ gwaa, Ghɛŋ zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ɛzɛ di mot-mɛsa na sosoob nɛ etsoŋ? Yɛ ɛ́ mot di náá, kukuma yɛ eedjɛ nyɛ ze náá, nyɛ baal ndjaŋ'ɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ djɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ mɛsa yɔbɔ edee é tɛtɛ ɛwala. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ mot-mɛsa menɔk, mot kukuma yɛ bula zɛbela nyɛ, nyɛy esa mɛsa mɛ menek ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, kukuma yenɔk ɛ́ waadjɛ mot-mɛsa menɔk esa bɛ djas, nyɛ baal. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Tin, mot-mɛsa menɔk ɛ kake náá: “Kukuma aanàkwaaleebula.” Nyɛ kadi eduma boa nɛ botom ɛ di esa mɛsa tin é nyel nɛ mɛbin, da nyɛ di edɛ edee nɛ ɛkuka mɛnyok ɔɔ, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />tin, kukuma yɛ aabula ɛ́, é dwoo mot-mɛsa menɔk aadi epel náá, nyɛ aanàkwaazyɛ ɛ, é ɛwala mot-mɛsa di ààgu ɛ. Tin, nyɛ waasɔ mot-mɛsa menɔk, da nyɛ ɛ́ lyaal nyɛ kyet bɛ di esa nɛ bot ɛ di ààdi sosoob nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Mot-mɛsa di egu sa lyem kukuma yɛ di ekwyɛl, da nyɛ ɛ́ kadi ɛ́, ààsa yɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ waabiaa nɛ ghwyɛs ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Yɛ bɛ náá, mot-mɛsa ààgu ɛkwosak ɛ kukuma yɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ di ekɛ ɛbiyoɛpe ɔɔ, yɛ mɛbin aadi ɛ́, ba bim. Mot ɛ djɛaa bɛtɛ nɛ esa ɔɔ, nyɛ waawaab ɛ́ ɛbuɛpe. Bɛ kwom esa ɛbuɛpe pɛ daa mot ɔɔ, bɛ aabaazowaab nyɛ ɛ́ ɛbuɛpe kɛdhaa.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eewa mɛbɛka pak bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />«Mɛ nazyɛ ɛ, zɛwa du kɔ bɔs. Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, du tak kadi tuuba! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ye goka ɛ́ náá, mɛ duwa kɔkɔ mbi ɛduwa Zɛɛb sis. Mɛ ɛpebwood ɛduwa Zɛɛb tak nɛ lyem pɛ ɛko, lyem'am ɛ́ pɛ ɛko kɛkum dwoo ɛduwa Zɛɛb ɛlenek aasael ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 12:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Bi gek ɛ́ náá, mɛ nazyɛ kɔ bɔs ɛ́, étɛp egwyem tɔ bot é? Ààbɛ, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ zɛwa egwyem nɛ ɛgwakel tɔ bot. Mɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛkus ɛghuub nɛ ɛzɛbɛk ɛ bot. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Kana dwoo pan mos'ak, bot ɛtɛn di tɔ mɛbyel mɛ wat ɔ waabɛka. Bot ɛlɛl ɛ́ waabhina bot ɛbá, bot ɛbá ɛ́ waabhina bak bɛlɛl. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Sɛɛg ɛ́ waabhina mɔn'ɛ mɔɔ motom, mɔn tak bhina sɛɛg. Nyɛɛg ɛ́ waabhina mɔn'ɛ mɔɔ moma, mɔn tak bhina nyɛɛg. Bhɛɛbel moma ɛ́ waabhina nakɔla, nakɔla bhina bhɛɛbel moma.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛgu ɛlaŋ ɛ endem tɔ gwoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yezu nadi ebaake nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot náá: «É sok bi dyeebabee eguud ekɛghɛɛ pɛ ɛbil ɛ dwoo ɛ, é di tak wat, bi dyeebake ɛ́ náá: “Bhi ɛ́ waanee.” Yɛ aabataswaala ɛ́ nee. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Yɛ kabɛ, é sok bi di ebee pup ekɛghɛɛ pɛ kyɛ bɔs ɛ, bi dyeebake ɛ́ náá: “Gwyes ɛ́ waakas mos ɛbuɛpe.” Yɛ aabataswaala ɛ́ deenek. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si, bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsiiza ɛnyɔɛpe endem ee di kɔ bɔs ɛ, nɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ. Haaa étɛp yé bi di ààgu sa ɛwala ɛ mena dika'aak di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛgwakel pak bi nɛ mɔn-nyoog</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />«Étɛp yé biyɔ bɛmet di ààgu ɛpɛ́ɛ náá: “Yak ɛ́ mbɛɛ sonok”? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ ɛpekɛtaŋal bi nɛ mot ɔɔ, bi nɛ mot tak ɛ́ di edjaad ze wat, étɛp ɛtɔ́ pɛ bɛ aakɛpɛ́ɛ bin ɔɔ, sa mɛghaaz bi lel ɛgwakel é di bi dinaa é ze'enek. Deenek wɔ waalu náá, mot bi nɛ nɛ di nɛ tɛp ɔ nàdul wɔ sok bhwoob bɛtetɛp, da bɛtetɛp ɛ́ kɛdjɛ wɔ é mɛmbɔ mɛ esodja, da wɔ ɛ́ waaa é mbok. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Mɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ́ náá, wɔ aanàkwaawyis tin, wɔ di ààtuud dɔɔ nɛ falanga ɛsik ɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Ɛliig ɛ elyem nɛghu ɛsyee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />É ghɛŋ tak, bɛdhiiti bot zokazyɛ zɛlɛɛ Yezu dáa mɛkoozi Pilat nagó bot ɛ Ghalile é sok bɛ nadi edjɛ Zɛɛb ebuwa e bɛtit ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yezu ɛ́ boobɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi gek bilak ɛ́ náá, bot ɛ Ghalile binɔk zukaa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi ɛ́ bot ɛ mesyem dhaa bot ɛ Ghalile djas é? Ààbɛ! <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Betka, mɛ lɛɛ bin náá, bi ɛ di ààliig elyem ɔɔ, biyɔ djas pe ɛ́ waagwyɛ dáa bot binɔk. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Tin, bot kam nɛ bɛtɛn nɛ bɛlɛl yii ndjaa Silowe na vyɛɛg-vyɛɛg nagó, é sok ye nabik ɛ, bi ke bilak ɛ́ náá, bɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ mesyem dhaa bot ɛ Yeluzalɛm djas é? Ààbɛ! <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Betka, mɛ lɛɛ bin náá, bi ɛ di ààliig elyem ɔɔ, biyɔ djas pe ɛ́ waagwyɛ dáa bot binɔk.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana le fiigh di ààwum ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛlii nɛ nɔɔ tɔ kana náá: «Mot ngɔt nadi ɛ́, nɛ le fiigh tɔ pyeeb vin yɛ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛsaa ɛbɔ́k ɛ bhum, nyɛ kadi ɛ́, ààbela sonok. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ mot di ebaal pyeeb vin tak ɔ: “Beea, ye moo mos ɛ́, membu melɛl mɛ di ezyɛ zɛsaa bhum le fiigh'ak ɛ, mɛ ààbela yɛ. Tsaala yɛ, etɛɛ náá, yɛ ààgoka nɛ ɛnɔɔ yenek boo di tin gwyes.” <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Tin, mot di ebaal pyeeb vin tak eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: “Ghɛŋ, pookobaabet yɛ mbu yak. Mɛ waapu guk é mengwoob. Bhii tak, da mɛ ɛ́ wa eka nɛ ezeeza. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Deenek, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛwum bilak é mbu di ezyɛ yenek. Yɛ di ààkawum ɔɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ katsaal yɛ.”»<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eetsik dhiiti moma na djam é dwoo saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Dhiiti dwoo saba, Yezu nadi elyo bot Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Dhiiti mbel moma nadi ɛ́ tɔ ndjaa tak. Kana membu kam nɛ etɛn nɛ elɛl, ye nabɛ ɛ́ dhiiti mbee sisim naazenyak nyɛ koŋ. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛsek ɛ koŋ. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Dáa Yezu nabee moma tak ɛ, nyɛ eezɛdjóo nyɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ moo ɛ́ pɛka si bhel ɛbɛ́ ɛ lɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Nyɛ eezɛkɛl mɛmbɔ kɔ lɛ, é di tak wat, koŋ eezɛsekel nyɛ. Moma tak moo tin eduwal Zɛɛb.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ kukuma ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda naadyeebakpaa lyem dum nɛ dáa Yezu natsik mot dwoo saba ɛ. Kukuma tak ɛ́ booke nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot náá: «Bot ɛ́ nɛ mɛlu mɛtɛn nɛ wat bot di esa mɛsa ɛ. Dhaka zɛtsikaa é mɛlu menek, ààkabɛ dwoo saba.» <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Ghɛŋ zokazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bi ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si. Dwoo saba, mot nɛ mot aadi etii ngɔmbɛ nɛghu an yɛ étɛp ɛkɛdjɛ bɛ edee nɛ mɛdii, etsal é? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Moma yak ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ bɛdha ɛ Abalaam. Tin, kabela ɛ náá, Satan naazelookɔl nyɛ, ye moo mos ɛ́ nɛ membu kam nɛ etɛn nɛ elɛl (18). Ye bɛ ɛ́ ààgoka náá, nyɛ tsikaa é dwoo saba?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Bhɔɔza Yezu nabɔɔza deenek ɛ́, ye naasa bot ɛ nadi ebhina nyɛ ɔ boo sen. Yɛ kabɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot djas nadi tinaak ɔɔ, bɔɔ naadyeebamyaala nɛ esesɛɛ e duu djas nasɛ́ɛ tin ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana mɔɔ bhek di edjóoaa mutaad ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yezu eebaazɛke náá: «Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb kokɔa nɛ yaa mbi sa? Mɛ goka nɛ ɛgek yɛ nɛ yaa sonok? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ dáa bhek na sikɛ-sikɛ di edjóoaa mutaad ɛ. É sok mot di enɔɔ yɛ étɛp ɛkɛbɛ tɔ bok ɛ, bhek nɛ kwyil, wyee, zyɛ boo le, enen lóo mɛk mɔɔ kɔ elɛɛ e tak.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana leviid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yezu zokabaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ koogek bin Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ yaa sonok? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb nɔŋel ɛ́ nɛ leviid moma di ewa tɔ boo ɛdham ɛ tsim nyɛ di epul, étɛp nyɛ neesa mapa nɛ yɛ ɛ. Ba ɛwala bhii tak, tsim'enek djas aadi ɛ́, yɛ eezeghamta.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa na maad-maad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yezu nadi edhaa kɔ eghaada nɛ kɔ mɛl elyo bot Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nyɛy etɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Dhiiti mot eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, Zɛɛb aazotsik ɛ́ ba bim bot é?» Yezu zɛbɔɔza náá: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Lyelka ghwyil étɛp bi neeni tɔ ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa na maad-maad, etɛɛ náá, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ́ waagek ɛni penek, bɛ aanàkwaakwak ɛni.<verse eid="LUK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />É sok kukuma ndjaŋ aawyɛl ɛ, nyɛ waakɔɔl ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa nɛ ɛngoŋ. Tin, biyɔ, bi ɛ́ waalik pɛ kel. Bhii tak, bi ɛ́ waazuk é ɛdiig ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa nɛ é ke náá: “Ghɛŋ! Diia bis ndjaa!” Nyɛ kabɔɔza nɛ nen ɛ náá: “Mɛ ààgu pɛ bi dus ɛ!” <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Deenek, bi aakabɔɔza nɛ nɛ ɛ́ náá: “Mena naadɛka edee nɛ mɛdii é di wat. Wɔ nadi elyo Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb é egba eghaada bis.” <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Nyɛ aabaazoke nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ náá: “Mɛ ààgu pɛ bi dus ɛ, duska é mis mam, biyɔ djas, bot ɛ di esa embee mɛsa ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bi aadje mɛgwyɛ, nɛ ɛkwaal ɛ mɛtsok, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ waabee Abalaam, Izak, Zakɔɔb, zɛnɔɔ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb penek tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, bi aadi ɛ́ mwasaa pɛ kel. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Bot ɛ́ waadus pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo nɛ pɛ ɛbil ɛ dwoo, bɛdhiiti dus pɛ kyɛ bɔs nɛ pɛ ɛko ɛ bɔs. Bɛ waazɛdi kɔ mesa wat tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Tin, guka náá, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ di mos pɛ ɛbhis ɛ lɔɔg ɔ, bɛ aakaswaala ɛ́ bot ɛ pɛ sok lɔɔg, bot ɛ di mos pɛ sok lɔɔg ɔ, bɛ aakaswaala ɛ́ bot ɛ ɛbhis.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu nɛ Yeluzalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />É di tak wat, bɛdhiiti eFalizyɛ eezɛzyɛ zɛlɛɛ Yezu náá: «Dusa wak, tɔ́a pɛ kyee sis, etɛɛ náá, mɛkoozi Eelood ɛpesaa nyɛ neegó wɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ́ka, kɛlɛɛ bɛbhɛk binɔk náá: “Mɛ ɛpesɔ embee esisim, mɛ ɛpetsik membel dwoo mos nɛ djɛmɛn. É ɛlu ɛ elɛl ɛ́ mɛ aasilal mɛsa mam.” <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ye goka ɛ́ náá, mɛ kɛ mos, nɛ djɛmɛn nɛ bhii djɛmɛn, etɛɛ náá, yɛ ààgoka náá, ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb gwyɛ ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Yeluzalɛm! Yeluzalɛm! Wɔy mot di egó bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, wɔy mot di egó bot ɛ Zɛɛb di edhis wɔ bak nɛ mɛkok ɔ. É sok edhen mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛsɛɛg bot ɛ di kɔ dɛl ɛ lɔ dáa nabwa-kuu di esɛɛg bɔn bɛ si mɛbhap mɛ ɛ, biyɔ ààkwyɛl! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Deenek, guka náá, ndjaŋ'en ɛ́ waalik wum! Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, bi aanàkabaabee mɛ, kana dwoo pan mos'ak, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo bi aake náá: “Zɛɛb eesɛɛ mɛtel mɛ kɔ mot aazyɛ nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.35 <char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Zel 22.5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:26">Mɛd 118.26</ref></char></char></note>!”»<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yezu eebaatsik mot ɛbɛ́ é dwoo saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Dhiiti dwoo saba, Yezu naazɛtɔ́ pɛ daa dhiiti kukuma eFalizyɛ ngɔt étɛp ɛkɛdɛ. Bot ɛ nadi é di tak ɔ moo tin dhuuu nɛ mis é nyel ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Dhiiti mot eezɛtyaa tetel sok bhwoob'ɛ, mot tak nabɛ ɛ́, nyel eezebeyal nyɛ nɛ ɛbɛ́. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɛlyoel ɛ etsi e Zɛɛb nɛ eFalizyɛ náá: «Etsi bina nɛ djɛ mena ze étɛp ɛtsik ɛ bot dwoo saba?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Bɛ moo tin gwyem, ààbɔɔza. Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛmɛt mot ɛbɛ́ ɛlenɔk, nyɛ eezɛtsik nyɛ, nyɛ eezɛswaal nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, ngɔt pak'en mɔn'ɛ nɛghu ngɔmbɛ yɛ eeges tɔ guk mɛdii ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaalel ɛkɛwyisal nyɛ kaab, ye nakoozodi dwoo saba?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Bɛ nabɛ ɛ́, ààbɛ nɛ ɛkpa ɛbɔɔza nɛ nyɛ.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛpelyo bot dum nɛ di ɛdisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yezu eezɛbee dáa bot ɛ nadjóoaa ɔ nadi esaa ɛdisi kɔ mɛbhóó mɛ di pɛ sok ɛ. Deenek nyɛ eezɛlii nɛ nɔɔ tɔ kana náá: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Mot ɛ djóo wɔ é ɛbyoŋ ɛ ɛba ɔɔ, sa wɔ ààsuu ɛdi kɔ mɛbhóó mɛ di pɛ sok ɛ, ekaab náá, nɛghu bɛ naadjóo dhiiti dhil mot dhaa wɔy, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />da mot djóo biyɔ bɛbá ɔ ɛ́ ke nɛ nɔ náá: “Djɛa nyɛ di'ak.” Tin, sen waasa wɔ étɛp ɛkɛsaa di ɛkɛdisi pɛ bhis. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ye nyɔ ɛ́ náá, wɔ djóoaa é ɛbyoŋ ɔ, wɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ kɔ bóó di pɛ bhis ɛ, etɛɛ náá, é sok nakuma ɛbyoŋ aatuula ɛ, nyɛy aapake nɛ nɔ náá: “Sɔ'am, wyɛla, dha zɛdisi kɔ bóó di pɛ sok ɛ.” Deenek wɔ waabela duu é mis mɛ bot ɛ bi nɛ bɛnɔɔ aadi kɔ mesa ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Mot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛghɛɛ nyel nɛ ɛbet ɔɔ, nyɛ waasilaa. Mot ɛ di esil nyel, nyɛ ɛ di ààbɛ nɛ ɛbet ɔɔ, nyɛ waabenaa.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ mot nadjóo nyɛ ɔ náá: «Wɔ di edjɛ bot edee é mwos, nɛghu bikoko ɔɔ, sa wɔ ààdjóo bɛsɔ bɔ, bɔn-nyoog, bot ɛ mɛbyel mɔ, ààdjóo bɛkum ɛ bot ɛ bi nɛ bɛnɔɔ di ɛkunaaɛpe ɔ, ekaab náá, bɛ ɛzɛkɛdjóo wɔ dhiiti dwoo. Da bɛ ɛ́ bulal dáa wɔ nasa nɛ nɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ye nyɔ ɛ́, wɔ djóo ɛbyoŋ ɔɔ, wɔ goka nɛ ɛdjóo ɛ́ bɛdjel ɛ bot, bɛ na edjam, eboka, nɛ bɛ na edhim. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ nɔ é di'enek, etɛɛ náá, bɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbulal wɔ yɛ ɛ. Zɛɛb ɛ́ waabulal wɔ yɛ é ghɛŋ bot ɛ epiki aagom tɔ ɛsyee ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana boo ɛbyoŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Bhii bɛ nazegwak etɛp binek djas ɛ, mot ngɔt pak bot ɛ nadi edɛ bɛ nɛ Yezu kɔ mesa ɔ zokake náá: «Mɛnyɔ nɛ mot aadɛ edee tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yezu eezɛlɛɛ nyɛ kana yak: «Dhiiti mot naazɛdjóo ɛbyoŋ. Nyɛ eezɛdjóo bot ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />É sok ɛwala ɛdɛ edee nakadjala ɛ, nyɛ eezɛlwom mot-mɛsa mɛ, nyɛ kɛdjóo bot da ke nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Dha dɛka, etɛɛ náá, edee eezebée.” <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Tin, bot ɛ nadjóoaa ɔ, moo tin, mot nɛ mot edjɛ yɛ gham, étɛp ɛpeeba. Mot ɛsok eezɛke nɛ mot-mɛsa náá: “Mɛ eebɔm pyeeb na bes. Ye goka ɛ́, mɛ tɔ́ kɛbee yɛ, pela mɛ mɔn-nyɛɛg.” <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Nwyak mot náá: “Ye nabɛ ɛ́, mɛ eebɔm engɔmbɛ kam, edjasla bɛtɛn, nɛ eswooz etɛn. Mɛ pookokɛgek mɛghwyil mɔɔ. Pela mɛ mɔn-nyɛɛg.” <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Nwyak tak eezɛzyɛ yɛ, nyɛy náá: “Mɛ ààloo nɛ beeb ghɔɔd'am. Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, mɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛzyɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Mot-mɛsa menɔk eezɛsik pɛ daa kukuma yɛ, kɛlɛɛ nyɛ dáa bot binɔk djas lɛɛ ɛ. Nakuma ndjaŋ eezɛkpaa lyem ɛlyelɛpe. Nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ mot-mɛsa mɛ náá: “Lela, tɔ́a kɔ mɛbɛsɛɛ mɛ dɛl nɛ kɔ egba. Tɔ́a, kɛdjóo bɛdjel ɛ bot, eboka e bot, bɛ na edjam, nɛ bɛ na edhim. Dha mɛ nɛ nɔɔ wak.” <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Bhii tak, mot-mɛsa eezɛlɛɛ nɛ kukuma yɛ náá: “Ghɛŋ, sa wɔ lwom náá, mɛ sa ɛ, yɛ eezesael. Kabela ɛ́ náá, edi dinaa tak tɔ ndjaa.” <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Tin, kukuma eezɛke nɛ mot-mɛsa mɛ náá: “Tɔ́a egba nɛ egba, nɛ kɔ bɔɔ mɛl pɛ ze epyeeb. Mot nɛ mot wɔ aaboma nɛ nɛ ɔ, besela nyɛ, nyɛ zyɛ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́, ndjaŋ'am lwood.” <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: “Tɔ bot djas mɛ nadjóo sok ɔ, ye tok nɛ mot aadɛ edee é ɛbyoŋ ɛ lam!”»<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sa mot di egoka nɛ ɛsa, étɛp nyɛ needi djekel ɛ Yezu ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Zukamwaa nɛ mot nadi ekɛ lɔɔg wat bɛ nɛ Yezu. Yezu zokazɛliig mis, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«Mot ɛ kwyɛl ɛdu mɛ ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ nyɛ byen sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg, nɛ myɛl nɛ bɔn, nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg nɛ bɛkɛl. Nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbyen-byenak tsik'ɛ met. Yɛ di ààdi deenek ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaakwak ɛdi djekel'am. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Mot ɛ di ààbɛp mɛlaaba mɛ, da bhii tak, nyɛ ɛ du mɛ ɔɔ, yenɔk tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdi djekel'am. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Mot ngɔt pak'en ɛ kwyɛl ɛsum boo ndjaa na vyɛɛg-vyɛɛg ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́, nyɛ pookodisi, étɛp ɛval nɛghu mɛtaŋ mɛ nyɛ goka nɛ ɛwyisal étɛp ɛsum ndjaa tak ɛ́ waadjala. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />É kaab náá, nyɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛkan mɛsa, da nyɛ ɛ́ sik é ze. Tin, ekpaa-goŋ ɛ bee deenek ɔɔ, bɛ ɛzɛkɛgɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Deenek bɛ aakeke ɛ́ náá: “Mot tak eekan ɛsum ndjaa ɛnyɔɛpe. Nyɛ ààpakakwak ɛsilal zumal.”<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ dhiiti mɛkoozi di ekwyɛl ɛkɛlumla dɛɛb, bɛ nɛ nwyak dhiiti mɛkoozi ɔ. Ye goka ɛ́ nyɛ pookodisi sok, étɛp ɛdjek nɛghu, nɛ esodja bɛmil-kam, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkwak ɛlumla dɛɛb nɛ sɔ mot zekɛghɛɛ nɛ esodja bɛmil mɛkam-mɛmbá ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Yɛ bɛ náá, nyɛ aanàkwaakwak ɔɔ, nyɛ waakyeed engoola-ngoola nɛ mɛbhaadal pɛ daa sɔ mɛkoozi, nyɛ dinaa ɛtsetaɛpe, étɛp ɛdji nyɛ sa nyɛ di ekwyɛl ɛ, etɛɛ náá, egwyem needi pak'ɔɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Deenek bhii tak Yezu eebaazɛbil ɛkpa náá: «Ye tok nɛ mot ngɔt pak'en aakwak ɛdi djekel'am, nyɛ di ààbet esa bɛ djas ɔɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛsɔn mɛ di ààval sonok ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />«Mɛsɔn ɛ́ mbɛɛ sonok. Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛsɔn moo ɛ́, ààkagwom ɔɔ, bot aakasa dáa étɛp mɛgwom mɛ tak neebaabula? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Yɛ aanàkabaakoval sonok, ye nakoozobɛ étɛp ɛkoobal bɔs nɛghu mɛbhek. Yenek aakagoka ɛ́ nɛ ɛmwasaa pɛ kel. Mot di nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔ, nyɛ gwak!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Kana bhata nawo, da nyɛ ɛ́ baazɛbelaa ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo, bɛ nɛ bot ɛ mbee dék naazɛsesɛɛga é bhaaz ɛ Yezu étɛp ɛzɛgwak nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />EFalizyɛ bɛ nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nadi elii ɛbiyoɛpe nɛ Yezu. Bɔɔ náá: «Ɛzaaba ɛ mot'ak ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ mesyem. Nyɛ ɛpedɛ bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ é di wat.»<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Deenek, Yezu ɛ́ boolɛɛ bɛ kana yak: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Dhiiti mot pak'en ɛ di nɛ ebhata dhet (100), da ngɔt ɛ́ wo ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàbet ebhata mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ mɛkam-mɛná nɛ etɛn nɛ ená (99) tɔ bal, étɛp ɛkɛsaa yii wo ɔ, da kɛbela nyɛ? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />É ghɛŋ nyɛ aabela nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ waakɛl nyɛ kɔ mɛbyak nɛ mɛmyaala djas. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Bula nyɛ bula pɛ dɛl ɛ, nyɛ waadjóo bɛsɔ nɛ bot ɛ di é mengwoob ɔ, da lɛɛ bɛ náá: “Dhaka mena myaalaka, etɛɛ náá mɛ eebatabela bhata yam nawo ɔ!” <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ biyɔ pe. Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, yɛ waadi nɛ boo mɛmyaala tɔ gwoo étɛp mot mesyem ngɔt liig lyem ɔ, dhaa bot ɛ epiki mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ mɛkam-mɛná nɛ etɛn nɛ ená (99), di ààbɛ nɛ gwyes ɛliig elyem bɔɔ ɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana pata nadiib, da bɛ ɛ́ baazɛbela nyɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />«Yɛ bɛ náá, dhiiti moma nadi ɛ́ nɛ bɔɔ eghwooz epata kam na boo mɛtaŋ, da wat ɛ́ diib ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaakɛtuub lama, da waabal ndjaa, da saŋ ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ lyem wat, batakɛ bela yɛ? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />É ghɛŋ nyɛ aabela yɛ ɛ, nyɛ waadjóo bɛsɔ boa nɛ boa di é mengwoob ɔ, lɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Dha myaalaka sama nɛ nam, etɛɛ náá, mɛ eebatabela pata yam nadiib ɛ!” <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ biyɔ pe. Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: Efofop ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadi tɔ mɛmyaala étɛp mot mesyem ngɔt liig lyem ɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana mɔn motom nawo, da nyɛ ɛ́ baazɛbelaa ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yezu eebaazɛke náá: «Dhiiti mot nadi ɛ́ nɛ bɔn botom ɛbá. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Yɛ ɛ́ dhyeeb tak kazyɛ, zɛke nɛ sɛɛg náá: “Saagam, djɛ mɛ yam ɛkɛɛ lyak di náá, mɛ waaboobela ɛ́, nɛ djheed.” É di tak ɛ́, sɛɛg'ɔɔ nazɛkaa ekum bɛ, pak bɔn bɛ bɛbá. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Yɛ eezɛkpaa ba mɛlu bhii tak, yɛ ɛ́ dhyeeb kazɛnɔɔ yɛ kyee náá, bɔmsa yɛ, nɔɔ epata e tak, tɔ́ nɛ yɛ pɛ dhiiti kyee dik ɛtsetaɛpe. Penek, wɔ gwaa nyɛ kɛbɔya tɔ mɛdjemel, zɛsaab esa e lyak bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Bhii nyɛ nakazesaab esa bɛ djas ɛ, boo pwom naazɛtuula pɛ kyee dik tak. Nyɛ nakadi ɛ́, nyɛ moo tɔ edjel. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́, kɛsa mɛsa pɛ daa dhiiti mot kyee dik tak. Mot'enɔk ɛ́ bookyeed nyɛ, nyɛ kɛbaal bɛghwyee tɔ epyeeb bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, nɛ gwyes ɛdɛ bhum le kalubye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kalubye </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yɛ ɛ́ kɔkɔ mbi le di dhatyee le ebha ɛ.</char></note> yii bɛghwyee nadi ededɛ ɛ́, ye nakasa ɛ́, nɛ nyɛy ààbɛ nɛ mot djɛ nyɛ yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />É di'enek, nyɛ moo tin zibiliii esiiza etɛp e nyel'ɛ. Nyɛy náá: “Bot ɛ di esa mɛsa pɛ daa saagam ɔ, djas ɛ lɔɔ ɛpedɛ edee kat, dhi mam egwyɛ nɛ za wak. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Mɛ pookosik pɛ daa saagam, da lɛɛ nyɛ náá: Saagam! Mɛ naasa mesyem sok bhwoob ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ sok bhwoob'ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Mɛ ààpakabaagoka náá, mɛ djóoaa mɔn'ɔ. Nɔŋa mɛ tyee ngɔt tɔ bot ɛ mɛsa mɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Nyɛ eezɛsik pɛ daa sɛɛg. <figure style="fig" alt="L’enfant égaré est retourné chez son père" file="WA03876b.tif" size="span" loc="15.20" copy="Graham Wade" ref="15.20">Mɔn nawo ze ɔ, nyɛ eebula pɛ daa Sɛɛg</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">Dáa nyɛ nadi, nyɛ dinaa ba ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ ndjaŋ ɛ, sɛɛg eezɛbee mɔn, nyɛ ɛ́ boogek nyɛ ghoŋ. Wɔ gwaa Sɛɛg zɛtɔ́ kaab, kɛboma nɛ mɔn, nyɛ eezɛbeedal nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mɔn eezɛke nɛ sɛɛg náá: “Saagam, mɛ eesyem sok bhwoob ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ sok bhwoob'ɔ. Mɛ ààpagoka náá, mɛ djóoaa mɔn'ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Wɔ gwaa sɛɛg zɛke nɛ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ náá: “Lelka ɛzyɛ mɛ nɛ kaad, lɔbɔ na nyenyɔ-nyɔ. Bétka nyɛ yɛ ɛ. Sɔmka nyɛ ɛsum é djin. Bétka nyɛ ekoko. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Kɛ mɛtka mɔɔ ngɔmbɛ na mɛdɛl, da bi ɛ́ gó nyɛ, mena neesaka ɛbyoŋ, <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />etɛɛ náá, mɔn'am nwyak naazegwyɛ, nenak, nyɛ eegom. Nyɛ naazewo, nenak mɛ eebatabela nyɛ.” Wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛkan mbɛɛ ɛbyoŋ.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />É sok tak, mɔn mɛgwyak mɛ nadi ɛ́, pɛ epyeeb. É ɛbula ɛ lɛ, dáa nyɛ nadi nyɛ moo ekunaa nɛ ndjaŋ ɛ, nyɛ kagwak ɛ́ dhok ɛtap, kul nɛ ghom, nɛ mɛzɛŋ. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Nyɛ eezɛdjóo dhiiti mot-mɛsa, dji nyɛ náá: “Yenek ɛ́ yaa?” <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Yɛ ɛ́ mot-mɛsa menɔk kabɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: “Dhyeeb'ɔ eebula. É di tak, soog ɛ́ boogó mɔɔ ngɔmbɛ na mɛdɛl, etɛɛ náá, mɔn eebula nyel ɛnyɔɛpe.” <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Mɔn mɛgwyak ɛ́ boogwak ɛbuk, nyɛ eezɛbyen ɛni-niak tɔ ndjaa. Yɛ ɛ́ sɛɛg kawyis kɛdjaala nɛ nɛ, étɛp nyɛ neeni tɔ ndjaa. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Wɔ gwaa, mɔn zɛbɔɔza nɛ sɛɛg náá: “Gwaka, mɛ moo ɛ́ nɛ zukamwaa nɛ membu mɛ di esa wɔ mɛsa tyee kwom ɛ. Mɛ ààbyen dhiiti lwomel'ɔ wat. Wɔ bee ɔɔ, wɔ dinaa ààpakodjɛ mɛ djɛak ba mɔɔ ngɔmbɛ étɛp mɛ neesa ɛbyoŋ, bis nɛ bɛsɔ bam. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Beea, é di mɔn'ɔ nwyak kabula ɔ, nyɛy mot naasaab esa e lyak bɔ djas nɛ boa mɛzɔ ɔ, étɛp'ɛ, wɔ eebatalwom náá, bɛ gó nyɛ mɔɔ ngɔmbɛ na mɛdɛl!” <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Yɛ ɛ́ sɛɛg kalɛɛ nyɛ náá: “Mɔn'am! Menabɛl ɛ́ di mɛlu djas. Mɛ bee ɛ́ náá, esa ee mɛ di nɛ yɛ djas ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ yɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Mena goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsa tɛtɛ ɛbyoŋ, da mena ɛ́ myaala, etɛɛ náá, dhyeeb'ɔ nwyak naazegwyɛ, nenak nyɛ eegom. Nyɛ naazewo, mos mena eebela nyɛ.”»<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kana ndɔmbɛ na mɛtselal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Dhiiti kum mot nadi ɛ́ nɛ ndɔmbɛ. Bot eezɛlɛɛ kum mot'enɔk náá, ndɔmbɛ yɛ ɛpesaab nyɛ esa. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Kum mot tak eezɛdjóo ndɔmbɛ yɛ, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: “Mɛ ɛpedyeebagwak embee menduk dum nɛ din ɛ lɔ. Pookobaŋa mɛ dáa wɔ di ebaal esa bam ɛ, etɛɛ náá, wɔ aanàkabaadi ndɔmbɛ yam.” <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Ndɔmbɛ eezɛke tɔ lyem'ɛ met náá: “Mɛ sa dáa, dáa ye di náá, kukuma yam moo zɛdɛk esa bɛ é mɛmbɔ mam'aak. Mam ɛ́ di ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil mɛsa mɛ epyeeb'aak, ebeyak nɛ sa mam sen. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Mɛ nɛ gu dáa mɛ aasa étɛp bot neemyaal mɛ tɔ mendjaa mɔɔ bhii kukuma yam aadis mɛ é mɛsa ɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Tin, nyɛy zokazɛdjóo mot nɛ mot nadi nɛ kola esa e kukuma yɛ ɔ. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ mot ɛsok náá: “Wɔ ɛ́ nɛ kola kukuma yam edhen?” <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ etondo e bɛmul mɛ bhum oliv dhet (100).” Ndɔmbɛ eezɛke nɛ mot'enɔk náá: “Lela ɛdisi, ba mɛkana mɔ, kwyala tɔ tak mɛkam-mɛtɛn (50).” <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Bhis yenɔk, nyɛ eebaake nɛ nwyak tak náá: “Haaa wɔy, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ kola kukuma yam edhen?” Mot tak eezɛbɔɔza náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ eghuudɛ e mɛbhisa dhet (100)”. Ndɔmbɛ eezɛke nɛ mot'enɔk náá: “Ba mɛkana mɔ, kwyala mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ mɛkam-mɛlɛl (80).” <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Tin, wɔ gwaa kukuma zokazɛduwal mbee ndɔmbɛ yenɔk dum nɛ mɛsa mɛ etsoŋ nyɛ sa nɛ bot étɛp nyɛ needi ààbyenaa bhii nyɛ aasɔaa é mɛsa ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ bɔs'ak nɛ gu ɛkwyeel pak'ɔɔ dhaa-dhaŋak bot ɛ di ekɛ tɔ gwyɛ ɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yezu eebaazɛbil náá: «Deenek, mam lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, beka ɛsɔ nɛ mɛvu mɛ di ekɔɔ bot kɔ bɔs'ak ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, é di mɛvu menek aadi náá, ye tokapɛ ɔ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waamyaal náá, bi di tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ di na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Mot di sosoob tɔ esa e dem ɔ, mot tak ɛ́ waadi pe sosoob tɔ eboo mɛkɛɛ. Mot aadi ààdi sosoob tɔ esa e dem ɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaadi sosoob tɔ eboo mɛkɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bi nabɛ ààdi sosoob nɛ dáa bi nadi ebe mɛvu mɛ mɛkɔŋ di kɔ bɔs'ak ɔɔ, ɛzɛ aadjɛ bin tɛtɛ mɛvu? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bi nabɛ ààgu ɛdi sosoob dum nɛ esa e bot ɛ sis ɔɔ, ɛzɛ aadjɛ bin embɛɛ esa yii di náá, yɛ ɛ́ yebɔ ɛ?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Ye tok nɛ mot-mɛsa ngɔt aadi nɛ ghwyil ɛsa mɛsa mɛ ekukuma ebá. Deenek nyɛ waabhina ngɔt, da nyɛ ɛ́ kwyɛl nwyak ngɔt, nɛghu nyɛ kaseya nɛ ngɔt, da nyɛ ɛ́ byasal nwyak mot. Bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsa é di wat mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb nɛ mɛsa mɛ epata.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">E dhiiti etɛp ee Yezu nadi elii ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />EFalizyɛ naagwak etɛp ee Yezu nadi elii ɛ djas. Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛni eduk nyɛ etɛɛ náá, elyem bɔɔ naadyeebakwyɛl epata dhaa nyel. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛ́ bot ɛ di etelaa mɛnyel é mis mɛ bot náá, bi ɛ́ bot ɛ epiki ɔ. Guka náá, Zɛɛb nɛ gu ebhum e elyem bin. Etɛɛ náá, esa ee bot di ebee náá, yɛ ɛ́ embɛɛ esa ɛ, Zɛɛb bee yɛ ɛ, embee esa é mis mɛ.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Ɛwala ɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz nɛ Ekwyala e bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb naabɔya, kɛsik é ɛzyɛ ɛ Zaŋ nduuel-bot. Kana é ɛwala lenek, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛpegoolaaa, mot nɛ mot goka ɛ́ nyɛ sa yɛ mɛghaaz étɛp ɛbela di tɔ tak. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Ye nakoozobɛ náá, gwoo nɛ bɔs ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdum, tɛp tok. Yɛ kabɛ mɛkpa mɛ etsi ɔɔ, yɛ aanàkwaakodisaa-disak ba mɔɔ ɛkyɛ wat tɔ tak.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Motom ɛ pɛɛ myɛl, da nyɛ ɛ́ kɛba dhiiti moma sis ɔɔ, motom tak eesa ɛzɔ. Tin, motom ɛ ba moma nazepɛɛaa é ɛba ɔɔ, nyɛy pe baasa ɛ́ ɛzɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana djel mot Lazaad, bɛ nɛ mot ekum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />«Ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot ekum. Mot ekum tak nabebɔt ɛ́ embɛɛ ekaad bɛ na eboo mɛtaŋ. Nyɛ nadidi ɛ́ tɔ wolo ndjaa, nyɛ nadedɛ mɛlu djas ɛ́ embɛɛ edee. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />É ɛniel ɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti djel mot nadi edjedjaasi tin ɔ. Din ɛ mot tak nabɛ ɛ́ Lazaad. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛpyoŋ kpeeeŋ é nyel djas. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Djel mot'enɔk nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ gwyes ɛdedɛ bɔɔ eghutu-ghutu edee nadi ekwyit é mesa e mot ekum'enɔk ɛ. Tin, bela náá, bɛbhyɛ nadi ezyɛ, zɛwyiiz mɛpyoŋ mɛ. <figure style="fig" alt="L’homme riche et Lazare le pauvre" file="43_Luke16.19_LazarusBegs.tif" size="col" loc="16.21" copy="Gordon Thompson" ref="16.21">Mot ekum bɛ nɛ Lazaad mot edjel</figure><verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Tin, djel mot eezɛkpaa nɛ mɛsyee, gwyɛ. Efofop naazɛnɔɔ nyɛ, kɛnɛɛg nyɛ é bhaaz ɛ Abalaam. Wɔ gwaa, mot ekum zokabaazɛgwyɛ yɛ, nyɛy kɛdelaa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Mot ekum tak nadi ezuk ɛbuɛpe tɔ dɛl ɛ edim e bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛben mis, nyɛ kabee nɛ ɛtseta ɛ́, Abalaam zɛnɔɔ Lazaad é bhaaz'ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛbo tsim: “Saagam Abalaam! Geka mɛ ghoŋ. Lwoma Lazaad, nyɛ duu djin tɔ mɛdii, da nyɛ ɛ́ zɛtɔlal mɛ ɛtɔ ɛ tak kɔ djem. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛpezuk ɛbuɛpe nɛ mɛgoo mɛ du'ak.” <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Tin, Abalaam eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: “Mɔn'am, taala náá, wɔ naabela bɛtɛ nɛ ekum é sok wɔ nabɛ, wɔ dinaa nɛ tsik ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ Lazaad ɔɔ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mot mezuk. É di nyɛ di wak'aak, nyɛ ɛpebela yɛ mɛnyɔ. Yɛ kabɛ wɔy ɔɔ, wɔ moo ɛ́ tɔ mezuk. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Baabela náá, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo guk na dim-dim pak'ena. Etɛɛ náá, mot ɛ kwyɛl ɛtsaal étɛp ɛzyɛ penek ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaak. Baabela náá, mot ɛ kwyɛl ɛdus penek, zyɛ pɛ kak ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaak pe.” <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Mot ekum zokazɛke náá: “Saagam, mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nɔ, kyeeda Lazaad tɔ ndjaa saagam, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />penek, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛdhyeeb ɛtɛn. Nyɛ kɛdul bɛ mɛlɔ ekaab náá, bɛ ɛzɛkɛzyɛ pɛ yak di mezuk.” <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Abalaam eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: “Bɔɔ penek, bɛ ɛ́ nɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb étɛp ɛdul ɛ bɛ mɛlɔ. Bɛ gwak mɛlyo mɔɔ!” <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Mot ekum eezɛke náá: “Saagam Abalaam, yenek djas aanàkwaadjala! Ye nyɔ ɛ́ náá, mot dus tɔ edim ɔ, da nyɛ ɛ́ kɛlii nɛ nɔɔ, tin ɛ́ bɛ aaswoola mɛfulu mɔɔ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Deenek Abalaam eebaazɛke nɛ nɛ náá: “Bɛ di ààgwak Moiiz nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, bɛ aanàkwaakomyaal, ye nakoozodi mot dus tɔ edim ɔ.”»<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Mesyem nɛ ɛpelak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, yɛ waadi nɛ mɛbɛk mɛ di náá, mot aanàkwaagwoob ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">yɛ waadi nɛ mɛbɛk mɛ di náá, mot aanàkwaagwoob ɛ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɛbɛk mɛ tak ɛ́ waasa náá, bot sa mesyem.</char></note>. Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ mot aadi ɛbɛk ɛ tak ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Nɛ mbi mot deenek, ye goka nɛ nɛ ɛ́, bɛ tsel nyɛ boo ɛkok é tsuŋ, da bɛ ɛ́ lóo nyɛ tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn. Ye goka nɛ nɛ ɛ́ deenek, ààbɛ náá, nyɛ kwyesal ngɔt tɔ bot ɛ di ààlyel tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ tɔ mesyem. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Dika ghwyɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">Mɔn-nyoog ɛ syem nɛ nɔ ɔɔ, djóoa nyɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ dul nyɛ mɛlɔ nɛ lyem wat. Tin, nyɛ liig lyem ɔɔ, pela nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Nyɛ sa wɔ embee esa dwoo wat esok etɛn nɛ ebá, da nyɛ ɛ́ bula esok etɛn nɛ ebá, étɛp ɛzɛke nɛ nɔ náá: “Pela mɛ! Mɛ eegu ɛbiyo ɛ lam” ɔɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ pel nyɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Bot ɛ lwoma eezɛke nɛ Ghɛŋ náá: «Bila bis ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Deenek, Ghɛŋ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛpedi ɛ́ di nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛbuɛpe dáa mɔɔ bhek le mutaad ɔɔ, pe bi ɛ́ waake nɛ ɛtsok ɛlak náá: “Gua ekaŋal bɔ wak! Tɔ́a, kɛbɛ nyel'ɔ tɔ dii mɛsɔn”, nyɛ waalooba nɛ nen.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sa mot-mɛsa di egoka nɛ ɛsa ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />«Djhoopookogek dáak: Mot ngɔt tɔ len ɛ́ nɛ mot-mɛsa di bɛ nyɛ epyeeb nɛghu ɛbaal ɛ nyɛ ɛsaŋ ɛ etaŋ ɔ. É sok nyɛ di ebee mot tak ebula pɛ ndjaa bhii mɛsa ɛ, nyɛ nɛ ke nɛ nɛ náá: “Lela ɛzyɛ zɛdi kɔ mesa wɔ needɛ”? Ààbɛ deenek é! <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Mɛ bee ɛ́ náá, nyɛ aake nɛ nɛ ɛ́ náá: “Djaaba mɛ edee, da wɔ ɛ́ swoola ekaad, étɛp wɔ neezɛlaa mɛ edee, mɛ needɛ. Bhii mam aakasilal ɛdɛ edee nɛ mɛdii ɛ, wɔy ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ kadɛ yɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Nyɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛghaapɛɛ mot-mɛsa mɛ etɛɛ náá, nyɛ eesa mɛsa mɛ kukuma yɛ lwom nyɛ ɛ. Ye tok deenek é? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ biyɔ pe. É sok bi aadi náá, bi eezesa mɛsa mɛ bi lwomaa náá, bi sa ɛ, keka náá: “Bis tok bɛdhiiti evaŋ bot ɛ mɛsa. Bis zosa ɛ́, mɛsa mɛ lwomaa náá, bis sa ɛ.”»<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eetsik bot ɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam kam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Dáa Yezu nadi etɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, nyɛ nadhaŋ ɛ́ mbaka-mbaka é kpal pak kyee dɛl Samaali nɛ Ghalile. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Dáa nyɛ natuula kɔ dɛl ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam kam zokazɛboma nɛ nɛ. Bɛ eezɛtyaa tetel ba ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Bɛ moo tin etsim náá: «Heee Yezu, Ghɛŋ! Geka bis ghoŋ!» <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Dáa Yezu nabee bɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ́ka kɛlyaal mɛnyel men pɛ daa bɛghaa-Zɛɛb.» Dáa bɛ nadi bɛ dinaa etɔ́-tɔ́ak ɛ, bɛ naazɛtsak. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Mot ngɔt pak'ɔɔ zokabula pɛ bhis, é ɛduwal ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ etsim. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Nyɛ eezɛduma sok bhwoob ɛ Yezu mɛboŋ si, nyɛ eezɛghaapɛɛ Yezu. Ye nazobɛ ɛ́, mot kyee dik Samaali. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yezu eezɛke náá: «Bɔɔ bot kam djas eetsak, etsal é? Haaa bak bot bɛtɛn nɛ bɛná moo wo? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Ye tok nɛ mot ngɔt pak'ɔɔ taala ɛbula, étɛp ɛzɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb, yɛ di ààbɛ ndjoŋ'ak nyɛ ɛmet ɔɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Bhii tak Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wyɛla, da wɔ ɛ́ nɔɔ nyel'ɔ tɔ́. Ɛmyaal ɛ lɔ eetsik wɔ!»<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛtuula ɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />EFalizyɛ zokazɛdji Yezu náá: «Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb aazyɛ den?» Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb aanàkwaazyɛ, mis mɛ bot djas ebee. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Bot ɛ́ waake nɛ nen náá: “Beeka, yɛ ɛ́ wak,” nɛghu “Beeka yɛ di poon'enek!” Ye nyɔ ɛ́, bi gu náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ tɔ len.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel náá: «Ɛwala ɛpezyɛ, ɛwala bi aadi nɛ gwyes ɛbee Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot, ye nakoozobɛ beea ba dwoo wat. É ɛwala tak, bi aanàkwaabee nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Bɛ waalɛɛ bin náá: “Nyɛ ɛ́ wak,” nɛghu náá, “Nyɛ ɛ́ poon.” Deenek, sa mot ààtɔ́, sa mot ààdu nɛ kaab. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Dáa ngwyes bhi di ekas tɔ gwoo ɛ, djɛ gwyɛ tɔ edi djas ɛ, yɛ aadi ɛ́ deenek é dwoo Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aazyɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ɛsok nɛ etɛp binek nɛ sael, ye goka ɛ́ náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot pookozuk ɛbuɛpe, da bot ɛ́ di kɔ bɔs'ak mos'aak ɛ pookoswonal nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Dáa ye nasael é ghɛŋ ɛ Noe ɛ, yɛ aabaazosael ɛ́ deenek é dwoo Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aabula ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />É ghɛŋ tak, bot nadi edɛ edee nɛ ɛdɛ mɛnyok. Bɛ nadi eba mɛba nɛ ɛkɛdjɛ bɔn bɔɔ é mɛba, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo Noe nani tɔ mɛsuwa ɛ. Bhii tak, boo bhyoŋ naazyɛ, wɔ gwaa, ye zɛdesal bɔɔ djas, bɔɔ djas gwyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Yɛ aadi ɛ́, tyee é ghɛŋ ɛ Lɔt. É ghɛŋ tak, bot nadi edɛ edee nɛ mɛnyok. Bɛ nadi ebɔm esa, bɛ nadi ebɔmsa esa, bɛ nadi ebɛ epyeeb nɛ ɛsum ɛ mendjaa. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Tin, dwoo Lɔt nadus kɔ dɛl ɛ Sodɔm ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, Zɛɛb naasa náá, bhi na du, nɛ pup na mɛsii mɛ na goo-goo dus tɔ gwoo, zyɛ kɔ bɔs, da gó bot binɔk djas. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Yɛ aabaazosael ɛ́ deenek é dwoo Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aabula ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Dwoo tak, mot kwaadi pɛ ɛko ɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ ɔ, sa nyɛ ààbaasul étɛp ɛkɛnɔɔ esa bɛ di pɛ si ɛ. Tyee wat nɛ mot aadi tɔ pyeeb ɔ, sa nyɛ ààbaasik pɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Taalaka sa nasael nɛ mwaa Lɔt ɛ! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Mot aasuu ɛkwyɛɛg ɛ́ tsik'ɛ ɔ, nyɛ waasu tsik'ɛ. Mot aasu tsik'ɛ ɔ, nyɛ waabaal tsik'ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, é pum tak, bot ɛbá ɛ́ waadjaasi goŋ wat. Ngɔt ɛ́ waanɔŋaa, nwyak ngɔt likaa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Boa ɛbá aadi edum bhum tɔ bwak wat, ngɔt ɛ́ waanɔŋaa, nwyak ngɔt likaa. [ <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Bot ɛbá ɛ́ waadi tɔ pyeeb, ngɔt ɛ́ waanɔŋaa, nwyak ngɔt likaa.]» <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Bɛdjekel bɛ zokazɛdji nyɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, etɛp binek djas aasael pɛ yaa sum di?» Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «É sok bi aadi ebee enen di edjóoaa mɛbɛk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mɛbɛk </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yɛ ɛ́ enen di edɛ epuud ɔ.</char></note> e kii tɔ gwoo ɛ, keka náá, muu tit ɛ́ tin.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Kana kus moma nɛ tetɛp</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Bhii tak Yezu eezɛbaŋa bɛ kana yak, étɛp ɛlyo bɛ dáa bɛ di egoka nɛ ɛdjaala mɛlu djas, ààbula bhis ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Nyɛ eezɛke náá: «Pɛ kɔ dhiiti ghaada wat, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti tetɛp ngɔt di náá, etɛp e Zɛɛb ààgwyak nyɛy ɔ. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ ààkobem ba nɛ mot. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Kɔ dɛl ɛ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti kus moma nadi epyap ɛzyɛ pɛ daa tetɛp tak étɛp zɛke nɛ nɛ náá: “Pɛ́ɛa mɛ tɛp mɛ di nɛ yɛ bis nɛ nwyak mot'aak,” etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi egu náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ gham. <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />É mɛkɛn, tetɛp nadi ebyen. Deenek nyɛ eezɛke tɔ lyem'ɛ náá: “Yɛ kobɛ náá, mɛ ààkaab Zɛɛb ɔɔ, yɛ kobaadi náá, mam ààbis bot ɔɔ, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />dáa ye di náá, kus moma yak ɛpemyel mɛ ɛ, ye goka ɛ́ mɛ pɛ́ɛ tɛp'ɛ, étɛp nyɛ neekat ɛpyap ɛzyɛ wak.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Bhii tak Ghɛŋ eezɛbaabil náá: «Gwakeka, dáa mbee tetɛp tak nalii ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Tin, Zɛɛb tok nɛ ghwyil ɛkwyee bot ɛ nyɛ nazesɛ́ɛ ɔ, bot ɛ tak ɛ di ewaab esonok pɛ daa lɛ mwos nɛ pum ɔɔ. Nyɛ aanàkwaakwyee bɛ? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá: Nyɛ waalel ɛkwyee bɛ. Tin, é sok Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aazyɛ ɛ, nyɛ waazɛbela bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ kɔ bɔs'ak é?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana Falizyɛ bɛ nɛ nɔŋel epata e lapo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yezu eebaazɛlɛɛ kana kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ di ebun náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ epiki, da bɛ ɛ́ kadyamal bɔn-nyɛɛg bɔɔ ɔ. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />«Bot ɛbá naazɛbyet pɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa étɛp ɛkɛdjaala, ngɔt nadi ɛ́ Falizyɛ, dhiiti kadi ɛ́ nɔŋel epata e lapo. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Falizyɛ eezɛtyaa é yɛ di, nyɛ moo edjaala náá: “Heee, Zɛɛb! Mɛ eeghaapɛɛ wɔ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ tok dáa bɛdhiiti bot. Bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ djii, bɛmbee ɛ bot, bot ɛ mɛzɔ. Mɛ ɛpeduwal wɔ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ tok dáa nɔŋel epata e lapo di'aak. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Mam tsi edee etɛp mendjaala ɛ́ esok ebá tɔ yenga wat. Mɛ nɛ djɛ wɔ ndyaal wat tɔ endyaal kam e esa bam djas mɛ di ebela ɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Nɔŋel epata e lapo natyaa yɛ ɛ́ ba ɛtsetaɛpe. Nyɛy ààben mis pɛ ɛko, nyɛ eekɛl mɛmbɔ kɔ lo. Nyɛy náá: “Iyeee, Zɛɛb, wɔy ààkogek mɛ ghoŋ é? Mam mot mesyem.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Nɔŋel epata e lapo nakasik ɛ́, Zɛɛb eezepel mesyem mɛ, ààbɛ Falizyɛ. Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, mot ɛ ghɛɛ nyel ɔɔ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waasil nyɛ. Mot ɛ sila ɔɔ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waaghɛɛ nyɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛpesɛɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb mɛtel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Bot naazyɛ nɛ bɔn tɔlɔɔ bɔɔ pɛ daa Yezu étɛp nyɛ neekɛl bɛ mɛmbɔ. Tyee bɛdjekel nakabee deenek ɛ́, bɛ naazɛbhɛm bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke náá, bɔɔ dhyeeb tiila pɛ nyɛ nadi ɛ́, nyɛy náá: «Betka bɔɔ dhyeeb bɛ zyɛ pɛ daa lam. Sa bi ààlu bɛ, etɛɛ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ yii bot ɛ di dáa bɔɔ dhyeeb ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, mot ɛ di ààmyaal Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb dáa mɔɔ dhyeeb ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaani tɔ tak.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mot ekum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Dhiiti kukuma eYuda ngɔt zokazɛdji Yezu náá: «Mbɛɛ Lyoel, mɛ goka nɛ ɛsa dáa étɛp mɛ neebela tsik na kɔm-kɔm?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Étɛp yé wɔ di edjóo mɛ mbɛɛ lyoel? Ye tok nɛ mbɛɛ mot kɔ bɔs'ak bhii Zɛɛb nyɛy, nyɛ ɛmet. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Wɔ nɛ gu etsi djas: “Sa wɔ ààsa mɛzɔ, sa wɔ ààgó mot, sa wɔ ààdjii sa mot, sa wɔ ààlɛɛ elɛŋ e etsal dum nɛ sɔ'ɔ mot, duwala soog nɛ nyoog<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.20 <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Ɛwy 20.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Dɛt 5.16-20</ref></char></char></note>.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Mot'enɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ nɛ duwal etsi binek djas kana edhɔma bam, kɛkum dwoo pan mos'ak.» <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Bhii Yezu nagwak nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ye zokalik ɛ́, wɔ sa sa wat: kɛbɔmsa esa bɔ djas, da wɔ ɛ́ nɔɔ epata e tak, djɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot, tin, wɔ waabela mɛvu tɔ gwoo. Bhii tak, da wɔ ɛ́ zɛdu mɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Dáa kum mot'enɔk nagwak deenek ɛ́, ye nabɛ ɛ́ mɛkpa menek naatek nyɛ nyel na wɔyɔŋ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi ɛ́, nɛ mɛvu ɛbuɛpe.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Dáa Yezu nabee náá, lyem mot ekum'enɔk naakpaŋ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Ɛkɔɔla nɛ bɛkum ɛ bot náá, bɛ ni tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Ɛkɔɔla náá, boo yaaga bal dhaa tɔ ba mɔɔ ɛlen ɛ dhɔɔ. Yɛ kabɛ bɛkum ɛ bot ɔɔ, ɛni ɛ lɔɔ tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb eebaadhaa-dhaŋak ɛni ɛ boo yaaga bal tɔ ɛlen ɛ dhɔɔ nɛ mɛlyel.» <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Bot ɛ́ nadi egwak nyɛ ɔ, moo tin eke pak'ɔɔ náá: «Yɛ bɛ deenek ɔɔ, ɛzɛ aabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sa di náá, bot aanàkwaak ɛ, Zɛɛb aanàkwaakat yɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Wɔ gwaa, Pyɛɛd zɛke náá: «Gwyáka, bis eezebet djas étɛp ɛdu ɛ wɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yezu ɛ́ boolɛɛ bɛ náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: Mot ɛ́ bet ɛbhis ɛ lɛ nɛghu myɛl, nɛghu bɔn-nyɛɛg, nɛghu sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg, nyɛ ɛ́ baabet bɔn bɛ, étɛp Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />nyɛ waabela dhaa-dhaŋak é ɛwala ɛlak, dɔɔ nɛ é ɛwala di ezyɛ ɛ, nyɛ waabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛpebaalii dum nɛ ɛsyee nɛ gom ɛ lɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Dhiiti dwoo, Yezu zokanɔɔ bɛdjekel kam nɛ bɛbá, nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Gwakeka! Mena moo tɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Penek ɛ́ pɛ etɛp djas ee bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nazekwyal dum nɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ aadjala ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Nyɛ waakaaa é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ́ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Bot binɔk aadek nyɛ, lee nyɛ, nɛ ɛsɛɛ nyɛ mɛtel é nyel. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Bɛ waanyuu nyɛ nɛ eghwyɛs. Bhii tak, bɛ waagó nyɛ. Mɛlu mɛlɛl bhii tak, nyɛ waagom.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Tin, bɛdjekel kadi ɛ́, ààgu sa wat tɔ etɛp ee nyɛ nadi elɛɛ bɛ ɛ. Ye nadi nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ syela. Bɛ nadi ɛ́, ààgu sa Yezu nalii ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eetsik mot edhim pɛ Yeliko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Dáa Yezu nabɛ náá, bɛ moo ekunaa nɛ Yeliko ɛ, ghuna dhiiti mot na edhim nadi ɛ́ ndiindel é ngwoob gba. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, mot engwyeebel. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Nyɛ eezɛgwak ɛtap ɛ zukamwaa nɛ mot ezyɛ pɛ kyee nyɛ nadi ɛ́, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛdji sa nadi edhaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bɛ eezɛlɛɛ nyɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ Yezu, mot Nazalɛt ɛ di edhaa tin.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛtsim náá: «Yezu, Mɔn Dhavid, geka mɛ ghoŋ!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ nadi ekɛ pɛ sok ɔ moo tin ebhɛm nyɛ, nɛ ɛlyak nyɛ, étɛp nyɛ needi gwyem. Tin, wɔ gwaa nyɛ baazɛloogal gwood ɛlyelɛpe: «Mɔn ɛ Dhavid, geka mɛ ghoŋ!» <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yezu eezɛtyaa. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛlwom náá, bɛ zyɛ nyɛ nɛ nɛ. Dáa mot edhim yenɔk natiila pɛ Yezu nadi ɛ́, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛdji nyɛ náá: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Wɔ kwyɛl náá, mɛ sa wɔ yé?» Mot edhim yenɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, mis mam baabɛŋel!» <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ: «Bɛɛa mis mɔ! Ɛmyaal ɛ lɔ eetsik wɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />É di'enek wat, mis mɛ eezɛbɛŋel. Bhii tak, nyɛ moo edu Yezu é duwal Zɛɛb. Dáa ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tinaak ɔ djas nabee deenek ɛ́, bɔɔ djas naaduwal Zɛɛb.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yezu bɛ nɛ Zasye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Bhii Yezu natuula kɔ dɛl Yeliko ɛ, nyɛ eezɛkpaa tɔ́ pɛ yii kyee dɛl. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Kɔ dɛl ɛ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Zasye. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, kukuma bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo, nyɛ nadi ɛ́, mot ekum. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Nyɛ nadi esuu ɛbee Yezu, saabɛgɔs kabɛ ɛ́ náá, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ ɛwulalɛpe. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ tyee nyɛ bee Yezu, etɛɛ náá, bot nadi ɛ́ ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛwyis kaab tɔ pɛ sok, kɛgo kɔ mɔɔ le di edjóoaa sikomood ɛ, etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ Yezu aadhaa tin ɛ, nyɛ neebee nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Dáa Yezu nakum é di'enek ɛ, nyɛ eezɛben mis pɛ ɛko, nyɛ ɛ́ boolɛɛ nɛ Zasye náá: «Lela ɛsul Zasye, etɛɛ náá, ye goka ɛ́ náá, mos, mɛ sulal tɔ ndjaŋ'ɔ.» <figure style="fig" alt="Zachée est monté sur l’arbre pour voir Jésus" file="WA03891b.tif" size="span" loc="19.5" copy="Graham Wade" ref="19.5">Zasye eego kɔ le étɛp nyɛ neebee Yezu</figure><verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Tin, wɔ gwaa Zasye zɛsul kɔ le kaab ɛ́ kaab. Bhii tak, nyɛ eekɛdisi bɛ nɛ Yezu tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ nɛ mɛmyaala ɛbuɛpe tɔ lyem. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Dáa bot nabee deenek ɛ́, bot naadyeebalii ɛbiyoɛpe kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu étɛp tak. Bɛ nadi ekeke ɛ́ náá: «Mot'ak eetɔ́ kɛdi tɔ ndjaa mot na mbee dék!» <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Zasye eezɛwyɛl sok bhwoob ɛ Yezu, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, gwaka, mɛ ɛpekaa mɛvu mam mɛkɛɛ mɛbá. Ɛkɛɛ wat mɛ waadjɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot. Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛ naanɔɔ epata e mot, dhaa yii mɛ nawaagoka nɛ ɛnɔŋ ɔɔ, mɛ waabulal nyɛ mɛtaŋ mɛ mɛnɔŋ ɛ́ esok ená.» <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Dwoo pan mos'ak, tsik eeni tɔ ndjaŋ'ak, etɛɛ náá, wɔy pe ɛ́ dha ɛ Abalaam. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Etɛɛ náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛsaa bot djas nazewo ze ɔ étɛp ɛtsik bɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Yezu eebaazɛlɛɛ dhiiti kana dum nɛ bot ɛ́ nadi egwak nyɛ ɔ. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, nyɛ eezekunaa nɛ Yeluzalɛm. Bot nadi egek ɛ́ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb eezekɔ nɛ ɛtuula. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mot ngɔt nabyel tɔ mɛbyel mɛ bɛkum ɛ bot ɔ, zokazɛtɔ́ mɛdjoŋ pɛ dhiiti kyee dik ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ dɛl ɛ lɛ, étɛp nyɛ neekɛdjɛaa bóó mɛkoozi. Bhii tak nyɛ ɛ́ zɛbula pɛ dɛl ɛ lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Ɛsok nɛ nyɛ nɛ tɔ́, nyɛ eezɛdjóo bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ kam, lik bɛ mot nɛ mot nɛ ɛdhɛɛb ɛ lɔɔd wat nadi nɛ boo mɛtaŋ ɛ. Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Likeka é liig mɛmbɔ nɛ epata bak, kɛkum dwoo mɛ aaboobula ɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Tin, ye kabela náá, bot ɛ kyee dik'ɛ nadi ebhina nyɛ. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛlwom bot nyɛy ààgu, étɛp bot ɛ tak neekɛlɛɛ náá: “Bis ààpakwyɛl náá, mot'enɔk di mɛkoozi mes.”<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Saabɛgɔs náá, bɛ naabatadjɛ nyɛ bóó mɛkoozi. Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛsik pɛ dɛl ɛ lɛ. Dáa nyɛ nakakum ɛ, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛdjóo bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ nyɛ nadjɛ bɛ epata ɔ, étɛp nyɛ needji bɛ bim epata ee nakala kɔ yii nyɛ nalik bɛ nɛ yɛ étɛp ɛliig ɛ mɛmbɔ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Mot ɛsok eezɛzyɛ, nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: “Mɛkoozi, mɛ eebela mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd kam kɔ yii wɔ nalik mɛ nɛ yɛ ɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Mɛkoozi eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: “Ɛnyɔɛpe! Wɔ ɛ́ mbɛɛ mot-mɛsa. Dáa ye di náá, wɔ kɛ ɛ́ tɔ etsoŋ dum nɛ bɔɔ esonok ɛ, mɛ eedil wɔ kukuma eghaada kam.” <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Mot bhɔɔba mot ɛsok ɔ eezɛzyɛ yɛ. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ mɛkoozi mɛ náá: “Mɛkoozi, mɛ eebela mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd mɛtɛn kɔ yii wɔ nalik mɛ nɛ yɛ ɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Mɛkoozi eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: “Ɛnyɔɛpe wɔy, mɛ eedil wɔ kukuma eghaada etɛn.”<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Nwyak dhiiti mot-mɛsa eezɛzyɛ. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ mɛkoozi mɛ náá: “Ghɛŋ, beea ɛdhɛɛb ɛ lɔɔd wɔ nalik mɛ nɛ yɛ ɛ. Mɛ ààpabe. Mɛ eekwom yɛ syela tɔ pes kaad. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Etɛɛ náá, mɛ di ɛ́, nɛ bwoo nɛ nɔ. Wɔy ɛ́ mot ngɔt di náá, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ biyo dhaa tyɛ. Wɔ nɛ dyeebanɔɔ dɔɔ nɛ sa di náá, wɔ ààpakwom ɛ. Wɔ nɛ tɔ́ tɔ epyeeb e baa, kɛnɔɔ edee bɔɔ, ààbɛ náá, wɔy ɛ́ nabɛ yɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />É di'enek, mɛkoozi ɛ́ boobɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: “Mbee mot-mɛsa, beta náá, mɛ pɛ́ɛ wɔ nɛ mɛkpa mɔ met. Wɔ nadi egu náá, mam dyeebakɛbɔ́k edee ɛ́ tɔ pyeeb mɛ nadi ààbɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Haaa étɛp yé wɔ di àànɔɔ epata bam, kɛwa tɔ eboo mendjaa mɛ di ebaal epata e bot ɛ? Wɔ pe di ɛ́ di tsoŋ mot ɔɔ, pe bula mɛ bula ɛ, mɛ zɛbela ɛ́ edhiiti epata eezekala kɔ yii mɛ nalik ɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛke nɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ náá: “Dɛkeka nyɛ ɛdhɛɛb ɛ lɔɔd yii nyɛ di nɛ yɛ'enek, da bi ɛ́ djɛ mot bela kam kɔ yii mɛ nadjɛ nyɛ ɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Bot ɛ tak eezɛbɔɔza nɛ mɛkoozi tak náá: “Mɛkoozi, nyɛy moo ɛ́ nɛ mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd kam!” <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Mɛkoozi eebaazɛbɔɔza náá: “Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, yɛ ɛ́ pɛ daa bot djas aadi nɛ batsa ɔ, bɛ aabil étɛp ye neebu. Tin, mot aakadi toto ààbɛ nɛ sonok ɔɔ, bɛ waadɛk nyɛ dɔɔ nɛ eghutu-ghutu nyɛ lik nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Yɛ kabɛ bot ɛ di ebhina mɛ ɔɔ, bot ɛ nadi ààkwyɛl náá, mɛ di mɛkoozi ɔ, dhaka nɛ nɔɔ wak, da bi ɛ́ tsak bɛ é mis mam.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eetɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Bhii bɛ nalii deenek ɛ́, Yezu eezɛbyet tɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Nyɛy pɛ sok lɔɔg mɛdhuu mɛ bot. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Dáa nyɛ nadi, nyɛ moo ekunaa nɛ mɛl mɛ Bhɛtfaze nɛ Bhetani, é ngwoob ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv ɛ, tin, Yezu eezɛlwom bɛdjekel bɛ bɛbá. <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ́ka kɔ dɛl ɛ di pɛ sok'enek. Tuula bi aatuula kɔ dɛl ɛ, bi ɛ́ waabee mɔɔ swooz an tiŋela, ye dinaa, mot dinaa ààpago kɔ lɛ ɔ. Tiika nyɛ, da bi ɛ́ zyɛ mɛ nɛ nɛ wak. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Mot ɛ́ dji bin náá: “Bi tii nyɛ étɛp yé?” Lɛɛka nyɛ náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ ɛ di nɛ gwyes nɛ nɛ.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Bhii tak, bot ɛ nalwomaa ɔ eezɛtɔ́, bɛ kakɛbela esonok djas ɛ́ dáa Yezu nazolɛɛ bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Dáa bɛ nakadi etii mɔɔ swooz an tak ɛ, bɛnakuma tak eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi tii mɔɔ swooz an étɛp yé?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ ɛ di nɛ gwyes tak.» <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Bɛ eezɛtii mɔɔ swooz an tak. Tin, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ daa Yezu. Bhii tak bɛ eezɛdja endjookuwa bɔɔ kɔ koŋ mɔɔ swooz an tak. Tin, bɛ eezɛgel Yezu kɔ lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Dáa bɛ nadi ekɛ ɛ, bot nakadi tin ɛ́ edja endjookuwa bɔɔ gba-gba. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Dáa bɛ nadi, bɛ moo ekunaa nɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, bɛ nadhaŋ ɛ́ pɛ ze di esul pɛ ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv ɛ. Mɛdhuu mɛ bɛdjekel moo tin eduwal Zɛɛb ɛlyelɛpe dum nɛ endem e mɛbwala mɛ bɛ nadi ebee ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Bɛ nakeke ɛ́ náá: «Zɛɛb sɛɛ Mɛkoozi mɛ di ezyɛ nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ mɛtel. Egwyem tɔ gwoo, duma nɛ Zɛɛb!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Bɛdhiiti eFalizyɛ nadi tɔ mɛdhuu mɛ bot binɔk ɔ zokake nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyoel, lyaka bɛdjekel bɔ náá, bɛ di gwyem.» <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Beeka, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, bɛ diyal enuub bɔɔ ɔɔ, mɛkok ɛ́ waatsim é di yɔɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛpedje kɔ ɛsu ɛ dɛl ɛ Yeluzalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Dáa Yezu nakum é bhaaz Yeluzalɛm ɛ, beea nyɛ nabee ghaada tak ɛ, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokadje kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Nyɛy náá: «Wɔy Yeluzalɛm, mos wɔ ààpagu dáa wɔ goka nɛ ɛsa, etɛɛ wɔ neebela egwyem ɛ. Nenak, ye moo ɛ́ syela é mis mɔ, wɔ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbee yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ɛwala ɛpezyɛ, ɛwala di náá, bot ɛ mɛbhuka mɔ aasum peeb étɛp bɛ neelumla dɛɛb nɛ nɔ ɛ. Bɛ waakaal wɔ kuku ɛbwak, da bɛ ɛ́ kɛmaad wɔ é edi djas. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Bɛ waatwaal wɔ dɔɔ nɛ bɔn bɔ djas. Bɛ aanàkwaalik ɛkok wat kɛla kɔ dhiiti ɛkok, etɛɛ náá, wɔ ààpamɛt ɛwala Zɛɛb zɛkwyee wɔ ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eesɔ bot ɛ di ebɔmsa esa pɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yezu naazɛni tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, wɔ gwaa nyɛ eezɛni esɔ bot ɛ nadi ebɔmsa esa bɔɔ tɔ tak ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Nyɛy nɛ bot ɛ tak náá: «Pɛ tɔ Ekwyala, Zɛɛb lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Ndjaŋ'am aadjóoaa ɛ́ ndjaa mendjaala.” Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, bi zeliig yɛ, ye di zɛɛga bot ɛ djii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.46 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Eza 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Zel 7.11</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Mɛlu djas Yezu nadi elelyo bot tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Tin, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, zɛnɔɔ bɛdhil ɛ bot ɛ dɛl nadi esaa dáa bɛ sa étɛp bɛ neegó Yezu ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Deenek bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààgu dáa bɛ di egoka nɛ ɛsa, etɛɛ náá, bot djas nadi ekwyɛl ɛgwak mɛlyo mɛ ɛbuɛpe.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Eghɛŋ ɛ Yezu dus wo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Dhiiti dwoo, Yezu nadi edjɛ bot mɛlyo tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Nyɛ nadi egoola bɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Zɛɛb. Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, zɛnɔɔ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda, zokazɛtuula é di'enek. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Bɛ eezɛdji Yezu náá: «Lɛɛa bis, kɔ eghɛŋ e zɛ wɔ di esa esesɛɛ binek? Ɛzɛ nadjɛ wɔ eghɛŋ e ɛsa deenek?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ ɛpɛdji bin pe kiya wat, pookobɔɔzaka mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Ɛzɛ nadhis Zaŋ, nyɛ zɛduu bot Zɛɛb? Ye nabɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb ohoo, ye nabɛ ɛ́ mot?» <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />É di'enek, bɛ moo tin esɔs pak'ɔɔ. Bɔɔ náá: «Mena ɛ keka nenak náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb” ɔɔ, nyɛ waadji mena náá: “Étɛp yé bi nadi ààmyaal Zaŋ?” <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Mena ɛ kakeka náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ nadhis nyɛ” ɔɔ, mɛdhuu mɛ bot bak djas ɛ́ waasaa ɛgó mena nɛ mɛkok. Etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ djas nɛ myaal náá, Zaŋ nabɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Bis ààgu mot nadhis nyɛ náá, nyɛ zɛduu bot Zɛɛb ɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dɔɔ nɛ mam pe, mɛ aanàkwaalɛɛ bin kɔ eghɛŋ e zɛ mɛ di esa esesɛɛ bak.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana bot ɛ mɛsa bɛ na embee elyem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛlii nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk tɔ kana náá: «Mot ngɔt naabɛ pyeeb vin'ɛ. Nyɛ eezɛpeeb pyeeb tak, pu guk tɔ ɛkok é di bɛ aadi esyaal mɛdii mɛ bhum tak ɔ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛkola yɛ nɛ bot ɛ di egu mɛsa mɛ vin ɔ. Nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, tɔ́ kɛbɔya pɛ nyɛ natɔ́ mɛdjoŋ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />É ghɛŋ, ɛwala ɛbɔ́k bhum tak nakakum ɛ, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛlwom dhiiti mot-mɛsa mɛ pɛ daa bot ɛ nakola pyeeb ɔ, étɛp bɛ needjɛ nyɛ yɛ bim tɔ yii bɛ bela tɔ pyeeb vin ɛ. É di'enek, wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ nalik nɛ pyeeb ɔ mɛt mot tak, duma nyɛ é nyel nɛ mɛbin, bhii tak, swaal nyɛ mɛmbɔ mɛ toto. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Nakuma pyeeb eebaazɛlwom dhiiti mot-mɛsa, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ daa lɔɔ tɔ pyeeb, bɛ eebaazɛbi nyɛ, zɛnyek, swaal nyɛ mɛmbɔ mɛ toto. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Nakuma pyeeb eebaazɛlwom nwyak mot-mɛsa tyee lwoma esok elɛl, bɔɔ duma nyɛ é nyel, baal nyɛ mɛpyoŋ, wus nyɛ pɛ kel. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Nakuma pyeeb vin eezɛke: “Mɛ kasa dáa? Mɛ aakakyeed ɛ́, mɔn'am ngɔt mɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɔ. Tin, mɛ bee ɛ́ náá, bɛ waakaab nyɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Dáa bot ɛ di esa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb'ɛ nabee mɔn'enɔk ɛ, bɔɔ náá: “Yaweee! Beeka mot aalik nɛ mɛvu mak djas ɔ! Dhaka, mena góka nyɛ. Tin, mɛvu mak aakadi ɛ́ yenabɛlka.” <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛmɛt nyɛ, mwas nyɛ bhii pyeeb vin, gó nyɛ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Tin, Yezu eezɛdji bɛ náá: «É di'enek, nakuma pyeeb goka nɛ ɛsa bɛ yé?» Yezu eezɛbil náá: <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />«Nyɛ waazyɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ gó bot ɛ nadi esa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb vin'ɛ ɔ. Bhii tak nyɛ ɛ́ zɛnɔɔ pyeeb, djɛ nɛ bot ɛ sis.» Bhii bot nagwak deenek ɛ́, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Ààbɛ! Yenek aanàkwaasael.» <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛliig mis, gwyák bɛ. Nyɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛkpa mɛ di ekwyala tɔ mɛkana mak ɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">“Ɛkok ɛ bɛsumel mwas ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">ye moo ɛ́ ɛkok di epyet ndjaŋ ɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.17 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Mɛd 118.22</ref></char></char></note>”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 20:17">Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ yé? <verse eid="LUK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Mot aaduma kɔ ɛkok ɛ tak ɔ, nyɛ waabik ekyes-ekyes. Yɛ kabɛ náá, ɛkok ɛ kakwyit kɔ mot ɔɔ, yenɔk mot aatwaalel ɛ́ twaalelak.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etuud e lapo pɛ daa Sezaad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Tin, bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nadi esaa mɛpek étɛp bɛ neemɛt Yezu é di tak wat. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ naagu náá, Yezu nalɛɛ kana tak ɛ́, kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔɔ. Tin, bɛ nadi ekaab ɛ́ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Bɛ moo tin ebɔŋal Yezu. É di'enek, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛdhis bɛdhiiti bot ɛ nadi esa mɛpek náá, bɛ ɛ́ bɛdhil ɛ bot ɔ. Bot ɛ tak nazyɛ ɛ́, étɛp ɛzɛlóo Yezu pɛ ɛko, da bwood nyɛ pɛ kyɛ, nɛ mɛdjin mɛ bɛ aadi edji nyɛ ɛ, étɛp bɛ neebela lo mɛsɔ mɛ bɛ aaka nyɛ é ghwyil mɛbwala nɛ eghɛŋ e kukuma dɛl ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Lyoel, bis nɛ gu náá, etɛp ee wɔ di elɛɛ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ. Wɔy ààpɛ́ɛ mot nɛ dáa wɔ di ebee nyɛ ɛ, wɔy lyo etɛp e Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ, nɛ lyem epiki. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Tinaak, lɛɛa bis, etsi lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, epata e lapo tuudaa ɛ́ nɛ mɛkoozi Sezaad é?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Tin, Yezu eezɛgu mɛpek mɔɔ. Bhii tak nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Dhaka mɛ nɛ pata wat, étɛp mɛ neebee.» Bɛ eezɛzyɛ nyɛ nɛ dhenye wat. Yezu eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bhwoob di sɔna kɔ pata yak ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ ɛbhwoob ɛ zɛ? Yɛ ɛ́ ekwyala din ɛ zɛ di kɔ tak?» Bot binɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ bhwoob nɛ din ɛ mɛkoozi Sezaad.» <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Bhii tak, Yezu eebaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Djɛka Sezaad sa di yɛ Sezaad ɛ, da bi ɛ́ djɛ Zɛɛb sa di yɛ Zɛɛb ɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />É di'enek, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbela di ɛmɛt Yezu nɛ mɛkpa mɛ nyɛ nadi elii é mis mɛ bot ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, gwaka bɛ nagwak deenek ɛ́, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bɛ naadyeebadjoka nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe, tin, bɛ eezɛdi gwyem.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiya dum nɛ tɛp ɛgom bhis ɛsyee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Bɛdhiiti bot tɔ lɔɔg eSaduseɛ di eke náá, bhis ɛsyee, mot aanàkwaabaagom ɔ, zokazyɛ pɛ daa Yezu zɛdji nyɛ dhiiti kiya. <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />Bɔɔ nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyoel, mɛkana ɛ Moiiz lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Yɛ bɛ náá, dhiiti mot naaba moma, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛgwyɛ ààlik mɔn ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, dhyeeb mot lik ɔ, ba kus myɛl étɛp nyɛ neekwyiida tel gwyɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Djhoogekeka náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá. Mɔn mɛgwyak eezɛba moma, da gwyɛ, ààlik mɔn. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Mot bhɔɔba mɔn mɛgwyak ɔ, nyɛ eeba kus moma tak. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Tin, nyɛ eebaakpaa nɛ mɛsyee, gwyɛ, ààlik bɔn. Bhii tak, nwyak yii elɛl eebaazɛnɔɔ moma tak, ye zokabaasael ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ bot ɛ naba moma tak sok ɔ, zɛnɔɔ zwaabel ɛ lɔɔg. É di'enek, bɔɔ djas bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá kadi ɛ́, ààbya nɛ moma yenɔk. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Bhii bɔɔ djas, moma eebaazɛgwyɛ yɛ pe. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />É sok bot aagom bhis ɛsyee ɛ, moma yenɔk aakadi mwaa zɛ tɔ bɔɔ bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá? Etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ djas nabɛ ɛ́ botom bɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Botom nɛ boa di kɔ bɔs'ak ɔ, bɛ ɛpebael. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Tin, guka náá, botom nɛ boa aabela mbyok ɛgom bhis ɛsyee, da bɛ ɛ́ kɛdi tɔ tsik na bes ɔ, bɛ aanàdi tɔ mɛba. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Bɛ aanàkwaakabaagwyɛ, bɛ aakadi ɛ́ dáa efofop. Bɛ ɛ́ bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá, bɛ eezedhaa ɛsyee, kɛbela tsik. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Moiiz naalɛɛ popoopwon náá, bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ, bɛ waagom. Nyɛ nalɛɛ deenek ɛ́ tɔ Ekwyala ee di ekaada tɛp ɛkpak nadi egel ààdyak ɛ. Nyɛ nadjóo Ghɛŋ ɛ́: “Zɛɛb ɛ Abalaam, Zɛɛb ɛ Izak, Zɛɛb ɛ Zakɔɔb.”» <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Yezu naabaazɛke náá: «Zɛɛb tok Zɛɛb bot ɛ zegwyɛ ɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb bot ɛ di nɛ tsik ɔ, etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ étɛp'ɛ ɛ bot djas di nɛ tsik.» <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛdhiiti bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nadi tin ɔ zokake nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyoel, wɔ eedyeebalii ɛnyɔɛpe.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Deenek, bɛ moo kyee ɛdji ɛ nyɛ ekiya.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛsia nɛ Dhavid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dum nɛ yé bot di eke náá, Mɛsia ɛ́ dha ɛ mɛkoozi Dhavid? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ Dhavid nyɛ ɛmet ɛ nalɛɛ tɔ Mɛkana mɛ Mɛdjeeb náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb nake nɛ Ghɛŋ'am ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">Dha disi pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ bam.<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Mɛ waanɛɛg bot ɛ mɛbhuka mɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:43">bɛ di esa ee mɛbɔ mɔ aanyal ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.43 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mɛd 110.1</ref></char></char></note>.”<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Dhavid nyɛ ɛmet naadjóo nyɛ “Ghɛŋ”, haaa é yaa tyɛ Mɛsia aakabaadi dha ɛ Dhavid?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eedul bot mɛlɔ dum nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Dáa zukamwaa nɛ mot nadi tin egwak nyɛ ɛ, Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Kyeeka bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, bot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛkɛ tɔ bot nɛ ewolo ekaad na boo mɛtaŋ elyaala mɛnyel étɛp bɛ needuwalaa nɛ ɛswosaa é edi bot di esɛɛga ɛbuɛpe ɔ. Bɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɛdi ɛ́ kɔ mɛbhóó mɛ di pɛ sok ɛ tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda nɛ tɔ edi e mɛbyoŋ. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Yɛ ɛ́ bot binɔk ɛ di edjii esa tɔ mendjaa mɛ bɛkus ɛ boa. Tɔ mɛkɔŋ mɔɔ, bɛ nɛ kwyɛl ɛdul ɛ mendjaala na “kpɔkɔlɔm”, étɛp bot needi ààbee embee esa bɛ di esa ɛ. Epɛ́ɛ bɔɔ aadi ɛ́, ɛlyelɛpe.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Falanga djel kus moma nadjɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yezu zokazɛben lo, nyɛ moo tin ebee dáa bɛkum ɛ bot nadi ezɛwa epata tɔ ɛbɔɔl ɛ nanɛɛgaa kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa étɛp tak ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Nyɛ eezɛbee dhiiti djel kus moma ezyɛ zɛwa yɛ bɔɔ efalanga ebá tɔ ɛbɔɔl. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Dáa Yezu nabee deenek ɛ́, nyɛ ɛ́ booke náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, djel kus moma yak eelóo tɔ ɛbɔɔl dhaa yii bot djas lóo wak ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ lóo wak djas'aak, bɛ lóo ɛ́ eghutu-ghutu. Tɔ mɛbɔs mɛ, kus moma yak djɛ ɛ́ ɛkwom ɛ lɛ djas.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eelɛɛ náá, Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ́ waawaazel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Bɛdhiiti bot ɛ nadi elii dum nɛ zumal Ndjaa-ebuwa, dáa ye nasumel nɛ embɛɛ mɛkok ɛ, zɛnɔɔ esa ee bot nakadjɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Tin, Yezu eezɛke náá: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Dhiiti ɛlu ɛpezyɛ, ɛlu ɛ di náá, yɛ aanàkabaalik é di'ak ɛkok ɛ wat kɛla kɔ sɔ ɛkok tɔ ndjaa bi di bee'aak. Etɛɛ náá, djas aadi ɛ́, bik, waazel, see é bɔs.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mezuk nɛ mɛtiiga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛdji Yezu náá: «Lyoel! Lɛɛa bis, esesɛɛ binek aasael den? Lyaala bis endem ee bis aagwyák náá, esesɛɛ binek moo kɔ nɛ ɛsael ɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Tselalka, nàbetka náá, bɛ kɔɔ bin etɛɛ náá, bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ́ waazyɛ nɛ din ɛ lam. Mot nɛ mot ɛ́ waalɛɛ náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di Mɛsia.” Bɛ aake náá: “Ɛlu ɛ tak eezedjala.” Sa bi ààdu bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />É sok bi aadi bi moo gwak lɛŋ mɛɛb, nɛ menduk mɛ ɛkus ɛ ɛghuub ɛ, sa mot ààbem ba, ye goka ɛ́ esesɛɛ binek pookosael sok, guka náá, yenek ààlɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ ɛsi ɛ bɔs.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Yezu eebaazɛke náá: «Yak mbyak ɛ́ waaghɛɛ, kɛlumla dɛɛb nɛ dhiiti mbyak. Dhiiti ɛyoŋ ɛ wat ɛ́ waaghɛɛ kɛlumla dɛɛb nɛ yak ɛyoŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Bɔs ɛ́ waaboodheegel ɛlyelɛpe. É mɛdhik nɛ mɛdhik, yɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ pwom nɛ gum, bot djas ɛ́ waagwak bwoo é di bɛ baabee edjema nɛ epela tɔ gwoo ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Ɛsok nɛ esesɛɛ binek nɛ sael, bi ɛ́ waakɛmɛtaa, bi ɛ́ waakɛwaaa tɔ tsik mezuk, bi ɛ́ waakɛkaaa étɛp bɛ neekɛpɛ́ɛ bin tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda, bi ɛ́ waakɛmɛtaa é membok, bi ɛ́ waakɛpɛ́ɛaa pɛ daa bɛmɛkoozi nɛ ekukuma kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Yenek djas aasael ɛ, étɛp bi neebela ze ɛkɛlɛɛ bot sa bi di egu dum nɛ nam ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Dika nɛ lyem ɛnyɔɛpe, sa mot ààbem ba nɛ dáa bi aakɛtaŋal ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Mam ɛmet, mɛ waadjɛ bin mɛkpa nɛ etsoŋ. Tin, bot ɛ bi aadi nɛ tɛp nɛ nɔɔ aanàkwaakwak ɛkwyesal bin, nɛ ɛdupal mɛkpa men. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Bot aaka bin ɔ, yɛ aadi ɛ́, bɛsɛɛg bin, nɛ bɛnyɛɛg bin, bɔn-nyɛɛg bin, nɛ bɛsɔ bin, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ bi nɛ bɛnɔɔ di ɔ. Bɛdhiiti bot pak'en ɛ́ waagóaa tɔ membok.<verse eid="LUK 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Bot djas ɛ́ waabhina bin kɔ ɛsu ɛ din ɛ lam. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Tin, yɛ aanàkwaadi nɛ ko bhoo wat é elo bin aakodiib. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Kopyetka pɛ yebɔ kyee ɛlyelɛpe, etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bi aatsik mɛnyel men.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eelɛɛ náá, Yeluzalɛm ɛ́ waawaazel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />«É sok bi aabee náá, mɛdhuu mɛ esodja eezɛkaal Yeluzalɛm ɛ, tin, bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkagu náá, ye kalik ɛ́ ba ɛwala batsa Yeluzalɛm neewaazel! <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />É di'enek, bot aadi pɛ kyee dik Yude ɔ, goka ɛ́, nɛ ɛkaab tɔ́ kɔ mɛtsok. Bot aadi tɔ ghaada Yeluzalɛm ɔ, goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdus tin, tɔ́ ɛtsetaɛpe. Bot aadi pɛ tɔ epɛt é ɛwala ɛlenek ɔ, bɛ ààgoka nɛ ɛsik tɔ́ pɛ tɔ ghaada. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Etɛɛ náá, yɛ aadi ɛ́, mɛlu mɛ Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ ɛlu ɛ Ekwyala djas aabela mɛsuk ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ dwoo lenek nɛ boa aadi nɛ mɛbum ɔ, zɛnɔɔ boa aadi nɛ bɔn edɛ mɛbel dwoo lɛɛg ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, boo mezuk ɛ́ waadi dwoo tak kɔ bɔs. Bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ́ waagu ɛbuk ɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ghaada tak. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Bot ɛ tak ɛ́ waagóaa nɛ epɛl. Bɛdhiiti ɛ́ waamɛtaa é mbok, tɔ́aa nɛ nɔɔ pɛ tɔ ekyee mɛdhik djas. Tin, Yeluzalɛm ɛ́ waazɛnyalaa nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Bɛ waasa deenek, kɛkum dwoo Zɛɛb nadjɛ bɛ ɛ́ aadjala ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛzyɛ ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />«Bot ɛ́ waabee edjema nɛ epela tɔ gwyes, tɔ ngɔn, tɔ ekwyikwyen. Pɛ si, membyak djas ɛ́ waadi nɛ boo ba nɛ kɛŋ, di bɛ aagwak ghuu nɛ ɛbee boo mɛbhyeeb tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Gwyes nɛ ngɔn nɛ ekwyikwyen ɛ́ waadheegel nɛ ghwyil ɛ Zɛɛb. Bhii tak, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ́ waagwyɛ nɛ bwoo é siiza etɛp aabootuula kɔ bhwak djas ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />É di'enek, bɛ waabee Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ezyɛ tɔ eguud. Nyɛ waazyɛ nɛ ghwyil nɛ duma yɛ djas. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Dwoo etɛp binek aakan ɛ́, tyaaka, pyetka pɛ yebɔ kyee, etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb moo zɛpɛk bin é ekwom.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo dum nɛ le fiigh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛlɛɛ bɛ kana yak: «Pookobeeka bhek le fiigh nɛ edhiiti ele djas. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />É sok bi di ebee náá, eka e bes moo kan ɛkwyil é tak ɛ, bi nɛ gu náá, mbu ele di wum ɛ́ moo kunaa. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Tyee wat nɛ biyɔ pe, é sok bi aabee endem binek moo nyen ɛ, guka náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb moo ɛ́ yɛ eezekunaa. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, bot ɛ kɔkɔ membu mak aanàkwaagwyɛ djas, esonok mɛ lɛɛ wak djas'aak, ààsael. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Gwoo nɛ bɔs ɛ́ waadum, ghuna yam mɛkpa aalik ɛ́ kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛdi ɛ́ ghwyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />«Bi ɛ́ kobaka! Sa bi ààpul ebhum e elyem bin gwyes tɔ elangi nɛ tɔ mɛbyoŋ, dɔɔ nɛ étɛp ɛwa lyem tɔ ɛsiiza esa e bɔs'ak. Deenek, dwoo Zɛɛb aazyɛ zɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, yɛ aatuula bin ɛ́ zaka. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Yɛ aazyɛ dáa ɛwyet. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ yɛ aatuula bot ɛ bɔs djas zaka. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Dika ghwyɛ, gheedjaalaka Zɛɛb mɛlu djas. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ bi aabela ghwyil ɛmaad ɛ lyem dum nɛ etɛp ee di ezyɛ yenek. Da bi ɛ́ tyaa tetel sok bhwoob Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />É mwos, Yezu nadi elelyo bot ɛ pɛ tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa, é pum, nyɛ katetɔ́ kɛdjaasi ɛ́ kɔ ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Tin, tɔ mɛlem, bot ɛ dɛl djas nadi etɔ́ pɛ daa lɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa étɛp kɛgwak mɛlyo mɛ.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Boob ekukuma étɛp ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Ɛbyoŋ ɛ emapa di ààbɛ nɛ leviid, di djóoaa Pak ɛ, nabɛ ɛ́ yɛ eezekunaa. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nadi esaa mɛpek étɛp bɛ neemɛt Yezu, etɛɛ náá, bɛ neegó nyɛ. Tin, bɛ nadi ekaab zukamwaa nɛ mot nadi tin ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudas moo ɛ́ tsat nyɛ aaka Yezu é mɛmbɔ mɛ ekukuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Tin, Satan eezɛni tɔ bum lyem ɛ Yudas mot di edjóoaa Iskaliɔt ɔ, ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel kam nɛ bɛbá ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yudas naazɛtɔ́ pɛ daa eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bot ɛ di kɔ elo e bɛmbaalel ɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ, étɛp nyɛ neelɛɛ bɛ dáa nyɛ aasa étɛp ɛka bɛ Yezu ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Tin, bot ɛ di kɔ elo e bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ naadyeebamyaala. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛkɛk Yudas epata. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yudas eezɛmyaal, nyɛ moo tin esaa mɛpek mɛ nyɛ ka bɛ Yezu gha tɔ syaab ekaab náá, mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ́ ɛzɛkɛgu.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eelwom bɛdjekel bɛ, bɛ kɛkoobal di pɛ bɛ aakɛdɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />É dwoo ɛbyoŋ ɛ emapa di ààbɛ nɛ leviid ɛ, dwoo ebhata e Pak di ekaaa é buwa ɛ eezɛkum. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yezu eezɛkyeed Pyɛɛd bɛ nɛ Zaŋ pɛ sok. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ́ka, kɛkoobalka mena edee e ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Tin, bɛ eezɛdji Yezu náá: «Wɔ kwyɛl náá, bis kɛkoobal wɔ di mena aakɛdɛka edee e ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak ɛ wo?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Gwakeka, é sok bi aakum kɔ dɛl ɛ, bi ɛ́ waaboma nɛ dhiiti mot nɛ bhe mɛdii. Duka nyɛ, é di nyɛ aadjɛl ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />lɛɛka nakuma ndjaa náá: “Lyoel ke ɛ́, bis dji wɔ náá, ndjaa nyɛ aadɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak tɔ tak bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ́ wo é?” <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Tin, nyɛ waalyaal bin pɛ ɛko ɛ ndjaa, boo koo koobela nɛ esa djas tɔ tak. Tin ɛ bi aasa esesɛɛ e ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Bɛdjekel eezɛtɔ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ tak. Bɛ kabela djas ɛ́ dáa Yezu nalɛɛ bɛ ɛ. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛni ekoobal ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyel nɛ ghiya ɛ Yezu: kɔminyɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Dáa ɛwala tak nakadjala ɛ, Yezu eezɛdi kɔ mesa bɛ nɛ bot ɛ lwoma. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ bɛ ɛ́, mɛ eedyeebakwyɛl náá, mena dɛka ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak'ak é di wat, ɛsok nɛ náá, mɛ zuk! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Etɛɛ náá, ye goka ɛ́ mɛ lɛɛ bin náá, mɛ aanàkabaadɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛlak, kana mos, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo ɛsuk ɛ tak aabela lo tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Tin ɛ́ mɛ aakabaadɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ bɛɛlɛ nadi nɛ vin tɔ tak ɛ, nyɛ eezɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Nɔɔka bɛɛlɛ vin'ak. Kaaka yɛ pak'en, da bi ɛ́ dɛ, <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />etɛɛ náá, ye goka ɛ́ mɛ lɛɛ bin náá, kana dwoo pan mos'ak, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb aazyɛ ɛ, mɛ aanàkabaadɛ mɛnyok mɛ vin.» <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ mapa, nyɛ eebaazɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛ eezɛpyak yɛ, nɔɔ yɛ, djɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yak ɛ́ nyel'am zekaaa kɔ ɛsu ɛ len ɛ. Gheesesaka deenek étɛp bi neetetaala mɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Nyɛ eebaazɛdjɛ bɛ bɛɛlɛ tak wat bhii dek. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bɛɛlɛ yak ɛ́ bɛɛlɛ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na bes nɛ Zɛɛb, ɛbhɛŋ ɛ kwyalel nɛ ghiya yam see kɔ ɛsu ɛ len ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Tin, guka náá, mot aaka mɛ ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ wak, bis nɛ nɛ ɛ́ kɔ mesa yak! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waagwyɛ, dáa Zɛɛb nazekoobal ɛ. Tinaak, haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ mot aakɛka nyɛ ɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />É di'enek, bɛdjekel moo tin edjinel pak'ɔɔ náá, ɛzɛ aakɛka Yezu!<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛ ɛ́ ɛzɛ di dhil mot?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu moo tin ebe mɛso pak'ɔɔ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛgu, mot di dhil mot pak'ɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bɛmɛkoozi mɛ bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis ɛ́ waakokɔk kɔ bot ɛ bɛ di edjɛɛd ɔ. Bɛmɛkoozi menɔk ɛ di enyal bot bɔɔ, bɛ kwyɛl ɛdjóoaa ɛ́, bot ɛ enɛm esa. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Tin, yɛ ààgoka deenek pɛ yebɔ kyee. Etɛɛ náá, pɛ yebɔ, mot di dhil mot ɔ, nyɛ goka nɛ ɛdi tɔ bɛsɔ ɛ́, dáa mɔɔ dhyeeb. Deenek, mot ɛ́ kwyɛl ɛdi dhil mot ɔɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ di mot-mɛsa mɛ bɛsɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />É di'enek, ɛzɛ di dhil mot, yɛ ɛ́ mot di kɔ mesa ohoo, mot di elaa edee kɛl bɛsɔ yɛ ɛ kɔ mesa ɔ? Yɛ ɛ́ mot di kɔ mesa ɔ, etsal é? Beeka, mam ɛ́ tɔ len ɛ dáa mot di elaa edee kɛl bin yɛ ɛ kɔ mesa ɔ! <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Bi ɛ́ bot ɛ nadi mɛlu djas é ngwoob'am tɔ mɛbhowal ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Tyee wat nɛ dáa Saagam nadjɛ mɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ ɛ, tyee tak wat, mɛ ɛpedjɛ bin Ɛyoŋ ɛ tak. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Bi ɛ́ waadɛ edee nɛ mɛdii kɔ mesa yam, tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ lam. Bi ɛ́ waadi kɔ mɛbhóó mɛ mɛkoozi kam nɛ ebá, étɛp bi neepɛ́ɛ membyak kam nɛ ebá ɛ Yisalaɛl.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eelɛɛ Pyɛɛd náá, nyɛ waaswonal nyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yezu eezɛke náá: «Simɔŋ, Simɔŋ, gwaka! Satan eesaa ze étɛp ɛsyaal ɛ wɔ dáa embɛɛ mɛbhek di esyaalaa tɔ zyaagal étɛp ɛdis ezeeza ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Tin, ye bɛ ɛ́, mɛ eedjaala étɛp'ɔ, ekaab náá, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛzɛkɛwyii. Tin, é ghɛŋ wɔ aabulal lyem'ɔ pɛ yam ɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ djɛ bɔn-nyoog ghwyil.» <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Pyɛɛd eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, é di mɛ di'aak, mɛ eezemyaal ɛtɔ́ membok menabɛl, nɛghu ɛsyee menabɛl.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ: «Beta mɛ lɛɛ wɔ, Pyɛɛd, sa di tsɛɛtsɛ ɛ: É pum'ak mos, ɛsok nɛ kuu nɛ kɔk, yɛ aabela ɛ́, wɔ eezeswonal mɛ esok elɛl.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwyɛ epata, kpa, nɛ pɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «É sok mɛ nalwom bin, bi kɛsa mɛsa, toto ààbɛ nɛ ekpa, àànɔɔ ngwyɛ epata, àànɔɔ ekoko ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ sa wat nasu bin é?» Bɔɔ náá: «Ààbɛ, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààsu sa wat.» <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Deenek nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Nenak ye tokapɛ deenek, ye moo ɛ́ náá, mot di nɛ ngwyɛ epata bɛ ɔ, nyɛ nɔɔ yɛ. Tyee wat nɛ mot di nɛ kpa ɔ, nyɛ nɔɔ kpa yɛ, dɔɔ nɛ mot di ààbɛ nɛ pɛl ɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbɔmsa ndjookuwa yɛ étɛp ɛkɛbɔm pɛl. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Etɛɛ náá, nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ betka mɛ lɛɛ bin náá, ye goka ɛ́ náá, etɛp ee Ekwyala nalɛɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam náá: “Nyɛ naalaŋaa tɔ lɔɔg bot ɛ di ààlooba nɛ etsi ɔ.” Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ etɛp ee naliiel kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam ɛ, yɛ waasael.» <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Bhii tak, bɛdjekel eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, beea! Bis ɛ́ nɛ epɛl ebá.» Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yenek eedjala.»<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛpedjaala pɛ kɔ ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yezu eezɛwyis, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ kɔ ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv, dáa nyɛ nazyɛ nɛ ɛsesa sok ɛ. Bɛdjekel bɛ zokadu nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Bhii bɛ nakum é di tak ɛ, Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Djaalaka Zɛɛb étɛp bi ɛ́ zɛkɛkwyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal.» <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛtiila ba ziii tyee wusa pwak, nyɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si, nyɛ moo edjaala. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Nyɛ nadi ekeke tɔ mendjaala mɛ ɛ́ náá: «Saagam, wɔ kwyɛl ɔɔ, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdis bɛɛlɛ mezuk mak sok bhwoob'am. Ye nakoozodi, ye goka ɛ́ náá, ɛkwosak ɛ lɔ sael, ààkabɛ yam.» [<verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Tin, wɔ gwaa fofop ngɔt zokadus tɔ gwoo, zɛdjɛ nyɛ mɛghaaz. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yezu, tɔ bɛbebwol nɛ bwoo, nyɛ eebaazɛnenal nyel tɔ mendjaala. Wɔ gwaa edidyok moo tin epak nyɛ é nyel, see é bɔs dáa mɛtɔ mɛ ghiya.]<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Bhii nyɛ zedjaala ɛ, nyɛ eezɛwyɛl, sik pɛ kyee bɛdjekel bɛ nadi ɛ́. Nyɛ kakɛbela bɔɔ djas ɛ́ mendjaamesi é egɔ́ nɛ ghoŋ nazekwyɛsa bɛ tɔ elyem ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Étɛp yé bi di edja egɔ́? Wyɛlka, da bi ɛ́ djaala Zɛɛb étɛp ɛkaab náá, bi ɛzɛkɛkwyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eemɛtaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Ye nabela ɛ́, Yezu dinaa elii, tin, Yudas, ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá eezɛtuula nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot. Bhii tak, Yudas eezɛtiila pɛ daa Yezu étɛp nyɛ neebeedal nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Tinaak, Yezu zokake nɛ nɛ náá: «Yudas, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛbeedela menek ɛ wɔ di eka Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot é?» <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />É ghɛŋ bot ɛ nadi egyee nɛ Yezu nabee sa nadi ekwyɛl ɛsael é di'enek ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, wɔ ɛpekwyɛl náá, bis lum bɛ nɛ epɛl é?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Ngɔt pak'ɔɔ zokakwyal mot-mɛsa ɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb, zɛtsaal nyɛ ɛlɔ pɛ kyee mbɔ eghɛŋ. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Tin, Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Betka, yɛ eedjala.» Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛmɛt ɛlɔ ɛ mot tak, wɔ gwaa pyoŋ tak zɛgel. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛmbaalel ɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa zɛnɔɔ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda zyɛ zɛmɛt nyɛ ɔ náá: «Bi zyɛ ɛ́ nɛ epɛl nɛ eghwyɛs ɛkɛɛ náá, bi zɛmɛt ɛ́ mot djii. <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Mɛlu djas, mɛ nadi ɛ́, nɛ nen tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààsaa náá, bi mɛt mɛ. Tin, yak ɛwala ɛ́ yebɔ, yɛ ɛ́ ɛwala ɛ ghwyil ɛgwyitok.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pyɛɛd eeswonal Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Dáa bɛ namɛt Yezu ɛ, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ ndjaa boo ghaa-Zɛɛb. Kabela tin ɛ, Pyɛɛd ɛpedu bɛ pɛ bhii koŋ, ba ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naapaada du kuku ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ peeb. Tin, Pyɛɛd zokazɛdisi egɔɔl du bɛ nɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Dhiiti moma nadi esa mɛsa tɔ ndjaa boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ zokazɛbee nyɛ ndiindel egɔɔl du. Moma tak eezɛgwyák nyɛ kpɛɛɛ, nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Mot'ak pe nadi ɛ́, bɛ nɛ Yezu!» <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Wɔ gwaa, Pyɛɛd zɛswonal, nyɛy náá: «Mɔɔ moma, mam ààgu nyɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Ba mɔɔ ɛwala bhii tak, dhiiti mot-mɛsa eebaazɛgwyák nyɛ. Mot tak nɛ Pyɛɛd náá: «Dɔɔ nɛ wɔy pe, wɔ ɛ́ mot'ɔɔ.» Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛbɔɔza nɛ mot tak náá: «Ààbɛ, Mam ààgyee bis nɛ nɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Tyee ba ɛwala wat bhii tak, wɔ gwaa dhiiti baazɛke nɛ ghwyil djas náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mot'ak nadi ɛ́, bɛ nɛ nɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot kyee dik Ghalile.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Tin, Pyɛɛd eebaazɛbɔɔza náá: «Mɛ ààgu sa wɔ di ekwyɛl ɛlii yenek.» É di'enek, Pyɛɛd dinaa elii deenek, kuu eezɛkɔk. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Ghɛŋ zokazɛliig mis, gwyák Pyɛɛd, bhii tak mis mɔɔ eezɛboma. É di'enek, Pyɛɛd eezɛtaala sa Ghɛŋ nalɛɛ nyɛ ɛ: «Ɛsok nɛ kuu kɔk mos, yɛ aabela ɛ́, wɔ eezeswonal mɛ esok elɛl.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛwyis, tɔ́, nyɛ moo tin edjii ɛbuɛpe.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eeleeaa nɛ ɛbiaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Bot ɛ nadi ebaal Yezu ɔ moo tin eduk nyɛ. Bhii tak bɛ eezɛnyuu nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bɛ eezɛbutal nyɛ kaad é mis. Bhii tak, bɛ moo edji nyɛ náá: «Naŋa! Ɛzɛ nyuu wɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Tin, bɛ naalee nyɛ ɛbuɛpe.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu sok bhwoob boo zɛɛga ekukuma e eYuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Tɔ mɛlem kɛɛŋ, bɛpaa ɛ eYuda, bɛ nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, zɛnɔɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi eezɛsɛɛga. Bɛ eezɛtel Yezu kuku boo kwan eYuda, é di etɛp di epɛ́ɛaa ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Tin, bɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Mɛsia ɔɔ, lɛɛa bis!» Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin náá, mɛ ɛ́ Mɛsia ɔɔ, bi aanàkwaamyaal mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Mɛ kodji bin kiya ɔɔ, bi aanàkwaabɔɔza mɛ. Bi nakoodi ààmyaal, mɛ ɛpelɛɛ bin náá, <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />kana dwoo pan mos'ak, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aadi ɛ́ ndiindel pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake.» <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />É di'enek, bɔɔ djas eezɛdji Yezu náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb é?» Yezu zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ dáa bi zoke yenek, yɛ ɛ́ mam.» <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛtsim náá: «Mena tokapɛ nɛ gwyes nɛ mot aapit nyɛ ɔ. Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ menabɛl bɛmet eegwak mɛkpa mɛ nuub'ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yezu sok bhwoob ɛ Pilat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Bot ɛ zɛɛga djas eezɛwyɛl, bhii tak, beezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ daa kukuma Pilat. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />É di'enek, bɛ moo tinaak esu nyɛ etɛp. Bɔɔ náá: «Bis bela mot'ak ɛ́, ebesal bot ɛ mbyak'es bɛ kus ɛghuub. Nyɛ ɛpelu bot náá, bɛ nàdjɛ epata e lapo nɛ Sezaad. Nyɛ ke ɛ́ náá, yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ di Mɛsia, nɛghu “mɛkoozi”.» <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Kukuma Pilat eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔy ɛ́ di mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda?» Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ dáa wɔy, wɔ ɛmet ke'enek.» <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Bhii tak, kukuma Pilat eezɛke nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot nadi tin ɔ náá: «Mam ààpabee tɛp mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛkwyesal mot'ak ndjɛ sɔs ɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Tin, bɛ eebaazɛben gwood, tsim ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Nyɛ ɛpebesal bot, bɛ kus ɛghuub nɛ kɔkɔ mbi mɛlyo mɛ. Nyɛ nakan nɛ yɛ ɛ, pɛ kyee dik Ghalile. Nyɛ eezɛtuula nɛ yɛ pɛ kyee dik Yude. Yɛ ɛ́ nyɛ moo nɛ yɛ mos wak'aak.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu sok bhwoob ɛ mɛkoozi Eelood</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Dáa kukuma Pilat nagwak mɛkpa menek ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boodji náá: «Mot'ak ɛ́ mot Ghalile?» <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Tin, bɛ eezɛlɛɛ nyɛ náá, Yezu nadus ɛ́ pɛ kyee dik Eelood nadi ekɔk kɔ tak ɛ. Deenek nyɛ ɛ́ bookyeed Yezu pɛ daa Eelood. Etɛɛ náá, mɛkoozi Eelood naazyɛ zɛkwyɛɛg ba mɛlu tin tɔ Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Mɛkoozi Eelood naadyeebamyaala ɛbuɛpe dáa nyɛ nabee Yezu ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naadyeebagwak menduk ɛ Yezu. Nyɛ nadi esaa ɛboma nɛ nɛ. Nyɛ nadi esuu ɛ́ náá, Yezu sa dhiiti ndem mɛbwala é mis mɛ nyɛ neebee. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛdji Yezu bɛtɛ nɛ mɛdjin, Yezu kadi ɛ́ gwyem, ààbɔɔza. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nadi ɛ́ tin. Bɛ nadi esu etɛp e mɛpita ɛbuɛpe kɔ lo ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Mɛkoozi Eelood nɛ esodja bɛ zokaduk nyɛ, gɔ nyɛ. Bɛ nabee nyɛ ɛ́ tyee ba vaŋ put mot. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛbét nyɛ mbɛɛ wolo kaad, bɛ eezɛswaal nyɛ pɛ daa kukuma Pilat. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Mɛkoozi Eelood bɛ nɛ kukuma Pilat nabɛ sok ɛ́, ààgwakel. Yɛ ɛ́ dwoo lenek ɛ bɛ nakan ɛgwakel.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛ eezɛpɛ́ɛ Yezu epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Kukuma Pilat eezɛsɛɛga é boob bɛ nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ ekukuma eYuda, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ dɛl, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi zyɛ mɛ nɛ mot'ak ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛpebesal bot, bɛ kus ɛghuub é? Deenek ye bɛ ɛ́, mɛ eedji yɛ taŋal é mis men wak, tin, mam ààpabee embee etɛp ee bi zɛpit nyɛ étɛp tak ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Mɛkoozi Eelood ààpabela nyɛ nɛ ndjɛ, yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ nyɛ naswaal nyɛ wak. Deenek, mot'ak ààpasa dhiiti tɛp mena di egoka nɛ ɛgó ɛ nyɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, mɛ waalwom náá, bɛ bi nyɛ nɛ eghwyɛs. Bhii tak da mɛ ɛ́ bet nyɛ.» [ <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />É ghɛŋ mɛbyoŋ mɛ Pak djas di esael ɛ, kukuma Pilat nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛzel ɛ ɛwyisal mot membok ngɔt.] <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Wɔ gwaa, bɔɔ djas zokazɛtsim náá: «Góa mot'ak, da wɔ ɛ́ bet bis Bhaalabhas.» <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Bela náá, Bhaalabhas namɛtaa é mbok ɛ́, étɛp nyɛ naagó mot, é sok bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ nabe boo dho nɛ bot ɛ Lɔm tɔ ghaada ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Dáa Pilat nakwyɛl ɛbet ɛ Yezu ɛ, nyɛ eebaazɛdji ɛdhuu ɛ bot. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Deenek, wɔ gwaa bot djas zɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe: «Bemka nyɛ é mɛlaaba! Bemka nyɛ é mɛlaaba!» <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilat zokazɛbaadji bɛ tyee djia esok elɛl náá: «Mot'ak sa yaa ɛbiyo? Mɛ ààpabee gham'en bi di eke náá, nyɛ góaa ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ ke náá, bɛ bi nyɛ nɛ eghwyɛs, da bɛ ɛ́ bet nyɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Tin, bot nadi ebesal nɛ etsim ɛlyelɛpe náá, nyɛ bemaa é mɛlaaba. Etsim bɔɔ naadhaa Pilat. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Deenek, Pilat zokazɛtsaal tɛp, nyɛy náá, ye zokasael dáa ɛdhuu ɛ bot kwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Tin, kukuma Pilat eezɛwyisal mot bɔɔ nadi ekwyɛl náá, nyɛ wyisal ɔ. Mot tak namɛtaa é mbok ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naagó mot é ghɛŋ boo dho nasael nɛ bot ɛ Lɔm ɛ. Deenek, kukuma Pilat naazɛdjɛ Yezu é mɛmbɔ mɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Saka nyɛ sa bi di ekwyɛl ɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eebemaa é mɛlaaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Dáa bɛ nadi etɔ́ nɛ Yezu ɛ, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛboma nɛ Simɔŋ mot dɛl Silɛn. Nyɛ nadi edus yɛ ɛ, pɛ pyeeb. Esodja ɛboozɛmɛt nyɛ, djɛ nyɛ mɛlaaba, nyɛ kwyee Yezu é ɛbɛp ɛ yɛ, da du Yezu pɛ bhis. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Zukamwaa nɛ mot mɛdhuu-mɛdhuu nadi edu bɛ, zɛnɔɔ boa edje mɛgwyɛ nɛ etsim kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Tin, Yezu zokazɛliig mis, gwyák bɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Boa ɛ Yeluzalɛm, nàdjeka kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam! Bi goka nɛ ɛdje ɛ́ étɛp'en nɛ étɛp bɔn bin! <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Etɛɛ náá, ɛwala ɛpezyɛ, ɛwala di náá, mot aake: “Mɛnyɔ nɛ bɛkwyiid ɛ boa, mɛnyɔ nɛ boa di náá, bɛ dinaa ààpabya ɔ, mɛnyɔ nɛ boa di ààgu dáa mɔn di edjɛaa ɛbel ɛ!” <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />É di'enek, bot ɛ́ waake nɛ mɛtsok náá: “Dha dumaka kɔ les!” Nɛ eghooda náá: “Dha syelka bis!” <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Etɛɛ náá, kwyii le bes saaa dáak, gwyata nɛ syeela le? Bɛ aakasa dáa nɛ yɛ?»<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Esodja eebaazɛtɔ́ nɛ botom ɛbá, bɛmbee ɛ bot, bɛ neegó bɛ sama nɛ Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />É ghɛŋ bɛ nakum é di bɛ di edjóo, «Bhoobo Lo» ɛ, esodja zokazɛbem Yezu é mɛlaaba, nɛ bɛmbee ɛ bot ɛbá, nwyak pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ, nwyak dhiiti pɛ mbɔ ɛmyɛl. <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus est crucifié sur la croix avec les deux malfaiteurs" file="WA03926b.tif" size="span" loc="23.33" copy="Graham Wade" ref="23.33">Yezu eebemaa kɔ mɛlaaba sama nɛ bɛmbee ɛ bot ɛbá</figure><verse eid="LUK 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke: «Saagam, pela bɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ ààgu sa bɛ di esa ɛ.» É di'enek, esodja eezɛkaa ekaad bɛ, bhii bɛ nazesa ɛgwyeeg ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Mɛdhuu mɛ bot nadi ɛ́ tin ebee. Wɔ gwaa, ekukuma eYuda moo tin, eduk Yezu. Bɔɔ náá: «Nyɛ naatsik bot ɛ sis, nyɛ katsik nyel'ɛ met, yɛ bɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ Mɛsia Zɛɛb natɔ ɔɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Dɔɔ nɛ esodja pe nadi eduk nyɛ. Bɛ zokazɛtiila, wɔ gwaa, bɛ djɛ nyɛ mɛnyok mɛ na bwaaz-bwaaz. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda ɔɔ, tsika nyel'ɔ wɔy wɔ ɛmet!» <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Pɛ ɛko ɛ mɛlaaba ɛ Yezu, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naabɛk mɔɔ pes le kwyala kɔ tak náá: «Nwyak ɛ́ Mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda.»<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Tɔ bɛmbee ɛ bot ɛbá nabemaa é mɛlaaba ɔ, ngɔt naabyasal Yezu. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ paalɛɛ ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Mɛsia. Deenek, tsika nyel'ɔ tɔ ɛsyee, da wɔ ɛ́ baatsik bisɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Tinaak, wɔ gwaa nwyak dhiiti mbee mot zɛdjɛ sɔ mɛbɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ ààkaab Zɛɛb é, wɔy mot di ebee mezuk mɛ wat dáa nyɛy'aak? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Yenabɛl mezuk eegoka nɛ nena, etɛɛ náá, mena gwyɛ ɛ́, étɛp embee esesɛɛ bina. Bela náá, mot'ak ààpasa dhiiti sa ɛbiyo.» <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eebaazeke náá: «Yezu, sa wɔ ààdjisa mɛ, dwoo wɔ aaboozyɛ dáa mɛkoozi tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ lɔ ɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ́ náá: Mos, wɔ aadi ɛ́ nɛ nam sama tɔ paladi.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛsyee ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Dáa dwoo nadi ye moo kuku mwos ɛ, wɔ gwaa gwyes zɛsila, ɛgwyitok zɛgwyiidela kɔ kyee dik djas, kɛkum ɛwala elɛl yii bikoko. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Kasɛka ɛ́, boo lɛmbɛ na pip-pip nadi tɔ Di na Dɛɛ, étɛp ɛbɛk dhɛŋ nɛ koo tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ, zokanyɛɛ kuku tak, kan pɛ ɛko, kɛkum pɛ si. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yezu zokazɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe, nyɛ náá: «Saagam, mɛ eenɔɔ sisim'am, djɛ é mɛmbɔ mɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.46 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 31:6">Mɛd 31.6</ref></char></char></note>.» Bhii nyɛ nalii mɛkpa menek ɛ, nyɛ eezɛsil eswos. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Dáa kukuma lɔɔg esodja nabee etɛp binek ɛ, nyɛ naaduwal Zɛɛb é ɛke náá: «Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mot'ak nabɛ ɛ́ mot epiki.» <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nazyɛ, zɛbee etɛp ee nadi esael é di tak ɔ, naabee esesɛɛ binek djas. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛsik mɛmbɔ kɔ elo, nɛ ghoŋ tɔ elyem. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Bɛsɔ ɛ Yezu djas nɛ boa nadus bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ pɛ kyee dik Ghalile ɔ, nadi ɛ́, ba ɛtsetaɛpe ebee esa djas nadi esael ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muu ɛ Yezu eedelaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot, din ɛ lɛ Zozɛf. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, mot dɛl Aelimate, dhiiti ghaada eYuda. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ tɛtɛ mot epiki. Nyɛ nadi ebwood náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb zyɛ. Ye nakoozodi náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ bɛdhil ɛ bot ɛ boo kwan eYuda, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààmyaal egeka ee boob ekukuma nanɔŋ ɛ nɛ sa bɛ nasa ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́ pɛ daa Pilat kɛwaab muu ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Bhii tak, Zozɛf zokasil muu ɛ Yezu é mɛlaaba, zɛwol yɛ tɔ bheeza na puu, nɛɛg yɛ tɔ ɛvit ɛ nakpakaa tɔ ghu ɛkok ɛ di náá, dhiiti muu dinaa ààpawaaa tin ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, dwoo ɛkoobal ɛ esonok étɛp dwoo saba. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ saba moo aakan. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Boa nadus bɛ nɛ Yezu pɛ kyee dik Ghalile ɔ eezɛtɔ́ lɔɔg wat bɛ nɛ Zozɛf. Bɔɔ zokabee ɛvit ɛ Yezu nɛ dáa bɛ nanɛɛg muu'ɛ tɔ tak ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛsik pɛ ghaada kɛkoobal bɛmul nɛ bɛmɛnanas. Dwoo saba, bɛ eezɛwala dáa etsi di elɛɛ ɛ.<figure style="fig" alt="On met Jésus au tombeau" file="WA03928b.tif" size="spanl" copy="Graham Wade" ref="23.53">Muu ɛ Yezu eedelaa</figure><verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Ɛgom ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Kɛɛŋ tɔ mɛlem mɛ dwoo yenga, wɔ gwaa, boa zɛtɔ́ pɛ ɛvit. Bɛ natɔ́ ɛ́ nɛ bɛmul nɛ bɛmɛnanas bɛ nasa ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Bɛ kabee tin ɛ́, ɛkok ɛ nadiilaa ɛvit nɛ yɛ ɛ moo ɛ́ mbiŋela ba ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ ɛvit. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Dáa bɛ kani tɔ ɛvit ɛ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabela muu ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Esiiza bɔɔ nadi ɛ́, ye moo mbɛs. É di'enek, bot ɛbá eezɛtuula bɛ, nɛ ekaad e na kas-kas. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Boa ɛ́ boosil mis pɛ si nɛ bwoo. Bot binɔk eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Étɛp yé bi di esaa mot di nɛ tsik ɔ tɔ myoŋ? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Nyɛ tokapɛ wak, nyɛ eezegom. Siizaka sa nyɛ nalɛɛ bin é sok bi nɛ nɔɔ nadi pɛ Ghalile ɛ: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />“Ye goka ɛ́ náá, bot ɛ mesyem mɛt Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot, bem nyɛ é mɛlaaba. Bhii mɛlu mɛlɛl, da nyɛ ɛ́ gom.”»<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Tin, bɛ eezɛtaala sa Yezu nalii nɛ nɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛdus pɛ ɛvit, sik pɛ dɛl, kɛbaŋa bɛdjekel kam nɛ ngɔt nalik ɔ, zɛnɔɔ bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel djas. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Boa ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ Maali moma dɛl ɛ Makdala, Zan zɛnɔɔ Maali nyɛɛg ɛ Zak. Bɛdhiiti boa nadi bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɔ, nabaazozɛlɛɛ bot ɛ lwoma etɛp binek ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ boa nazɛlɛɛ sok ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Deenek, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdyeebamyaal tɛp tak, bɔɔ nadi egek ɛ́ náá, etɛp ee boa binɔk nadi elɛɛ bɛ ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ etsal. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Tin, Pyɛɛd zokazɛwyɛl piya, sum kaab, tɔ́ pɛ ɛvit. Kuma nyɛ nakum é di tak ɛ, nyɛ eezɛmalal, gwyák tɔ ɛvit, ààbee muu. Nyɛ nazobee ɛ́ bɔɔ epes ekaad e na puu bɛ napil nyɛ tɔ tak ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, sik pɛ ndjaa é djoka kɔkɔ mbi sa nyɛ bee ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eetel nyel nɛ bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel ɛbá pɛ ze dɛl Emayus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />É dwoo tak wat, bɛdjekel ɛbá nadi etɔ́ pɛ dɛl Emayus, dɛl ɛ tak nadi etseta nɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ́ tyee ba mɛwala mɛmbá yii goŋ mɛko. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Bot ɛ tak nadi esɔs etɛp djas nadhaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Dáa bɛ nadi kuku kyeed é ɛtaŋal nɛ ɛsɔs ɛ, wɔ gwaa, Yezu nyɛ ɛmet zokazɛtiila pɛ yɔɔ, nyɛ eezɛni é lɔɔg'ɔɔ. Bɛ moo tin ekɛ sama wat. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Bɛ nadi ebee nyɛ, tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ sa wat nadipal bɛ mis, étɛp bɛ needi ààgwyak nyɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi kolii yé deenek gba-gba?» É di'enek, bɛ eezɛtyaa, mɛnyel nɛ ghoŋ tɔ elyem.<verse eid="LUK 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Ngɔt pak'ɔɔ, mot nadi edjóoaa Keleopas ɔ zokazɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Pɛ kɔ dɛl ɛ Yeluzalɛm djas, mot di ààgu etɛp ee sael penek tɔ mɛlu mak ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ wɔy wɔ ɛmet!» <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yezu eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Haaa ɛyé sael penek?» Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Sa nasael dum nɛ Yezu mot dɛl Nazalɛt ɛ! Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ mɛbwala ɛbuɛpe. Nyɛ nadi elyaal mɛbwala mɛ é mis ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ é mis mɛ bot ɛ́, tɔ mɛsa mɛ, nɛ tɔ etɛp ee nyɛ nadi elii-lii ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Bot ɛ di kɔ elo eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb bina ɔ, nɛ ekukuma bina naaka Yezu étɛp bɛ neepɛ́ɛ nyɛ epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee, da bhii tak, nyɛ ɛ́ kɛbemaa é mɛlaaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Bis nadi ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mot nawaazɛpɛk bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl é bhel ɔ. Saabɛgɔs ɛ́ náá, ye moo mos ɛ́ mɛlu mɛlɛl etɛp binek djas nazesael ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Bɛdhiiti boa tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ les eesa bis sa ɛdjoka. Ye bɛ ɛ́ bɛ eetɔ́ pɛ ɛvit tɔ ghooghom mɛlem. <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Deenek, bɛ ààpabee muu ɛ Yezu. Bɛ kazyɛ zɛlɛɛ bis ɛ́ náá, efofop naatuula bɛ, da lɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá, Yezu ɛ́ nɛ tsik! <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Bɛdhiiti pak'es zokatɔ́ pɛ ɛvit, bɛ kabela esonok ɛ́ dáa boa binɔk nazolɛɛ ɛ. Tin, bɛ nakadi ɛ́ ààbee Yezu.»<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />É di'enek, wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi tok nɛ etsoŋ, etɛɛ náá, ɛlyel ɛ bin nɛ ɛmyaal etɛp djas ee bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nalɛɛ ɛ! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààgoka náá, Mɛsia zuk é, da bhii tak nyɛ ɛ́ kani tɔ duma yɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Bhii tak, nyɛ moo tin ekaada bɛ etɛp ee djas nalɛɛaa dum nɛ nɛ tɔ Ekwyala ɛ. Nyɛ nakan ɛ́, tɔ etsi ɛ Moiiz, zɛnɔɔ Ekwyala e bɛdhiiti bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Dáa bɛ nadi, bɛ moo kunaa nɛ dɛl ɛ bɛ nadi etɔ́ ɛ, Yezu eezɛsa tyee náá, nyɛ nadi edhaa yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Tin, bɛ eezɛbee nyɛ, bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Pookosulal sama nɛ nes wak, etɛɛ náá, dwoo eezesila. Ɛgwyitok moo aagwyiidela.» Tin, nyɛ eezɛmyaal ɛsulal é di wat bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Deenek, bɛ eezɛdisi kɔ mesa bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ. Bhii tak Yezu eezɛnɔɔ mapa, ghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛ eezɛpyak, nɔɔ yɛ, djɛ bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />É di'enek, mis mɔɔ eezɛbɛŋel, bɛ eezɛgwyak Yezu. Tin, wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛdiib bɛ é mis. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Bɛ moo tin esɔs pak'ɔɔ náá: «Elyem bina di ɛ́ tɔɔɔ nɛ mɛmyaala gba-gba, é sok nyɛ di ekaada mena sa Ekwyala nadi elɛɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />É di'enek wat, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛwyɛl ngbat, sik pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Bɛ eezɛbela bɛdjekel kam nɛ ngɔt é di wat bɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ lɔɔg'ɔɔ, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />é keke náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, Ghɛŋ eegom bhis ɛsyee! Simɔŋ bɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eebee nyɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Tin, bɛdjekel bɛbá binɔk eezɛni ebaŋa bɛ dáa ye nadhaa nɛ nɔɔ pɛ bɛ nadus ɛ, nɛ dáa bɛ nakagwyak Yezu é sok nyɛ napyak mapa ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eelyaal nyel nɛ bɛdjekel djas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Dwoo tak wat bikoko, dáa bɛdjekel nadi bɛ dinaa esɔs pak'ɔɔ ɛ, Yezu nyɛ ɛmet eezɛtuula tɔ lɔɔ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Egwyem di nɛ nen!» <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Tin, bɛdjekel djas moo epwak, bɛ moo ɛ́ nɛ bwoo. Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, bɛ nagu ɛ́ náá, bɛ eebee dim, ghuna yɛ ɛ́ Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Yezu kake nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ náá: «Étɛp yé bi di epwak? Étɛp yé bi di nɛ mɛso tɔ elyem? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Gwyákeka mɛmbɔ mam, nɛ mɛko mam! Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ yɛ ɛ́ mam, bwooka mɛ, da bi ɛ́ gwyák mɛ! Dim tok nɛ epuud nɛ egwyes dáa mam, dáa bi di bee'aak.» <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ deenek, nyɛ eezɛlyaal bɛ mɛmbɔ nɛ mɛko mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Tin, dáa bɛdjekel nadi tɔ mɛmyaala nɛ ɛdjoka ɛ, bɛ nadi ɛ́, bɛ dinaa ààmyaal ɛnyɔɛpe náá, Yezu eegom. É di'enek, wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi ɛ́ nɛ edee e dek wak é?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Tin, bɛ eezɛdjɛ nyɛ pes su ndika. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛnɔɔ yɛ náá, dɛ é mis mɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «É sok mena nadika mena dinaa é di wat ɛ, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́, mɛ naalɛɛ bin náá: “Etɛp djas di kwyala kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam tɔ etsi ɛ Moiiz nɛ tɔ bɛmɛkana mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ tɔ mɛkana mɛ Mɛdjeeb ɛ́ waasael djas.”» <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛdjɛ bɛ etsoŋ, étɛp bɛ neemɛt ɛnyɔɛpe mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Beeka sa zekwyalel ɛ́: Ye goka ɛ́ Mɛsia zuk, da nyɛ ɛ́ gom mɛlu mɛlɛl bhis ɛsyee. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Nɛ din ɛ lɛ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bɛ goola nɛ bot ɛ membyak djas Mbɛɛ Bhaadal kana pɛ Yeluzalɛm, bɛ lɛɛ bot náá, bɛ liig elyem. Tin, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waapel mesyem mɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Biyɔ ɛ́ kwaadi bɛtyaasɛs esesɛɛ ee bi zebee ɛ djas. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Bhii tak, mam ɛmet ɛ́ waadhis bin sa Saagam nakɛk ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ bɛmet ɔɔ, dika tɔ ghaada, étɛp ɛbwood náá, Zɛɛb djɛ bin ghwyil aadus pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eebyet tɔ gwoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Bhii tak, Yezu eewyis bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ tɔ ghaada, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ é ngwoob dɛl Bhetani. É di'enek, nyɛ ɛ́ booben mɛmbɔ pɛ ɛko, sɛɛ bɛ mɛtel. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />É sok nyɛ nadi esɛɛ bɛ mɛtel ɛ, nyɛ eezɛbɛka nɛ nɔɔ, byet tɔ gwoo.<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus est monté dans le ciel" file="WA03935b.tif" size="col" loc="24.51" copy="Graham Wade" ref="24.51">Yezu eebyet tɔ gwoo</figure><verse eid="LUK 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />É di'enek, bɛdjekel ɛ́ booduwal nyɛ, bula pɛ Yeluzalɛm tɔ boo mɛmyaala. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Bɛ nakadidi ɛ́ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa mɛlu djas, étɛp ɛduwal ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>